tips_karma_3="Live every minute of your life, and the seconds between."
tips_karma_4=Walking around drunk…
tips_karma_5="Not a single coin escaped his grasp, even in death."
tips_karma_6="A man may recite poetry, but it does not make him a poet."
tips_karma_7="He had the cunning heart of a demon."
tips_karma_8="He believed that a swing of a sword solved every problem."
tips_karma_9="She was bold and kind, and the world did not honor her enough."
tips_karma_10=Helping others and cultivating your skills will lead to good fortune.
tips_karma_11="He trained into the night, neither eating nor resting."
tips_karma_12="A kind heart is as rare as a straight road."
tips_karma_13="Be kind, and be content."
tips_karma_14="Be kind, and challenge ignorance."
tips_karma_15="Determination will always defeat talent."
tips_karma_16="Reckless greed is both a reward and a punishment."
tips_karma_17="The drunkard is the problem, not the drink."
tips_karma_18="The spirit of a good man outshines the sun."
tips_karma_20="Grow old seeking wisdom, and you will not die alone."
tips_karma_21="The heart must be fed with kindness and kind acts."
tips_karma_22="Kindness nourishes dry soil."
tips_karma_23="Seek to be wise rather than clever."
tips_karma_24="Diligence is better than humility."
tips_karma_25="They only saw his smile, and not what lay beneath."
tips_karma_26="She would have traded everyone she knew for one more golden coin."
tips_karma_27="I have kissed a thousand nameless lips."
tips_karma_28="He never drank, and was always drunk."
tips_karma_29="Cruelty is contagious."
