desc_buf_ng_sl_002_4_ngtips=Each starting movement will shock surrounding targets. The the higher your Brawn, the more damage you will cause.
desc_buf_ng_sl_003_1_ngtips=The skill contains Buddha Dharma, which warns people. Each attack will have a chance to trigger the Animitta condition, and understand one of four marks.<br><font color="#FF0000">(Only chivalrous people can understand this condition.)</font>
desc_buf_ng_sl_003_2_ngtips=The skill contains Buddha Dharma, which warns people. Each attack will have a chance to trigger the Animitta condition, and understand two of four marks.<br/><font color="#FF0000">(Only chivalrous people can understand this condition.)</font>
desc_buf_ng_sl_003_3_ngtips=The skill contains Buddha Dharma, which warns people. Each attack will have a chance to trigger the Animitta condition, and understand three of four marks.<br/><font color="#FF0000">(Only chivalrous people can understand this condition.)</font>
desc_buf_ng_sl_003_4_ngtips=The skill contains Buddha Dharma, which warns people. Each attack will have a chance to trigger the Animitta condition, and understand all four marks.<br/><font color="#FF0000">(Only chivalrous people can understand this condition.)</font>
desc_buf_ng_wd_001_1_ngtips=When being attacked, you have 10% chance to absorb 100 damage points using chi. When chi is broken or disappears, some internal energy will recover.
desc_buf_ng_wd_001_2_ngtips=When being attacked, you have 10% chance to absorb 150 damage points using chi. When chi is broken or disappears, some internal energy will recover.
desc_buf_ng_wd_001_3_ngtips=When being attacked, you have 10% chance to absorb 210 damage points using chi. When chi is broken or disappears, some internal energy will recover.
desc_buf_ng_wd_001_4_ngtips=When being attacked, you have 10% chance to absorb 250 damage points using chi. When chi is broken or disappears, some internal energy will recover.
desc_buf_ng_wd_002_1_ngtips=When Energy is less than 40%, each attack will have a 12% chance to recover 2% Energy.<br/>When Energy is over 40%, each attack will add damage with a value of 2% of your current Energy.
desc_buf_ng_wd_002_2_ngtips=When Energy is less than 40%, each attack will have a 16% chance to recover 2% Energy.<br/>When Energy is over 40%, each attack will add damage with a value of 3% of your current Energy.
desc_buf_ng_wd_002_3_ngtips=When Energy is less than 40%, each attack will have a 20% chance to recover 2% Energy.<br/>When Energy is over 40%, each attack will add damage with a value of 4% of your current Energy.
desc_buf_ng_wd_002_4_ngtips=Attacks have a 20% chance to recover 2% Energy. Each attack adds 4% Energy damage.
desc_buf_ng_wd_003_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Protection of Golden Tanden</font>: Get attacked when HP is lower than 30%, recover 30% Max HP for 6 seconds, 200 second cool down.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Boundless</font>: Increase Whirlwind Step launch speed by 3.
desc_buf_ng_wd_003_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Pill Tides Over Disaster</font>: Get attacked when HP is lower than 30%, recover 30% Max HP for 6 seconds, 150 second cool down.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Shangqing Wuji</font>: Increase Whirlwind Step launch speed by 3.
desc_buf_ng_wd_003_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Pill Tides Over Disaster</font>: Get attacked when HP is lower than 30%, recover 30% Max HP for 5 seconds, 120 second cool down.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Shangqing Wuji</font>: Increase Whirlwind Step launch speed by 3.
desc_buf_ng_wd_003_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Pill Tides Over Disaster</font>: Get attacked when HP is lower than 30%, recover 30% Max HP for 5 seconds, 100 second cool down.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Shangqing Wuji</font>: Increase Whirlwind Step launch speed by 3.
desc_buf_ng_em_001_1_ngtips=Block an extra 15 points of Internal Damage and 12 points of External Damage when Parrying.
desc_buf_ng_em_001_2_ngtips=Block an extra 30 points of Internal Damage and 16 points of External Damage when Parrying.
desc_buf_ng_em_001_3_ngtips=Block an extra 45 points of Internal Damage and 22 points of External Damage when Parrying.
desc_buf_ng_em_001_4_ngtips=Block an extra 90% Internal Damage and 70% External Damage when Parrying.
desc_buf_ng_em_002_1_ngtips=Activate inner energy, it will absorb 120 points of damage every 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_em_002_2_ngtips=Activate inner energy, it will absorb 180 points of damage every 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_em_002_3_ngtips=Activate inner energy, it will absorb 260 points of damage every 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_em_002_4_ngtips=Activate inner energy, it will absorb 300 points of damage every 20 seconds, and will reflect damage if in "Energy Body Protection" state.
desc_buf_ng_em_003_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Comfort Meridians</font>: Each attack can recover 1% Max HP for 5 seconds.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Take A Breath In Air</font>: Can take a breath in air after using Jump Across the Cloud, lasts for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_em_003_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Comfort Meridians</font>: Each attack can recover 1.5% Max HP for 5 seconds.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Take A Breath In Air</font>: Can take a breath in air after using Jump Across the Cloud, lasts for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_em_003_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Comfort Meridians</font>: Each attack can recover 2% Max HP for 5 seconds.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Take A Breath In Air</font>: Can take a breath in air after using Jump Across the Cloud, lasts for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_em_003_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Comfort Meridians</font>: Each attack can recover 2% Max HP for 5 seconds, and there is a chance to recover double HP.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Take A Breath In Air</font>: Can take a breath in air after using Jump Across the Cloud, lasts for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_1_ngtips=Causes 50% extra Yang damage every 16 seconds when attacking. Also decreases target's move speed for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_2_ngtips=Causes 50% extra Yang damage every 13 seconds when attacking. Also decreases target's move speed for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_3_ngtips=Causes 50% extra Yang damage every 10 seconds when attacking. Also decreases target's move speed for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_001_4_ngtips=Causes 50% extra Yang damage every 8 seconds when attacking. Also decreases target's move speed for 3 seconds. Enemies around the target will lose 25% Movement Speed for 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_002_1_ngtips=Attacks and parries absorb force. When you have absorbed 9 levels of force, the next attack will release it, knocking the target down and dealing damage equal to its Brawn.
desc_buf_ng_gb_002_2_ngtips=Attacks and parries absorb force. When you have absorbed 7 levels of force, the next attack will release it, knocking the target down and dealing damage equal to its Brawn.
desc_buf_ng_gb_002_3_ngtips=Attacks and parries absorb force. When you have absorbed 6 levels of force, the next attack will release it, knocking the target down and dealing damage equal to its Brawn.
desc_buf_ng_gb_002_4_ngtips=Attacks and parries absorb force. When you have absorbed 5 levels of force, the next attack will release it, knocking the target down and dealing damage equal to its Brawn.
desc_buf_ng_gb_003_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dragon Roar</font>: Each attack has a chance to deal Yang damage. Brawn is based on 10% of your <font color="#FF3030">current</font> HP. (458 at most) <br/><font color="#FF3030">Recover</font>: Recover 7 Flying Skill points each second during Sit and Breathe, and can remove intoxication effects.
desc_buf_ng_gb_003_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dragon Roar</font>: Each attack has a chance to deal Yang damage. Brawn is based on 10% of your <font color="#FF3030">current</font> HP. (614 at most) <br/><font color="#FF3030">Recover</font>: Recover 7 Flying Skill points each second during Sit and Breathe, and can remove intoxication effects.
desc_buf_ng_gb_003_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dragon Roar</font>: Each attack has a chance to deal Yang damage. Brawn is based on 10% of your <font color="#FF3030">current</font> HP. (786 at most) <br/><font color="#FF3030">Recover</font>: Recover 7 Flying Skill points each second during Sit and Breathe, and can remove intoxication effects.
desc_buf_ng_gb_003_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dragon Roar</font>: Each attack has a chance to deal Yang damage. Brawn is based on 10% of your <font color="#FF3030">current</font> HP. (983 at most) <br/><font color="#FF3030">Recover</font>: Recover 7 Flying Skill points each second during Sit and Breathe, and can remove intoxication effects.
desc_buf_ng_jy_001_1_ngtips=Deals continuous damage to target and reduces target's HP recovery speed by 50%. Lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_001_2_ngtips=Deals continuous damage to target and reduces target's HP recovery speed by 50%. Lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_001_3_ngtips=Deals continuous damage to target and reduces target's HP recovery speed by 50%. Lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_001_4_ngtips=Deals continuous damage to target and reduces target's HP recovery speed by 100%. Lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_003_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Deadly Strike</font>: Each attack will have a chance to store 1 piece of killing will. Increase 9 Brawn. When you have 7 killing wills, the next attack will to deal external damage with strength based on your Brawn. Deal 8% extra damage when target's HP is lower than 20%.<br><font color="#FF3030">Centaur</font>: Increase duration of Sprint by 100%.
desc_buf_ng_jy_003_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Deadly Strike</font>: Each attack will have a chance to store 1 piece of killing will. Increase 12 Brawn. When you have 7 killing wills, the next attack will to deal external damage with strength based on your Brawn. Deal 8% extra damage when target's HP is lower than 20%.<br><font color="#FF3030">Centaur</font>: Increase duration of Sprint by 100%.
desc_buf_ng_jy_003_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Deadly Strike</font>: Each attack will have a chance to store 1 piece of killing will. Increase 15 Brawn. When you have 7 killing wills, the next attack will to deal external damage with strength based on your Brawn. Deal 8% extra damage when target's HP is lower than 20%.<br><font color="#FF3030">Centaur</font>: Increase duration of Sprint by 100%.
desc_buf_ng_jy_003_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Deadly Strike</font>: Each attack will have a chance to store 1 piece of killing will. Increase 15 Brawn. When you have 7 killing wills, the next attack will to deal external damage with strength based on your Brawn. Deal 8% extra damage when target's HP is lower than 20%.<br><font color="#FF3030">Centaur</font>: Increase duration of Sprint by 100%.
desc_buf_ng_jz_001_1_ngtips=40% chance to recover Energy. The higher your Breath stat, the more Energy you will recover.
desc_buf_ng_jz_001_2_ngtips=40% chance to recover Energy. The higher your Breath stat, the more Energy you will recover.
desc_buf_ng_jz_001_3_ngtips=40% chance to recover Energy. The higher your Breath stat, the more Energy you will recover.
desc_buf_ng_jz_001_4_ngtips=40% chance to recover Energy. The higher your Breath stat, the more Energy you will recover. Slight chance to recover Energy continuously.
desc_buf_ng_jz_002_1_ngtips=Increase Movement Speed by 18%, and adds extra damage to attacks. The faster your attack speed, the more damage you will cause.
desc_buf_ng_jz_002_2_ngtips=Increase Movement Speed by 23%, and adds extra damage to attacks. The faster your attack speed, the more damage you will cause.
desc_buf_ng_jz_002_4_ngtips=Increase Movement Speed by 33%, and adds extra damage to attacks. The faster your attack speed, the more damage you will cause, strong power may even knock you target over.
desc_buf_ng_jz_003_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Forget Self and Sword</font>: Chance to increase 2 damage on each attack, and increase extra 2 damage for 2 seconds, last 20 seconds.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Swordsmanship</font>: Increase 13 damage when using a sword weapon.
desc_buf_ng_jz_003_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Forget Sword and Yourself</font>: Chance to increase 3 damage on each attack, and increase extra 3 damage for 2 seconds, lasts 20 seconds.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Swordsmanship</font>: Increase 18 damage when using a sword weapon.
desc_buf_ng_jz_003_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Forget Sword and Yourself</font>: Chance to increase 4 damage on each attack, and increase extra 4 damage for 2 seconds, lasts 20 seconds.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Swordsmanship</font>: Increase 24 damage when using a sword weapon.
desc_buf_ng_jz_003_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Forget Sword and Yourself</font>: Chance to increase 5 damage on each attack, and increase extra 5 damage for 2 seconds, lasts 20 seconds.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Swordsmanship</font>: Increase 30 damage when using a sword weapon.
desc_buf_ng_jl_001_1_ngtips=Adds Double Weapon Damage to next attack after each 6 attacks.
desc_buf_ng_jl_001_2_ngtips=Adds Double Weapon Damage to next attack after each 5 attacks.
desc_buf_ng_jl_001_3_ngtips=Adds Double Weapon Damage to next attack after each 4 attacks.
desc_buf_ng_jl_001_4_ngtips=Adds Double Weapon Damage to next attack after each 4 attacks.
desc_buf_ng_jl_002_1_ngtips=Each attack will inject Chi into the target's body. After 15 times, the target will be absent-minded for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_002_2_ngtips=Each attack will inject Chi into the target's body. After 12 times, the target will be absent-minded for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_002_3_ngtips=Each attack will inject Chi into the target's body. After 10 times, the target will be absent-minded for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_002_4_ngtips=Each attack will inject Chi into the target's body. After 10 times, the target will be absent-minded for 3.5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_003_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Take Soul Away</font>: After 6 attacks, the following 3 attacks will recover your HP. The value of recovered HP is equal to 30% of dealt damage.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Joined Happiness</font>: Use to finish team practice, recover 2 extra Flying Skill points each second, lasts 60 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_jl_003_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Take Soul Away</font>: After 6 attacks, the following 3 attacks will recover your HP. The value of recovered HP is equal to 40% of dealt damage.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Joined Happiness</font>: Use to finish team practice, recover 2 extra Flying Skill points each second, lasts 60 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_jl_003_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Take Soul Away</font>: After 6 attacks, the following 4 attacks will recover your HP. The value of recovered HP is equal to 40% of dealt damage.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Joined Happiness</font>: Use to finish team practice, recover 2 extra Flying Skill points each second, lasts 60 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_jl_003_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Take Soul Away</font>: After 6 attacks, the following 4 attacks will recover your HP. The value of recovered HP is equal to 50% of dealt damage.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Joined Happiness</font>: Use to finish team practice, recover 2 extra Flying Skill points each second, lasts 60 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_jl_003s_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Joined Happiness</font>: Use to finish team practice, recover 2 extra Flying Skill points each second, lasts 60 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_tm_001_1_ngtips=After every 8 attacks, the next attack will recover 5% of your max Energy.
desc_buf_ng_tm_001_2_ngtips=After every 7 attacks, the next attack will recover 5% of your max Energy.
desc_buf_ng_tm_001_3_ngtips=After every 6 attacks, the next attack will recover 5% of your max Energy.
desc_buf_ng_tm_001_4_ngtips=After every 5 attacks, the next attack will recover 5% of your max Energy and repel the target.
desc_buf_ng_tm_002_1_ngtips=Critical Hit damage increases by 20%.
desc_buf_ng_tm_002_2_ngtips=Critical Hit damage increases by 35%.
desc_buf_ng_tm_002_3_ngtips=Critical Hit damage increases by 50%.
desc_buf_ng_tm_002_4_ngtips=Increase critical hit damage by 60%. Cause extra damage with critical hits, lasts 8 secs. The higher your Dexterity, the more damage you will cause.
desc_buf_ng_tm_003_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Tangmen's Strange Poison</font>: Each attack has a chance to store poison. When you have 3 poisons, it can be injected into your target with your next attack: Deal 18 Yin damage each second, and when it ends, the poison will deal 144 Yin damage and reduce 50% Movement Speed, and cannot use flying skills. <font color="#00FF00">(Damage is increased with greater Ranged Damage.)</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Poison Distinguish Expert</font>: 10% chance to be immune from poison effects.
desc_buf_ng_tm_003_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Tangmen's Strange Poison</font>: Each attack has a chance to store poison. When you have 3 poisons, it can be injected into your target with your next attack: Deal 25 Yin damage each second, and when it ends, the poison will deal 200 Yin damage and reduce 50% Movement Speed, and cannot use flying skills. <font color="#00FF00">(Damage is increased with greater Ranged Damage.)</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Poison Distinguish Expert</font>: 10% chance to be immune from poison effects.
desc_buf_ng_tm_003_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Tangmen's Strange Poison</font>: Each attack has a chance to store poison. When you have 3 poisons, it can be injected into your target with your next attack: Deal 31 Yin damage each second, and when it ends, the poison will deal 248 Yin damage and reduce 50% Movement Speed, and cannot use flying skills. <font color="#00FF00">(Damage is increased with greater Ranged Damage.)</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Poison Distinguish Expert</font>: 10% chance to be immune from poison effects.
desc_buf_ng_tm_003_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Tangmen's Strange Poison</font>: Each attack has a chance to store poison. When you have 3 poisons, it can be injected into your target with your next attack: Deal 39 Yin damage each second, and when it ends, the poison will deal 312 Yin damage and reduce 50% Movement Speed, and cannot use flying skills. <font color="#00FF00">(Damage is increased with greater Ranged Damage.)</font><br/><font color="#FF3030">Poison Distinguish Expert</font>: 10% chance to be immune from poison effects.
