tips_skill_level=Can be raised to Level {@0:num}
tips_xinde_1=Gained Experience:
tips_gembattle_4=Action Points: Action points are required to attack or defend with tools.
tips_sh_kg_zheng_1=Learn "Mining Manual", and you can collect twice the ore during the validity period.
tips_sh_qf_zheng_1=Learn the "Woodcutting Script", and you can collect double the amount of wood until it expires.
tips_sh_yf_zheng_1=Learn the "Fishing Script", and you can collect double the amount of fish until it expires.
tips_sh_nf_zheng_1=Learn the "Planter Record", and you can harvest double the amount of plants until it expires.
tips_sh_lh_zheng_1=Learn "Hunting Manuals", and you can skin triple the amount of animals until it expires.
tips_sh_ys_zheng_1=Learn the "Herbal Classic", and you can collect double the amount of herbs until it expires.
tips_sh_ds_zheng_1=Buy the "Poison Manual", and you can collect double the amount of poisonous herbs until it expires.
tips_sh_kg_zheng_2=Buy the "Mining Manual" in the store and study it. Then you can collect twice the ore.
tips_sh_qf_zheng_2=Buy the "Woodcutting Script", and you can collect double the amount of wood until it expires.
tips_sh_yf_zheng_2=Buy the "Fishing Script", and you can collect double the amount of fish until it expires.
tips_sh_nf_zheng_2=Buy the "Planter Record", and you can harvest double the amount of plants until it expires.
tips_sh_lh_zheng_2=Buy "Hunting Manuals", and you can skin triple the amount of animals until it expires.
tips_sh_ys_zheng_2=Buy the "Herbal Classic", and you can collect double the amount of poisonous herbs until it expires.
tips_sh_ds_zheng_2=Learn the "Poison Manual", and you can collect double the amount of poisonous herbs until it expires.
tips_obj_distance=Distance: {@0:ToInt} Meters
tips_ng_limit=<font color="{@0:color}">Internal Skill Attributes</font>
tips_repairself_single=The option to automatically repair individual pieces of armor and equipment applies to the items both in the tab and in your inventory.
tips_repairself_all=The option to automatically repair your armor applies only to the pieces of armor in the tab.
