tips_buff_schoolwar_ygdz01=Morale Boost: Basic Parry increased by 100%; Max HP increased by 1000; damage done increased by 10%; 10% chance of triggering Super Armor when attacked; Life Skill Speed increased by 1.
tips_buff_schoolwar_ygdz02=Triumphant Sweep: Basic Parry increased by 200%; Max HP increased by 2000; damage inflicted increased by 10%; 20% chance of triggering super armor when attacked; Life Skill speed increased by 3.
tips_buff_schoolwar_ygdz03=The Call of Bravery: Basic Parry increased by 300%; Max HP increased by 3000; damage inflicted increased by 30%; 30% chance of triggering Super Armor when attacked; Life Skill speed increased by 5.
tips_buff_schoolwar_ygdz04=Royal Guard: Basic Parry increased by 400%; Max HP increased by 4000; damage inflicted increased by 30%; 40% chance of triggering Super Armor when attacked, Life Skill speed increased by 7.
tips_buff_schoolwar_ygdz05=Hero Enchant: Basic Parry increased by 500%; Max HP increased by 5000; Damage inflicted increased by 50%; 50% chance of triggering Super Armor when attacked; Life Skill speed increased by 9.
