desc_buf_ng_jh_208_1_ngtips=When attack is not parried, obtain <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font> Qi. Each level can enhance 1.5% attack, damage continues for 16 seconds, it can be stacked 8 times. If the attack is parried, Chi scatters, losing a level of <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font> Qi.<br/><font color="#9932CD">Against Worldly Evil:</font> <font color="#FF3030">When "Evil"</font> Qi scatters, self potential may be activated, improving defensive capacity by 50% within certain time, at the same time, all additional tender damage of attack continues for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_2_ngtips=When attack is not parried, obtain <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font> Qi. Each level can enhance 1.5% attack, damage continues for 16 seconds, it can be stacked 9 times. If the attack is parried, Chi scatters, losing a level of <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font> Qi effect.<br/><font color="#9932CD">Against Worldly Evil:</font> <font color="#FF3030">When "Evil"</font> Qi scatters, self potential may be activated, improving defensive capacity by 50% within certain time, at the same time, all additional tender damage of attack continues for 9 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_3_ngtips=When attack is not parried, obtain <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font> Qi. Each level can enhance 1.5% attack, damage continues for 16 seconds, it can be stacked 10 times. If the attack is parried, Chi scatters, losing a level of <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font> Qi effect.<br/><font color="#9932CD">Against Worldly Evil:</font> <font color="#FF3030">When "Evil"</font> Qi scatters, self potential may be activated, improving defensive capacity by 50% within certain time, at the same time, all additional tender damage of attack continues for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_4_ngtips=When attack is not parried, obtain <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font> Qi. Each level can enhance 1.5% attack, damage continues for 16 seconds, it can be stacked 11 times. If the attack is parried, Chi scatters, losing a level of <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font> Qi effect.<br/><font color="#9932CD">Against Worldly Evil:</font> <font color="#FF3030">When "Evil"</font> Qi scatters, self potential may be activated, improving defensive capacity by 50% within certain time, at the same time, all additional tender damage of attack continues for 11 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_5_ngtips=When attack is not parried, obtain <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font> Qi. Each level can enhance 1.5% attack, damage continues for 16 seconds, it can be stacked 13 times. If the attack is parried, Chi scatters, losing a level of <font color="#FF3030">"Evil"</font> Qi effect.<br/><font color="#9932CD">Against Worldly Evil:</font> <font color="#FF3030">When "Evil"</font> Qi scatters, self potential may be activated, improving defensive capacity by 50% within certain time, at the same time, all additional tender damage of attack continues for 12 seconds.
