tips_xinde_2=The obtained Reflections/The required total Reflections in current Identity.<br>The remaining available Reflections today: {@0:可得心得}<br>(You can get max accumulation of Reflections that day if you login in game every day.)<br>Hint: the Professional Book "Time Saving" can quickly help you get the Reflections. The remaining Reading Times today: <font color="#08E905">{@2:数值}</font> times.<br>The points on the current Ranking List: {@1:积分}.
desc_tvt_skill_touxi_0=Sneak behind the Enemy: Use on an Intelligence Disciple to take 3 pieces of intelligence from them. Use it on a Patrolling Disciple to take their School Token. It has a large margin of error. If you fail while using it, your Exposure Value  will increase by 100 points.
desc_tvt_skill_toudao_0=Kong Kong's Gifted Hands: Use on an Intelligence Disciple to take 1 piece of intelligence from them. It has a large margin of error. If you fail while using it, your Exposure Value  will increase by 20 points.
desc_tvt_skill_gangrao_0=Steal the Sun: Transitional phantom can steal the sun. Use it to the Intelligence Disciple when spying can have a higher chance to get 3 pieces of intelligence and some certain chance to get the enemy's Level 1 Internal Skills breakthrough tips. If you fail to use it, you will increase 50 Stealth Value. (Using this skill needs to consume one piece of Transitional Phantom Pill. You can buy the Transitional Phantom Pill from the Elite Patrolling Disciples with little official silver.
desc_tvt_skill_soucha_0=Develop a Sharp Eye for Discovering Able People: Use on payers during Patrol Events. If used successfully, it will increase the Exposure Value of a spy by 30 points.
desc_tvt_skill_kengdiesc_0=See through the Secret: Be familiar with the enemy's conditions. You can directly see through the spy. You can use it to every players in the Patrolling Event. If you use it successfully, it can increase 80 Stealth Value of the spy. (It will consume a piece of Intelligence Sealed Letter. You can buy the Intelligence Sealed Letter from the Elite Patrolling Disciples by with official silver.)
tvt_skill_gangrao=Flying Locust Asking the Way
