tips_eqp_damref_2=Can reflect a certain amount of damage back at target.
tips_eqp_blink_1_1=May confuse target during attack, making it difficult for them to attack or evade.
tips_eqp_blink_1b_1=Can cause opponent to be dazed during attack, so it is difficult for them to hit or evade.
tips_eqp_blink_1c_1=Can cause opponent to be dazed during attack, so it is difficult for them to hit or evade.
tips_eqp_chao_1_1=Target becomes confused, not allowing them to ascertain direction.
tips_eqp_chao_1b_1=Can cause opponent to be blurred during attack, so they cannot tell which direction they are going.
tips_eqp_chao_1c_1=Can cause opponent to be blurred during attack, so they cannot tell which direction they are going.
tips_eqp_chao_necklace_1=Can cause opponent to be blurred during attack, so they cannot tell which direction they are going.
