tips_eqp_clo_01_1=Receive Treasure Cloak Protection after being attacked 10 times in a row. May be triggered once during a certain period of time.
tips_eqp_clo_02_1=When attacked, chance of poisoning the target. The expended energy is doubled.
tips_eqp_hel_01_1=Chance to receive 10 rage points when attacked.
tips_eqp_pants_01a_1=Chance to receive 10 Flying Skill points when attacked.
tips_eqp_shoes_01_1=After using a Flying Skill, chance of increasing running speed for 5 seconds. Can be triggered once during a certain period of time.
tips_eqp_t1_00_1=Activates when wearing 6 or more pieces of Oceanic Black Dragon ornaments: Chance decrease target's accuracy and evasion rate.
tips_eqp_t2_00_1=Activates when wearing 6 or more pieces of Underworld White Tiger ornaments: Chance to poison target, restraining their movement and ability to parry.
tips_eqp_t2_000_1=Activates when wearing 6 or more pieces of Burning Tears ornaments: Chance to poison target, restraining their movement and ability to parry.
tips_eqp_t3_000_1=Activates when wearing 6 or more pieces of Pool Wave ornaments: Chance to numb target's meridian with the possibility to paralyze after 5 times.
tips_eqp_wp_01_1=When attacking, chance to stop target from losing Chi and HP. Active for 20 seconds. During this time, the opponent cannot recover Chi and HP on their own.
tips_eqp_wp_02_1=When attacking, chance to block target's Chi and HP while decreasing their parry endurance recovery speed.
tips_eqp_wp_03_1=When attacking, chance to knock target unconscious.
tips_eqp_wp_04_1=When attacking, chance to stop target from using Flying Skills.
tips_eqp_wp_05_1=When attacking, chance to damage target's weapon.
tips_eqp_wp_06_1=When attacking, chance to stop target from parrying.
tips_eqp_wp_07_1=When attacking, chance to decrease external skill strength.
tips_eqp_clo_01_2=After being attacked 10 times in a row, receive treasure cloak protection to reduce damage received. Can only be triggered once during a certain period of time.
tips_eqp_clo_02_2=When attacked, there is a chance of poisoning the opponent so that they cannot breathe easily. The expended energy is increased by 2 times.
tips_eqp_hel_01_2=Possibility of getting 10 rage points when attacked.
tips_eqp_pants_01a_2=Possibility of getting 10 flying skill points when attacked.
tips_eqp_shoes_01_2=After using flying skill, chance of increasing running speed for 5 seconds. Can only be triggered once during a certain period of time.
tips_eqp_wp_01_2=During attack, chance of scratching the opponent so that they can't stop loosing Chi and Blood, lasting for 20 seconds. During this time, the opponent cannot recover Chi and Blood on their own.
tips_eqp_wp_02_2=During attack, chance of blocking the opponent's Chi and Blood, reducing their parry endurance recovery speed.
tips_eqp_wp_03_2=During attack, chance of knocking the opponent unconscious.
tips_eqp_wp_04_2=During attack, chance of making the opponent breathe irregularly so that they cannot use flying skills.
tips_eqp_wp_05_2=During attack, chance of damaging the opponent's weapon.
tips_eqp_wp_06_2=During attack, chance of making the opponent unable to parry.
tips_eqp_wp_07_2=During attack, chance of making the opponent's limbs weak so that their external skill strength is greatly reduced.
tips_eqp_wrist_01_2=After parrying the attack, chance to enhance parry effect for 6 seconds.
tips_eqp_clo_01_3=After being attacked 10 times in a row, receive treasure cloak protection to reduce damage received. Can only be triggered once during a certain period of time.
tips_eqp_clo_02_3=When attacked, there is a chance of poisoning the opponent so that they cannot breathe easily. The expended energy is increased by 2 times.
tips_eqp_hel_01_3=Possibility of getting 10 rage points when attacked.
tips_eqp_pants_01a_3=Possibility of getting 10 flying skill points when attacked.
tips_eqp_shoes_01_3=After using flying skill, chance of increasing running speed for 5 seconds. Can only be triggered once during a certain period of time.
tips_eqp_wp_01_3=During attack, chance of scratching the opponent so that they can't stop loosing Chi and Blood, lasting for 20 seconds. During this time, the opponent cannot recover Chi and Blood on their own.
tips_eqp_wp_02_3=During attack, chance of blocking the opponent's Chi and Blood, reducing their parry endurance recovery speed.
tips_eqp_wp_03_3=During attack, chance of knocking the opponent unconscious.
tips_eqp_wp_04_3=During attack, chance of making the opponent breathe irregularly so that they cannot use flying skills.
