tips_eqp_wp_07_3=During attack, chance of making the opponent's limbs weak so that their external skill strength is greatly reduced.
tips_eqp_wrist_01_3=After parrying the attack, chance to enhance parry effect for 6 seconds.
tips_eqp_wt1_00_1=Activates when carrying a Writhing weapon and 2 Writhing rings: After a 6 or more hit combo, chance to temporarily increase critical hit and accuracy rate.
tips_eqp_wt1_000_1=Activates when carrying a Mesmerizing weapon and 2 Mesmerizing rings: After a 10 or more hit combo, chance to temporarily increase critical hit and accuracy.
tips_eqp_wt2_00_1=Activates when carrying a Dominance-directing weapon and 2 Dominance-directing rings: After a 6 or more hit combo, chance to disorder target's meridians, making them confused.
tips_eqp_wt2_000_1=Activates when carrying a Heart-crusher weapon and 2 Heart-crusher rings: After a 10 or more hit combo, chance to temporarily disorder target's meridians, making them confused.
tips_eqp_wt3_00_1=Activates when carrying a Heavenly Formula weapon and 2 Heavenly Formula rings: After a 6 or more hit combo, chance to temporarily ignore target's parries.
tips_eqp_wt3_000_1=Activates when carrying a Crimson Pearl weapon and 2 Crimson Pearl rings: After a 10 or more hit combo, chance to temporarily ignore target's parries.
tips_buff_battles1_weapon_0=Hitting the target will decrease their movement speed by 30%, their use of Flying Skills will expend 5 additional points and will drain 50 points of Chi and HP every second. Active for 8 seconds.
tips_eqp_clo_03_1=When attacked, chance decrease target's rage by 10 points.
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_1_ngtips=When you are attacked under forbid Flying Skills, paralyzed or faint status, you can continuously recover Chi and HP for 3 seconds. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze or cause faint will trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_2_ngtips=When you are attacked in the state of being forbidden from using flying skills, paralyzed, or faint, then you can continuously recover Chi and Blood for 3 seconds. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_3_ngtips=When you are attacked in the state of being forbidden from using flying skills, paralyzed, or faint, then you can continuously recover Chi and Blood for 3 seconds. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_4_ngtips=When you are attacked in the state of being forbidden from using flying skills, paralyzed, or faint, then you can continuously recover Chi and Blood for 3 seconds. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_5_ngtips=When you are attacked under forbid Flying Skills, paralyzed or faint status, you can continuously recover Chi and HP for 3 seconds and there is a chance that all the negative effects will be eliminated. (Direct attacks from targets that forbid Flying Skills, paralysis or deal faint status will trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_1_ngtips=Failing to parry a target's attack gives a chance to inflict <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> upon the opponent. Can be used up to 8 times and is active for 9 seconds. When<font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font>reaches level 8, the poison will explode and cause total poison damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_2_ngtips=When you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a chance of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be used 8 times at most. When<font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font>reaches level 8, the poison will explode and cause total poison damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_3_ngtips=When you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a chance of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be used 8 times at most. When<font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font>reaches level 8, the poison will explode and cause total poison damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_4_ngtips=When you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a chance of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be used 8 times at most. When<font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font>reaches level 8, the poison will explode and cause total poison damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_5_ngtips=When failing to parry a target, there is a chance to inflict <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> on the target. Can be stacked up to 8 times and active for 9 seconds. When <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> is stacked to level 8 the poison damage will accumulate, target's parry will be interrupted and they will be paralyzed for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_1_ngtips=Chance that parrying will trigger "Cold Heart Protection" effect: Parrying can recover Chi and HP for 4 seconds (Recovery amount is 170% of attack damage received, while the maximum is 50 points of the inner skill power's influence. Activates one time every 0.5 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_2_ngtips=Chance that parrying will trigger "Cold Heart Protection" effect: Parrying can recover Chi and HP for 5 seconds (Recovery amount is 190% of attack damage received, while the maximum is 100 points of the inner skill power's influence. Activates one time every 0.5 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_3_ngtips=Chance that parrying will trigger "Cold Heart Protection" effect: Parrying can recover Chi and HP for 6 seconds (Recovery amount is 210% of attack damage received, while the maximum is 170 points of the inner skill power's influence. Activates one time every 0.5 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_4_ngtips=Chance that parrying will trigger "Cold Heart Protection" effect: Parrying can recover Chi and HP for 7 seconds (Recovery amount is 230% of attack damage received, while the maximum is 236 points of the inner skill power's influence. Activates one time every 0.5 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_1_ngtips=When attacking, chance to deal additional damage with a continuous Chi and HP drain for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_2_ngtips=During attack, there is a certain chance that additional damage will be added and there will be continuous loss of Chi and Blood for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_3_ngtips=During attack, there is a certain chance that additional damage will be added and there will be continuous loss of Chi and Blood for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_4_ngtips=During attack, there is a certain chance that additional damage will be added and there will be continuous loss of Chi and Blood for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_5_ngtips=When attacking, chance to deal additional damage with a continuous Chi and HP drain for 8 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Until Death:</font>Target bleeds continuously and all recovery effects are decreased by 80%.
