tips_itemtype_250=Treasure of Jianghu
tips_ng_qlz_01=Chi Power Points:<br>When not in possession of the corresponding treasure,<br><s><s>activating internal skills cost 30 Chi Power points.<br><s><s>Continuous motion consumes 3 Chi Power points each minute.<br>When in possession of the corresponding treasure,<br><s><s>movement does not require Chi Power Points.<br><s><s>From 18:00 to 24:00, recover 1 Chi Power Point each minute.<br><s><s>The greater the internal skill cultivation, the faster the recovery time.
tips_ng_qlz_02=Chi Power Points: {@0:current}/{@1:maximum}
tips_ng_xw_01=Cultivation Progress: {@0:current}/{@1:maximum}
