desc_buf_ng_sl_004_1_ngtips=When attacked, you have a probability of reducing your current damage by 30%, and you also obtain a wisp of sandalwood incense. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Converting health: </font>When sandalwood incense encircles your body, an attack on you has a probability of clearing out dead blood (black streaks of blood), and converting it into Blood Stasis. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Improve Circulation: </font>After obtaining 5 wisps of sandalwood incense, 30% of your Blood Stasis will be restored to normal HP.
desc_buf_ng_sl_004_2_ngtips=When attacked, you have a probability of reducing your current damage by 35%, and you also obtain a wisp of sandalwood incense. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Converting health: </font>When sandalwood incense encircles your body, an attack on you has a probability of clearing out dead blood (black streaks of blood), and converting it into Blood Stasis. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Improve Circulation: </font>After obtaining 5 wisps of sandalwood incense, 34% of your Blood Stasis will be restored to normal HP.
desc_buf_ng_sl_004_3_ngtips=When attacked, you have a probability of reducing your current damage by 40%, and you also obtain a wisp of sandalwood incense. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Converting health: </font>When sandalwood incense encircles your body, an attack on you has a probability of clearing out dead blood (black streaks of blood), and converting it into Blood Stasis. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Improve Circulation: </font>After obtaining 5 wisps of sandalwood incense, 38% of your Blood Stasis will be restored to normal HP.
desc_buf_ng_sl_004_4_ngtips=When attacked, you have a probability of reducing your current damage by 45%, and you also obtain a wisp of sandalwood incense. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Converting health: </font>When sandalwood incense encircles your body, an attack on you has a probability of clearing out dead blood (black streaks of blood), and converting it into Blood Stasis. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Improve Circulation: </font>After obtaining 5 wisps of sandalwood incense, 42% of your Blood Stasis will be restored to normal HP.
desc_buf_ng_sl_004_5_ngtips=When attacked, you have a probability of reducing your current damage by 50%, and you also obtain a wisp of sandalwood incense. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Converting health: </font>When sandalwood incense encircles your body, an attack on you has a probability of clearing out dead blood (black streaks of blood), and converting it into Blood Stasis. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Improve Circulation: </font>After obtaining 4 wisps of sandalwood incense, 50% of your Blood Stasis will be restored to normal HP.
desc_buf_ng_wd_004_1_ngtips=When attacking, there is a probability that your target will receive a concussion: Will suffer additional Yang damage each time attacked, lasts 11 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Pure Yang Wuji: </font>When your target has a concussion, he will suffer Aggravated Internal Injury if, after 3 skill uses, he tries to use another skill: his skills are sealed and he cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. <br/>If Aggravated Internal Injury has not been set off, an extra Aggravated Internal Injury effect will occur after the end of concussion.
desc_buf_ng_wd_004_2_ngtips=When attacking, there is a probability that your target will receive a concussion: Will suffer additional Yang damage each time attacked, lasts 12 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Pure Yang Wuji: </font>When your target has a concussion, he will suffer Aggravated Internal Injury if, after 3 skill uses, he tries to use another skill: his skills are sealed and he cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. <br/>If Aggravated Internal Injury has not been set off, an extra Aggravated Internal Injury effect will occur after the end of concussion.
desc_buf_ng_wd_004_3_ngtips=When attacking, there is a probability that your target will receive a concussion: Will suffer additional Yang damage each time attacked, lasts 13 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Pure Yang Wuji: </font>When your target has a concussion, he will suffer Aggravated Internal Injury if, after 3 skill uses, he tries to use another skill: his skills are sealed and he cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. <br/>If Aggravated Internal Injury has not been set off, an extra Aggravated Internal Injury effect will occur after the end of concussion.
desc_buf_ng_wd_004_4_ngtips=When attacking, there is a probability that your target will receive a concussion: Will suffer additional Yang damage each time attacked, lasts 14 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Pure Yang Wuji: </font>When your target has a concussion, he will suffer Aggravated Internal Injury if, after 3 skill uses, he tries to use another skill: his skills are sealed and he cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. <br/>If Aggravated Internal Injury has not been set off, an extra Aggravated Internal Injury effect will occur after the end of concussion.
desc_buf_ng_wd_004_5_ngtips=When attacking, there is a probability that your target will receive a concussion: Will suffer additional Yang damage each time attacked, lasts 16 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Pure Yang Wuji: </font>When your target has a concussion, he will suffer Aggravated Internal Injury if, after 3 skill uses, he tries to use another skill: his skills are sealed and he cannot use Flying Skills for 3 seconds. <br/>If Aggravated Internal Injury has not been set off, an extra Aggravated Internal Injury effect will occur after the end of concussion.
desc_buf_ng_em_004_1_ngtips=While attacking a target, you have a probability of triggering a "Icy Assault," which will interrupt your target's Skill, and cause brief command lockout. <br/>When attacked, there is a probability of triggering <font color="#FF3030">Icy Jade Binding. </font>This will eliminate most negative effects, restore a small amount of Parry Endurance, Increase External parry and Internal Skill conversion by 9, and add Yin damage to Internal attack within 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_em_004_2_ngtips=While attacking a target, you have a probability of triggering a "Icy Assault," which will interrupt your target's Skill, and cause brief command lockout. <br/>When attacked, there is a probability of triggering <font color="#FF3030">Icy Jade Binding. </font>This will eliminate most negative effects, restore a small amount of Parry Endurance, Increase External parry and Internal Skill conversion by 12, and add Yin damage to Internal attack within 11 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_em_004_3_ngtips=While attacking a target, you have a probability of triggering a "Icy Assault," which will interrupt your target's Skill, and cause brief command lockout. <br/>When attacked, there is a probability of triggering <font color="#FF3030">Icy Jade Binding. </font>This will eliminate most negative effects, restore a small amount of Parry Endurance, Increase External parry and Internal Skill conversion by 15, and add Yin damage to Internal attack within 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_em_004_4_ngtips=While attacking a target, you have a probability of triggering a "Icy Assault," which will interrupt your target's Skill, and cause brief command lockout. <br/>When attacked, there is a probability of triggering <font color="#FF3030">Icy Jade Binding. </font>This will eliminate most negative effects, restore a small amount of Parry Endurance, Increase External parry and Internal Skill conversion by 18, and add Yin damage to Internal attack within 13 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_em_004_5_ngtips=While attacking a target, you have a probability of triggering a "Icy Assault," which will interrupt your target's Skill, and cause brief command lockout. <br/>When attacked, there is a probability of triggering <font color="#FF3030">Icy Jade Binding. </font>This will eliminate most negative effects, restore a small amount of Parry Endurance, Increase External parry and Internal Skill conversion by 18, and add Yin damage to Internal attack within 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_1_ngtips=When you start your attack, there is a chance you will invoke a "Wine Rain." When affected by "Wine Rain," your target's Internal and External Defense and Evasion will drastically decrease within 18 seconds, and his rate of Critical Hit will increase by 10%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Drunken: </font>When Wine Rain is triggered, you will enter a "Drunken" effect, continuously radiating the "Wine God" effect. You will use up one level of Wine God each time you use a move, and the remaining Wine God effect will result in extra Yang damage when you attack. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Sobering Up: </font>An attack when Wine God is in effect may trigger the "Sobering Up" effect, and your chance of a Critical Hit will increase by 10% for 7 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_2_ngtips=When you start your attack, there is a chance you will invoke a "Wine Rain." When affected by "Wine Rain," your target's Internal and External Defense and Evasion will drastically decrease within 20 seconds, and his rate of Critical Hit will increase by 12%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Drunken: </font>When Wine Rain is triggered, you will enter a "Drunken" effect, continuously radiating the "Wine God" effect. You will use up one level of Wine God each time you use a move, and the remaining Wine God effect will result in extra Yang damage when you attack. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Sobering Up: </font>An attack when Wine God is in effect may trigger the "Sobering Up" effect, and your chance of a Critical Hit will increase by 10% for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_3_ngtips=When you start your attack, there is a chance you will invoke a "Wine Rain." When affected by "Wine Rain," your target's Internal and External Defense and Evasion will drastically decrease within 22 seconds, and his rate of Critical Hit will increase by 14%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Drunken: </font>When Wine Rain is triggered, you will enter a "Drunken" effect, continuously radiating the "Wine God" effect. You will use up one level of Wine God each time you use a move, and the remaining Wine God effect will result in extra Yang damage when you attack. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Sobering Up: </font>An attack when Wine God is in effect may trigger the "Sobering Up" effect, and your chance of a Critical Hit will increase by 10% for 9 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_4_ngtips=When you start your attack, there is a chance you will invoke a "Wine Rain." When affected by "Wine Rain," your target's Internal and External Defense and Evasion will drastically decrease within 25 seconds, and his rate of Critical Hit will increase by 16%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Drunken: </font>When Wine Rain is triggered, you will enter a "Drunken" effect, continuously radiating the "Wine God" effect. You will use up one level of Wine God each time you use a move, and the remaining Wine God effect will result in extra Yang damage when you attack. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Sobering Up: </font>An attack when Wine God is in effect may trigger the "Sobering Up" effect, and your chance of a Critical Hit will increase by 10% for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_004_5_ngtips=When you start your attack, there is a chance you will invoke a "Wine Rain." When affected by "Wine Rain," your target's Internal and External Defense and Evasion will drastically decrease within 30 seconds, and his rate of Critical Hit will increase by 18%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Drunken: </font>When Wine Rain is triggered, you will enter a "Drunken" effect, continuously radiating the "Wine God" effect. You will use up one level of Wine God each time you use a move, and the remaining Wine God effect will result in extra Yang damage when you attack. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Sobering Up: </font>An attack when Wine God is in effect may trigger the "Sobering Up" effect, and your chance of a Critical Hit will increase by 10% for 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_1_ngtips=The "Murderous Pursuit" effect will occur after every 20 seconds: Chance of ignoring parry will increase 16% during next 7 attacks, and extra Hard damage will occur, ignoring target's parry. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Dark Sky Flips the Scale: </font>When directly attacked, you have a probability of gaining Burning Rage, which will reduce damage by 10%, and will last 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_2_ngtips=The "Murderous Pursuit" effect will occur after every 19 seconds: Chance of ignoring parry will increase 19% during next 8 attacks, and extra Hard damage will occur, ignoring target's parry. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Dark Sky Flips the Scale: </font>When directly attacked, you have a probability of gaining Burning Rage, which will reduce damage by 12%, and will last 23 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_3_ngtips=The "Murderous Pursuit" effect will occur after every 18 seconds: Chance of ignoring parry will increase 22% during next 9 attacks, and extra Hard damage will occur, ignoring target's parry. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Dark Sky Flips the Scale: </font>When directly attacked, you have a probability of gaining Burning Rage, which will reduce damage by 14%, and will last 26 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_4_ngtips=The "Murderous Pursuit" effect will occur after every 17 seconds: Chance of ignoring parry will increase 25% during next 10 attacks, and extra Hard damage will occur, ignoring target's parry. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Dark Sky Flips the Scale: </font>When directly attacked, you have a probability of gaining Burning Rage, which will reduce damage by 16%, and will last 29 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_004_5_ngtips=The "Murderous Pursuit" effect will occur after every 16 seconds: Chance of ignoring parry will increase 28% during next 12 attacks, and extra Hard damage will occur, ignoring target's parry. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Dark Sky Flips the Scale: </font>When directly attacked, you have a probability of gaining Burning Rage, which will reduce damage by 18%, and will last 32 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_004_1_ngtips=There is a probability of injecting your target with "Chi of Flying Flowers" during an attack, causing a small amount of Soft damage. There can be at most 2 bursts of Chi. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Shaking Branches: </font>"Chi of Flying Flowers" will bloom after 6 seconds, throwing your target's Meridians into disorder and interrupting his skills, inflicting Yin damage to your target and nearby enemies. Due to damage to Meridians, your target will consume HP during each use of a skill within 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_004_2_ngtips=There is a certain probability of injecting your target with "Fallen Flowers Chi" during an attack, with the hidden enemy waiting to burst forth, and causing a small amount of Soft Damage (there can be at most 2 bursts of Chi). <br/><font color="#FF3030">Flowering Branches Shaking Wildly: </font>“Fallen Flowers Chi” will bloom after 6 seconds, throwing your target's Meridians into disorder and interrupting his Skills, causing brief command lock out, and causing Yin Damage to your target and nearby enemies. Due to damage to Meridians, your target will consume HP during each use of a Skill within 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_004_3_ngtips=There is a certain probability of injecting your target with "Fallen Flowers Chi" during an attack, with the hidden enemy waiting to burst forth, and causing a small amount of Soft Damage (there can be at most 2 bursts of Chi). <br/><font color="#FF3030">Flowering Branches Shaking Wildly: </font>“Fallen Flowers Chi” will bloom after 6 seconds, throwing your target's Meridians into disorder and interrupting his Skills, causing brief command lock out, and causing Yin Damage to your target and nearby enemies. Due to damage to Meridians, your target will consume HP during each use of a Skill within 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_004_4_ngtips=There is a certain probability of injecting your target with "Fallen Flowers Chi" during an attack, with the hidden enemy waiting to burst forth, and causing a small amount of Soft Damage (there can be at most 2 bursts of Chi). <br/><font color="#FF3030">Flowering Branches Shaking Wildly: </font>“Fallen Flowers Chi” will bloom after 6 seconds, throwing your target's Meridians into disorder and interrupting his Skills, causing brief command lock out, and causing Yin Damage to your target and nearby enemies. Due to damage to Meridians, your target will consume HP during each use of a Skill within 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_004_5_ngtips=There is a probability of injecting your target with "Chi of Flying Flowers" during an attack, causing a small amount of Soft damage. There can be at most 3 bursts of Chi. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Shaking Branches: </font>"Chi of Flying Flowers" will bloom after 6 seconds, throwing your target's Meridians into disorder and interrupting his skills, inflicting Yin damage to your target and nearby enemies. Due to damage to Meridians, your target will consume HP during each use of a skill within 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_1_ngtips=When attacking, there is a probability of becoming spellbound, thus gaining the "Demonic Demeanor" effect, and 3 levels of the "Demonic Appearance" effect. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Demeanor: </font>Absorb 25% of HP at time of Critical Hit, lasts 12 seconds. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Demonic Appearance: </font>rate of Critical Hit increases by 18%, and each Critical Hit removes one level of "Demonic Appearance," lasts 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_2_ngtips=When attacking, there is a probability of becoming spellbound, thus gaining the "Demonic Demeanor" effect, and 3 levels of the "Demonic Appearance" effect. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Demeanor: </font>Absorb 30% of HP at time of Critical Hit, lasts 12 seconds. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Demonic Appearance: </font>rate of Critical Hit increases by 21%, and each Critical Hit removes one level of "Demonic Appearance," lasts 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_3_ngtips=When attacking, there is a probability of becoming spellbound, thus gaining the "Demonic Demeanor" effect, and 3 levels of the "Demonic Appearance" effect. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Demeanor: </font>Absorb 35% of HP at time of Critical Hit, lasts 12 seconds. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Demonic Appearance: </font>rate of Critical Hit increases by 24%, and each Critical Hit removes one level of "Demonic Appearance," lasts 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_4_ngtips=When attacking, there is a probability of becoming spellbound, thus gaining the "Demonic Demeanor" effect, and 3 levels of the "Demonic Appearance" effect. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Demeanor: </font>Absorb 40% of HP at time of Critical Hit, lasts 12 seconds. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Demonic Appearance: </font>rate of Critical Hit increases by 27%, and each Critical Hit removes one level of "Demonic Appearance," lasts 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_004_5_ngtips=When attacking, there is a probability of becoming spellbound, thus gaining the "Demonic Demeanor" effect, and 4 levels of the "Demonic Appearance" effect. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demonic Demeanor: </font>Absorb 50% of HP at time of Critical Hit, lasts 12 seconds. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Demonic Appearance: </font>rate of Critical Hit increases by 30%, and each Critical Hit removes one level of "Demonic Appearance," lasts 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_1_ngtips=During each attack, there is a probability you can give your enemy "Yin Poison," which will cause minor damage, and last for 16 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Yin Poison Outbreak: </font>You have a probability of activating Yin Poison during an attack, which causes all cumulative poison damage to take place at once. <br/>After a Yin Poison Outbreak, your target will briefly experience command lockout and also suffer 18% Blood Stasis. His movement speed will then drop to the minimum (it will gradually return to normal within 4 seconds), and he cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_2_ngtips=During each attack, there is a probability you can give your enemy "Yin Poison," which will cause minor damage, and last for 16 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Yin Poison Outbreak: </font>You have a probability of activating Yin Poison during an attack, which causes all cumulative poison damage to take place at once. <br/>After a Yin Poison Outbreak, your target will briefly experience command lockout and also suffer 21% Blood Stasis. His movement speed will then drop to the minimum (it will gradually return to normal within 4 seconds), and he cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_3_ngtips=During each attack, there is a probability you can give your enemy "Yin Poison," which will cause minor damage, and last for 16 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Yin Poison Outbreak: </font>You have a probability of activating Yin Poison during an attack, which causes all cumulative poison damage to take place at once. <br/>After a Yin Poison Outbreak, your target will briefly experience command lockout and also suffer 24% Blood Stasis. His movement speed will then drop to the minimum (it will gradually return to normal within 5 seconds), and he cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_4_ngtips=During each attack, there is a probability you can give your enemy "Yin Poison," which will cause minor damage, and last for 16 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Yin Poison Outbreak: </font>You have a probability of activating Yin Poison during an attack, which causes all cumulative poison damage to take place at once. <br/>After a Yin Poison Outbreak, your target will briefly experience command lockout and also suffer 27% Blood Stasis. His movement speed will then drop to the minimum (it will gradually return to normal within 5 seconds), and he cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_004_5_ngtips=During each attack, there is a probability you can give your enemy "Yin Poison," which will cause minor damage, and last for 16 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Yin Poison Outbreak: </font>You have a probability of activating Yin Poison during an attack, which causes all cumulative poison damage to take place at once.  <br/>After a Yin Poison Outbreak, your target will briefly experience command lockout and also suffer 30% Blood Stasis. His movement speed will then drop to the minimum (it will gradually return to normal within 6 seconds), and he cannot use Flying Skills for 4 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg_6_ngtips=Decrease the damage you receive by 24%. You lose immunity from injury during attacks, but can ignore your target's 12% Internal and External defense, gaining 6% damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_6_ngtips=Gather chi to protect yourself when use skill and get attacked, get 3 seconds Super Armor effect. When trigger super armor effect by getting attacked, there is 30% chance to interrupt attacker's skill. It will take 14 seconds to gather chi again.
desc_buf_ng_jh_zxg_6_ngtips=An attack will cause damage equivalent to 0.75 times the Energy your target lacks, and additionally cause 150 Yin damage. (Only effective against players)
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_6_ngtips=When your attack is parried, you will receive an <font color="#FF3030">Evil Influence</font>. Each level of Evil Influence will increase attack damage by 1.5%, lasting 16 seconds, and can be stacked up to 15 times. If your attack is later parried, your Chi will be dispersed, and you will lose a level of <font color="#FF3030">Evil Influence</font>. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Evil Opposing Heaven: Your </font><font color="#FF3030">Evil Influence </font>will disperse, but you may be able to increase your defensive ability by 50% for a period of time, and add Soft damage to your attacks for 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_6_ngtips=When you are attacked in the state of being forbidden from using flying skills, paralyzed, or faint, then you can continuously recover Chi and Blood for 3 seconds, and there is a certain chance that all the negative effects will be eliminated for one instance. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_6_ngtips=When you do not parry the opponent's attack, there is a chance of using <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> on the opponent, lasting for 9 seconds, which can be used 8 times at most. When <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> is increased to level-8, it will explode all poison essence, causing the poison essence damage to accumulate, interrupting the opponent's parry at that time and paralyzing them for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_6_ngtips=During attack, there is a certain chance that additional damage will be added and there will be continuous loss of Chi and Blood for 8 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Until Death:</font>Target bleeds continuously and all recovery effects are reduced by 80%.
