tips_jyz_count_sl_4_2_0=When your power is Flows with Chi, you can go to Little Sister Yan in Jinling to obtain laxative to throw into the Qinhuai River. Each person can only accept one Task. After your Task is completed, you have a certain chance of receiving an <font color="#ff1cae" >interesting Item and Internal Skill Breakthrough</font>. (recommended that players play individually) <br/>Little Sister Yan's coordinates: <br/>Jinling (1242 2014)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_2_1=When your power is outstanding, you can go to Little Sister Yan in Jinling to obtain laxative to throw into the Qinhuai River. Each person can only accept one Task. After your Task is completed, you have a certain chance of receiving an <font color="#ff1cae" >interesting Item and Internal Skill Breakthrough Secret</font>. (recommended that players play individually) <br/>Little Sister Yan's coordinates: <br/>Jinling (1242 2014)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_5_0=When escorting the prisoner's stagecoach out of the city, imperial soldiers may try to intercept the cart. Kill them as quickly as you can. (Recommended that players work as a team.) <br/>prisoner's stagecoach target coordinates: <br/>Jinling: (1307 2012)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_5_1=When escorting the prison cart out of the city, government soldiers may try to block the cart. Kill them as quickly as you can. (recommended that players work as a team) <br/>Prison cart target coordinates: <br/>Jinling: (1307 2012)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_17_0=When a player who nominated the Silent Temple donates a lot of supplies to increase the Gather Bandits in the Mountains score, this will also increase the faction's donation score. The player who first makes the required donations and names the faction in question can use that faction's Identification Card to go to Chengdu to see Seventeenth Yan (1042 448), claim a reward, and donate to the NPC Seventh Yan: Chengdu (1042 446).
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_17_1=When a player who named the Silent Temple donates a lot of supplies to increase the Gather Bandits in the Mountains score, this will also increase the faction's donation score. The player who first makes the required donations and names the faction in question can use that faction's identity badge to go to Chengdu to see Seventeenth Yan (1042 448), claim the Reward, and donate NPC Seventh Yan: Chengdu (1042 446)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_7_0=When a player who nominated the Four Great Outlaws donates a lot of supplies to increase the Gather Bandits in the Mountains score, this will also increase the faction's donation score. The player who first makes the required donations and names the faction in question can use that faction's Identification Card to go to Jinling to look up Sixteenth Yan (2128 884), claim a reward, and donate to the NPC Sixth Yan: Jinling (2126 885)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_7_1=When a player who named the Four Great Outlaws donates a lot of supplies to increase the Gather Bandits in the Mountains score, this will also increase the faction's donation score. The player who first makes the required donations and names the faction in question can use that faction's identity badge to go to Jinling to look up Sixteenth Yan (2128 884), claim the Reward, and donate NPC Sixth Yan: Jinling (2126 885)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_8_0=When a player who nominated the Iron Riders donates a lot of supplies to increase the Gather Bandits in the Mountains score, this will also increase the faction's donation score. The player who first makes the required donations and names the faction in question can use that faction's Identification Card to go to Yanjing to find Nineteenth Yan (1757 1230), claim a reward, and donate to the NPC Ninth Yan: Yanjing (1755 1231).
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_8_1=When a player who nominated the Iron Riders donates a lot of supplies to increase the Gather Bandits in the Mountains score, this will also increase the faction's donation score. The player who first makes the required donations and names the faction in question can use that faction's Identification Card to go to Yanjing to see Nineteenth Yan (1757 1230), claim a reward, and donate to the NPC Ninth Yan: Yanjing (1755 1231).
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_9_0=When a player who nominated Da Rizong donates a lot of supplies to increase the Gather Bandits in the Mountains score, this will also increase the faction's donation score. The player who first makes the required donations and names the faction in question can use that faction's Identification Card to go to Suzhou to find Eighteenth Yan (1523 967), claim a reward, and donate to the NPC Eighth Yan: Suzhou (1525 969).
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_9_1=When a player who named Da Rizong donates a lot of supplies to increase the Gather Bandits in the Mountains score, this will also increase the faction's donation score. The player who first makes the required donations and names the faction in question can use that faction's identity badge to go to Suzhou to find Eighteenth Yan (1523 967), claim the Reward, and donate NPC Eighth Yan: Suzhou (1525 969)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_10_0=Go to the Iron Riders, and check the prisoner's stagecoach seized by the Iron Riders; <br/>Coordinates of the Iron Riders' prisoner's stagecoach: Jinling (1528 2369)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_10_1=Go to the Iron Riders, and check the prison cart seized by the Iron Riders; <br/>Coordinates of the Iron Riders' prison cart: Jinling (1528 2369)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_11_0=Go to Da Rizong, and check the prisoner's stagecoach seized by Da Rizong; <br/>Coordinates of Da Rizong's prisoner's stagecoach: Jinling (852 2358)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_11_1=Go to Da Rizong, and check the prison cart seized by Da Rizong; <br/>Coordinates of Da Rizong's prison cart: Jinling (852 2358)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_12_0=Go to Silent Temple, and check the prisoner's stagecoach captured by the Silent Temple. <br/>Coordinates of the Silent Temple's prisoner's stagecoach: Jinling (680 359)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_12_1=Go to Silent Temple, and check the prison cart captured by the Silent Temple; <br/>Coordinates of the Silent Temple's prison cart: Jinling (680 359)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_13_0=Go to Chengdu to find Seventeenth Yan (1042 448), accept the task "Silent Temple's Interference", and destroy the other factions' provisions. Each player can only accept one task. After the task has been completed, add 1 to the Silent Temple's nomination progress, and subtract 1 from the nomination progress of Da Rizong, the Four Great Outlaws, and the Iron Riders.
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_13_1=Go to Chengdu to find Seventeenth Yan (1042 448), accept the Silent Temple's Obstruction Task, and destroy the other factions' provisions. Each player can only accept one Task. After the Task has been completed, add 1 to the Silent Temple's obstruction progress, and name Da Rizong, name the Four Great Outlaws, and name the Iron Riders to subtract 1 from their progress.
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_14_0=Go to Jinling to see Sixteenth Yan (2128 884), accept the task "Four Great Outlaws' Interference", and destroy the other factions' provisions. Each player can only accept one task. After the task has been completed, add 1 to the Four Great Outlaws' nomination progress, and subtract 1 from the nomination progress of the Silent Temple, Da Rizong, and Iron Riders.
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_14_1=Go to Jinling to see Sixteenth Yan (2128 884), accept the Four Great Outlaws' Obstruction Task, and destroy the other factions' provisions. Each player can only accept one Task. After the Task has been completed, add 1 to the Four Great Outlaws' Obstruction Progress, and name the Silent Temple, name Da Rizong, and name Iron Riders to subtract 1 from their progress.
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_15_0=Go to Yanjing to find Nineteenth Yan (1757 1230), accept the task "Iron Riders' Interference", and destroy the other factions' provisions. Each player can only accept one task. After the task has been completed, add 1 to the Iron Riders' nomination progress and subtract 1 from the nomination progress of the Silent Temple, Da Rizong, and the Four Great Outlaws.
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_15_1=Go to Yanjing to find Nineteenth Yan (1757 1230), accept the Iron Riders' Obstruction Task, and destroy the other factions' provisions. Each player can only accept one Task. After the Task has been completed, add 1 to the Iron Riders' Obstruction Progress, name the Silent Temple, name Da Rizong, and name the Four Great Outlaws to subtract 1 from their progress.
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_16_0=Go to Suzhou to look for Eighteenth Yan (1523 967), accept the task "Da Rizong's Interference", and destroy the other factions' provisions. Each player can only accept one task. After the task has been completed, add 1 to Da Rizong's nomination progress, and subtract 1 from the nominations of the Silent Temple, the Four Great Outlaws, and the Iron Riders.
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_16_1=Go to Suzhou to look for Eighteenth Yan (1523 967), accept the task "Da Rizong's Interference", and destroy the other factions' provisions. Each player can only accept one task. After the task has been completed, add 1 to Da Rizong's nomination progress, and subtract 1 from the nominations of the Silent Temple, the Four Great Outlaws, and the Iron Riders.
tips_levelpunish_s=For players who are lower in capability then self, harder for accuracy; higher gap in capabilities means lower Accuracy
tips_levelpunish_t=This player's capabilities pass "Unrivalled". If own capability lower then him, when attack harder to get Accuracy; higher gap in capabilities means lower Accuracy
