tips_skill_formula_wx1_new=<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:伤害下限}</font> - <font color="#FFFF00">{@1:伤害上限}</font> <font color="#F728FF">(+{@2:兵录加成})</font>points of {@3:伤害类型} damage (<font color="#FFFF00">{@4:击数}</font>hits in total, each doing about <font color="#FFFF00">{@5:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
tips_skill_formula_mep=<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:基础值}</font><font color="#FF3030">(+{@1:近身加成})</font><font color="#F728FF">(+{@2:兵录加成})</font> points of {@3:伤害类型} damage (Total of <font color="#FFFF00">{@4:击数}</font> hits, each hit doing about <font color="#FFFF00">{@5:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
tips_skill_formula_map=<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:基础值}</font><font color="#00FFFF">(+{@1:内功加成})</font><font color="#F728FF">(+{@2:兵录加成})</font> points of {@3:伤害类型} damage (Total of <font color="#FFFF00">{@4:击数}</font> hits, each hit doing about <font color="#FFFF00">{@5:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
tips_skill_formula_shp=<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:基础值}</font><font color="#00FF00">(+{@1:远程加成})</font><font color="#F728FF">(+{@2:兵录加成})</font> points of {@3:伤害类型} damage (Total of <font color="#FFFF00">{@4:击数}</font> hits, each hit doing about <font color="#FFFF00">{@5:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
tips_skill_formula_memap=<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:基础值}</font><font color="#FF3030">(+{@1:近身加成})</font><font color="#00FFFF">(+{@2:内功加成})</font><font color="#F728FF">(+{@3:兵录加成})</font> points of {@4:伤害类型} damage (Total of <font color="#FFFF00">{@5:击数}</font> hits, each hit doing about <font color="#FFFF00">{@6:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
tips_skill_formula_mashp=<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:基础值}</font><font color="#00FFFF">(+{@1:内功加成})</font><font color="#00FF00">(+{@2:远程加成})</font><font color="#F728FF">(+{@3:兵录加成})</font> points of {@4:伤害类型} damage (Total of <font color="#FFFF00">{@5:击数}</font> hits, each hit doing about <font color="#FFFF00">{@6:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
tips_skill_formula_mep_w=(<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:伤害下限}</font>~<font color="#FFFF00">{@1:伤害上限}</font>)<font color="#FF3030">(+{@2:近身加成})</font><font color="#F728FF">(+{@3:兵录加成})</font>points of {@4:伤害类型}damage. (For a total of <font color="#FFFF00">{@5:击数}</font> hits, each hit does about <font color="#FFFF00">{@6:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
tips_skill_formula_map_w=(<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:伤害下限}</font>~<font color="#FFFF00">{@1:伤害上限}</font>)<font color="#00FFFF">(+{@2:内功加成})</font><font color="#F728FF">(+{@3:兵录加成})</font>points of{@4:伤害类型} damage. (For a total of <font color="#FFFF00">{@5:击数}</font> hits, each hit does about <font color="#FFFF00">{@6:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
tips_skill_formula_shp_w=(<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:伤害下限}</font>~<font color="#FFFF00">{@1:伤害上限}</font>)<font color="#00FF00">(+{@2:远程加成})</font><font color="#F728FF">(+{@3:兵录加成})</font>points of{@4:伤害类型} damage. (For a total of <font color="#FFFF00">{@5:击数}</font> hits, each hit does about <font color="#FFFF00">{@6:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
tips_skill_formula_memap_w=(<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:伤害下限}</font>~<font color="#FFFF00">{@1:伤害上限}</font>)<font color="#FF3030">(+{@2:近身加成})</font><font color="#00FFFF">(+{@3:内功加成})</font><font color="#F728FF">(+{@4:兵录加成})</font>points of{@5:伤害类型} damage. (For a total of <font color="#FFFF00">{@6:击数}</font> hits, each hit does about <font color="#FFFF00">{@7:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
tips_skill_formula_mashp_w=(<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:伤害下限}</font>~<font color="#FFFF00">{@1:伤害上限}</font>)<font color="#00FFFF">(+{@2:内功加成})</font><font color="#00FF00">(+{@3:远程加成})</font><font color="#F728FF">(+{@4:兵录加成})</font>points of{@5:伤害类型} damage. (For a total of <font color="#FFFF00">{@6:击数}</font> hits, each hit does about <font color="#FFFF00">{@7:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
tips_budai_2=Good Luck Sack includes some famous medicines of Jianghu which is useful in emergency.
tips_bag_silver1_0=Coins<br> Coins are the currency you earn from quests, item sales and loot, to be used for all your in-game purchases. Coins cannot be traded directly between players.<br>Carrying Capacity: 10 Ding <br>Daily Max Spending is 360 Liang, you can still spend {@0:$} for today.
tips_bag_silver1_1=Coins<br> Coins are the currency you earn from quests, item sales and loot, to be used for all your in-game purchases. Coins cannot be traded directly between players.<br>Carrying Capacity: 10 Ding <br>Daily Max Spending is 360 Liang, you can still spend {@0:$} for today.
tips_bag_silver2_0=Taels<br>Taels is a currency within the game, can be used for Trade between players.<br>Carrying Capacity: 30 Ding
tips_bag_silver2_1=Taels<br>Also known as Official Silver, Taels are funds that you receive from authorized sources. These funds may be used for trading between players, or spent on in-game purchases when you can no longer spend Coins (bottom row) for the day.<br>Carrying Capacity: 1000 Ding
