desc_buf_ng_sj_001_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if the player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, the player will recover 4% of maximum HP and 3% of maximum Energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and energy for teammates within a 16 m radius of player when player is seriously wounded. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 40% of player's maximum HP and 40% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if the player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, the player will recover 4.5% of maximum HP and 3.2% of maximum Energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and energy for teammates within a 16 m radius of player when player is seriously wounded. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 45% of player's maximum HP and 45% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if the player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, the player will recover 5% of maximum HP and 3.4% of maximum Energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and energy for teammates within a 16 m radius of player when player is seriously wounded. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 50% of player's maximum HP and 50% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if the player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, the player will recover 3.6% of maximum HP and 3.6% of maximum Energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and energy for teammates within a 16 m radius of player when player is seriously wounded. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 55% of player's maximum HP and 55% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if the player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, the player will recover 6% of maximum HP and 4% of maximum Energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and energy for teammates within a 16 m radius of player when player is seriously wounded, and gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Fox Mourns for Dead Hare" </font>buff, increasing skill damage  by 20% for 20 seconds. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 60% of player's maximum HP and 60% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if the player is not attacked again within 7 seconds, the player will recover 6.2% of maximum HP and 4.2% of maximum Energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and Energy for teammates within a 16m radius of the player when the player is seriously wounded, and gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Fox Mourns for Dead Hare"</font> buff, increasing skill damage  by 20% for 25 seconds. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 60% of player's maximum HP and 60% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: when being attacked, if the player is not attacked again within 6 seconds, the player will recover 6.5% of maximum HP and 4.5% of maximum Energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: recover a large amount of HP and Energy for teammates within a 16m radius of the player when the player is seriously wounded, and gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Fox Mourns for Dead Hare"</font> buff, increasing skill damage  by 30% for 20 seconds. <br>Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 60% of player's maximum HP and 60% of player's maximum energy. <br>After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, they cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cleansing Breath</font>: 15% chance of receiving a "Cleansing Breath" when attacking, causing a dramatic increase in attack accuracy and immunity to being disarmed or having skills disabled; lasts for 7 seconds. You recover for 30 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi of Peace</font>: has 15% chance of reducing damage received by 1% when attacked. This effect lasts for 60 seconds and can be stacked 5 times. Also increases player's Skill damage by 0.5% for 60 seconds. The effect can stack 5 times.
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cleansing Breath</font>: 15% chance of receiving a "Cleansing Breath" when attacking, causing a dramatic increase in attack accuracy and immunity to being disarmed or having skills disabled; lasts for 8 seconds. You recover for 30 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi of Peace</font>: has 15% chance of reducing damage received by 1% when attacked. This effect lasts for 60 seconds and can be stacked 6 times. Also increases player's Skill damage by 0.5% for 60 seconds; this effect can be stacked 6 times.
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cleansing Breath</font>: 15% chance of receiving a "Cleansing Breath" when attacking, causing a dramatic increase in attack accuracy and immunity to being disarmed or having skills disabled; lasts for 9 seconds. You recover for 30 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi of Peace</font>: has 15% chance of reducing damage received by 1% when attacked. This effect lasts for 60 seconds and can stack 7 times. Also increases player's Skill damage by 0.5% for 60 seconds; this effect can be stacked 7 times.
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cleansing Breath</font>: 15% chance of receiving a "Cleansing Breath" when attacking, causing a dramatic increase in attack accuracy and immunity to being disarmed or having skills disabled; lasts for 10 seconds. You recover for 30 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi of Peace</font>: has 15% chance of reducing damage received by 1% when attacked. This effect lasts for 60 seconds and can be stacked 8 times. Also increases player's Skill damage by 0.5% for 60 seconds; this effect can be stacked 8 times.
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cleansing Breath</font>: 15% chance of receiving a "Cleansing Breath" when attacking, causing a dramatic increase in attack accuracy and immunity to being disarmed or having skills disabled; lasts for 12 seconds. You recover for 30 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi of Peace</font>: has 15% chance of reducing damage received by 1% when attacked. This effect lasts for 60 seconds and can be stacked 10 times. Also increases player's Skill damage by 0.5% for 60 seconds; this effect can be stacked 10 times.
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cleansing Breath</font>: 15% chance of receiving a "Cleansing Breath" when attacking, causing a dramatic increase in attack accuracy and immunity to being disarmed or having skills disabled; lasts for 13 seconds. You recover for 30 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi of Peace</font>: has 15% chance of reducing damage received by 1% when attacked. This effect lasts for 60 seconds and can be stacked 12 times. Also increases player's Skill damage by 0.5% for 60 seconds; this effect can stack 12 times.
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cleansing Breath</font>: 15% chance of receiving a "Cleansing Breath" when attacking, causing a dramatic increase in attack accuracy and immunity to being disarmed or having skills disabled; lasts for 14 seconds. You recover for 30 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi of Peace</font>: has 15% chance of reducing damage received by 1% when attacked. This effect lasts for 60 seconds and can be stacked 13 times. Also increases the player's Skill damage by 0.5% for 60 seconds; this effect can be stacked 13 times.
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_8_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cleansing Breath</font>: 15% chance of receiving a "Cleansing Breath" when attacking, causing a dramatic increase in attack accuracy and immunity to being disarmed or having skills disabled; lasts for 15 seconds. You recover for 30 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi of Peace</font>: has 15% chance of reducing damage received by 1% when attacked. This effect lasts for 60 seconds and can be stacked 15 times. Also increases the player's Skill damage by 0.8% for 60 seconds; this effect can be stacked 15 times.
desc_buf_ng_ws_001_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Chi Circulates: </font>next attack has 15% chance of not costing energy and player will recover 105 energy. Cooldown is 20 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Turns to Life</font>: When player's HP is less than 15%, any attack will trigger energy body protection and 50% of the damage will be transferred to the player's energy. The effect lasts for 12 seconds. Every 3 points of damage depletes 1 point of energy.
desc_buf_ng_ws_001_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Chi Circulates: </font>next attack has 15% chance of not costing energy and player will recover 131 energy. Cooldown is 20 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Turns to Life</font>: When player's HP is less than 15%, any attack will trigger a chi barrier and 60% of the damage will be transferred to the player's energy. The effect lasts for 12 seconds. Every 3 points of damage deplete 1 point of energy.
desc_buf_ng_ws_001_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Chi Circulates: </font>next attack has 15% chance of not costing energy and player will recover 159 energy. Cooldown is 20 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Turns to Life</font>: When player's HP is less than 15%, any attack will trigger energy body protection and 70% of the damage will be transferred to the player's energy. The effect lasts for 12 seconds. Every 4 points of damage deplete 1 point of energy.
desc_buf_ng_ws_001_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Chi Circulates: </font>next attack has 15% chance of not costing energy and player will recover 188 energy. Cooldown is 20 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Turns to Life</font>: When player's HP is less than 15%, any attack will trigger energy body protection and 80% of the damage will be transferred to the player's energy. The effect lasts for 12 seconds. Every 4 points of damage depletes 1 point of energy.
desc_buf_ng_ws_001_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Chi Circulates: </font>next attack has 15% chance of not costing energy and player will recover 218 energy. Cooldown is 20 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Turns to Life</font>: When player's HP is less than 15%, any attack will trigger energy body protection and 90% of the damage will be transferred to the player's energy. The effect lasts for 12 seconds. Every 5 points of damage deplete 1 point of energy.
desc_buf_ng_ws_001_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Circulation of Chi</font>: when attacking, there is a 15% chance that the next attack will not consume Energy, your Energy will be restored by 273 points, and the damage inflicted by your attacks will increase by 12%, for 6 seconds. Cooldown is 20 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Turns to Life</font>: When the player's HP is less than 15%, any attack will trigger energy body protection and 90% of the damage will be transferred to the player's Energy. The effect lasts for 14 seconds. Every 5 points of damage deplete 1 point of energy.
desc_buf_ng_th_001_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rising Tide: </font>When attacking, player has 50% chance of causing an additional 30% damage + 241 points soft damage, cooldown is 25 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Ebbing Tide</font>: When attacked, there is 50% chance of causing paralysis in the attacker for 3 seconds, cooldown is 40 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_th_001_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rising Tide: </font>When attacking, player has 50% chance of causing an additional 35% damage + 295 points soft damage, cooldown is 25 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Ebbing Tide</font>: When attacked, there is 50% chance of causing paralysis in the attacker for 3 seconds, cooldown is 40 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_th_001_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rising Tide: </font>When attacking, player has 50% chance of causing an additional 40% damage + 355 points soft damage, cooldown is 25 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Ebbing Tide</font>: When attacked, there is 50% chance of causing paralysis in the attacker for 3 seconds, cooldown is 40 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_th_001_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rising Tide: </font>When attacking, player has 50% chance of causing an additional 45% damage + 412 points soft damage, cooldown is 25 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Ebbing Tide</font>: When attacked, there is 50% chance of causing paralysis in the attacker for 3 seconds, cooldown is 40 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_th_001_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rising Tide: </font>When attacking, player has 50% chance of causing an additional 50% damage + 475 points soft damage, cooldown is 25 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Ebbing Tide</font>: When attacked, there is 50% chance of causing paralysis in the attacker for 4 seconds, cooldown is 40 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack: </font>has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 5 seconds, 36 second cooldown. <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: successful evasion recovers 2% of maximum HP, 4 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack: </font>has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 6 seconds, 34 second cooldown. <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: successful evasion recovers 2% of maximum HP, 4 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack: </font>has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 7 seconds, 32 seconds cooldown. <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: successful evasion recovers 3% of maximum HP, 4 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack: </font>has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 8 seconds, 30 second cooldown. <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: successful evasion recovers 3% of maximum HP, 4 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack: </font>has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 9 seconds, 28 second cooldown. <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: successful evasion recovers 4% of maximum HP, 4 second cooldown.
