tips_wuzhen_biaoche_001=Hurry to the south gate of Luoyang, and reclaim the imperial caravan of over 10 carts being taken to the Green Cloud Castle
tips_wuzhen_boss_001=Wu Zhen has a large number of archers protecting him, and can use the cannons in front of the city gate for back-up.
tips_wuzhen_fight_0=The five Demos of Qingyun seek to control the Prefect and plunder the official storehouse. You can first rescue the Prefect at the Luoyang Constabulary, and then recover the imperial's goods and kill the villains at the south gate of Luoyang.
tips_wuzhen_fight_1=The five malefactors seek to control the Prefect and plunder the official storehouse. You can first rescue the Prefect at the Luoyang Constabulary, and then recover the government's goods and kill the malefactors at the south gate of Luoyang.
