tip_count_city03war01_1=The only way to stop the cannon attacks is to destroy all of the cannons. Based on intelligence provided by our spies, the cannon attacks are coming from the Jinling Academy (1263,1345) and the market (1324,946) near the Drum Tower. Hurry and send some people to take care of this.
tip_count_city03war01_2=We found the Shenji Camp General (825,1239), who will use a barrel of bomb powder to produce an even more destructive Skyburst Pellet to use on the Prince of a Thousand Sentiments!
