tips_condition_26172=You need to obtain the affection of Suzhou's Maomao, Doudou, He Xianger, Shanzi, and Linya.
tips_condition_26174=Become friends with Suzhou's wealthy merchants Ma Lu, Xiao Chen, Ming Yuanshan, He Lianliang, and Qian the Rich
tips_condition_26173=Become friends with the famous Suzhou peddlers Zhang Erniu, Zhou Sheng, Shen Yu, Yao Chun, and Gu Nongyu
tips_condition_26176=Obtain the affection of the heads of five major households:  Murong Gan, Xie Yin, Yu Kaiyuan, Jiang Yulan, and Qiu Xuan
tips_condition_26177=Become friends with the professional traders Feng Yuzhu, Bai Jinrou, Sang Qing, Du Bonian, and Yu Liusu
tips_condition_26178=You need to become intimate friends with the Suzhou constables Qi Hanhui, Chen Dachong, Cao Wei, Yu Zhou, and Zhang Qianhuo.
tips_condition_26180=Become intimate friends with Suzhou's leading young talents Yan Xu, Kuang Jiaxing, Yan Feng, Kuang Qiaoyun, Murong Yan, Murong Sizhen, Qin Xuanqi, Wang Mingwen, Zhu Cong, and Yu Tingzhi
tips_condition_26179=Become friends with various travelers in Suzhou, namely Eagle Eyes, Mao Yibiao, monks, nuns, Li Cangyun, Yu Lingzi, Gong Zhenpeng, Geng Meining, Yuan Zi, and Pei Shunqing
tips_condition_26175=Win the admiration of Suzhou's leading store-owners Jiao Si, Meng Guang, Qian Baikui, Li Guangtian, and Lu Xia.
