tips_taozhuang_10011_6=</font><font color="#6699ff">Stinger Jacket </font><br><font color="#00ff00">6 pieces: being attacked could result in your opponent being poisoned, thereby making it difficult for them to utilize their Chi and preventing them for performing any strikes
tips_taozhuang_10012_5=</font><font color="#6699ff">Garment Tainted with Insect Venom</font><br><font color="#00ff00">6 items: when attacked, there is a chance to slow down your target. After 5 more stacked effects, your opponent will suffer total paralysis.
tips_taozhuang_10012_6=</font><font color="#6699ff">Insect Poison Jacket </font><br><font color="#00ff00">6 pieces: when attacked, there is a chance your opponent will get numbed meridians; after 5 layers are superimposed, your opponent will suffer total paralysis
tips_taozhuang_10013_6=</font><font color="#6699ff">Wait Patiently </font><br><font color="#00ff00">3 items: if you hold your attacks for 8 seconds, the next time you attack, you will obtain a large increase in attack power and rage.
tips_taozhuang_10015_6=</font><font color="#6699ff">Bone Softening Poisonous Garment</font><br><font color="#00ff00">6 items: after being attacked, Your attacker is poisoned, with his attack power greatly reduced.
tips_taozhuang_10016_6=</font><font color="#6699ff">Precious Jade Returns the Soul </font><br><font color="#00ff00">6 items: after being attacked, healing by treasure may be triggered, with healing effects being best for those with greater Energy-based skills.
tips_taozhuang_10017_6=</font><font color="#6699ff">Steady Accumulation </font><br><font color="#00ff00">3 items: hold your attacks for 12 seconds, and the next time you attack, you will obtain a large increase in attack power and rage.
tips_taozhuang_10020_6=</font><font color="#6699ff">Pure Gold Returns the Spirit </font><br><font color="#00ff00">6 items: after being attacked, healing by treasure may be triggered, with healing effects being best for those with greater Energy-based skills.
tips_taozhuang_10022_6=</font><font color="#6699ff">Refined Weapon </font><br><font color="#00ff00">3 items: after 9 or more chained attacks, ignore a large amount of your opponent's parry as well as internal and external defense.
tips_taozhuang_10023_6=</font><font color="#6699ff">Flamboyant Garment </font><br><font color="#00ff00">6 items: Your attackers get blurred vision, significantly reducing their accuracy and evasion.
