tips_use_inteval=Can be used after <font color="#FFFF00">{@0:num}.{@1:num}.{@2:num}, {@3:num}:{@4:num}</font><br>Activated <font color="#FF0000">{@5:num}</font> times, can be activated <font color="#FFFF00">{@6:num}</font>times<br>
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg_7_ngtips=Reduce all damage taken by 24%, remove damage reduction effect when attacking, but also ignore 14% of target's External Defense, inflicting 8% bonus damage.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_7_ngtips=When attacking, reduce target's Spirit, Breath and Stamina by 1, turning these into your own Breath, lasts 30 seconds, each time you attack, there is an 80% chance to get 1 extra stack of this effect, maximum 45 stacks.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_7_ngtips=When attacking or attacked, you generate Chi to protect self, receiving Super Armor effect for 4 seconds. 30% chance to interrupt target's move when you are attacked and Super Armor is triggered. It takes 14 seconds to recharge Chi
desc_buf_ng_jh_zxg_7_ngtips=When attacking, deal damage equal to 0.8 * amount of target's Internal Energy lost plus 500 (affected by Internal Attack Damage) bonus Yin Damage. (Only effective against player)
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_7_ngtips=If attacks are not blocked, you gain <font color="#FF3030">Sinister</font> chi, each stack increases your attack damage by 1.5% for 20 seconds, maximum 15 stacks. If attacks are blocked, you lose your Chi and 1 stack of <font color="#FF3030">Sinister</font> effect. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Evil Opposing Heaven: </font> When <font color="#FF3030">Sinister</font> effect wears off, your potential power is activated and defense will be increased for 60%. You attacks will also have Soft effect, lasts 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_7_ngtips=When you are attacked under forbid Flying Skills, paralyzed or faint status, you can continuously recover Chi and HP for 3 seconds and there is a chance that all the negative effects will be eliminated. (Direct attacks from targets that forbid Flying Skills, paralysis or deal faint status will trigger recovery.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_7_ngtips=When failing to parry a target, there is a chance to inflict <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> on the target. Can be stacked up to 8 times and active for 9 seconds. When <font color="#FF3030">Toad Poison</font> is stacked to level 8 the poison damage will accumulate, target's parry will be interrupted and they will be paralyzed for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_7_ngtips=When attacking, chance to deal additional damage with a continuous Chi and HP drain for 8 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Until Death:</font>Target bleeds continuously and all recovery effects are decreased by 80%.
tips_skillpack_14308=<font color="#00ff00">CD for Unstoppable Wind is reduced by 2 seconds</font>
tips_skillpack_14309=<font color="#00ff00">Rage consumption for Stiff-Faced Seraph is reduced by 7</font>
tips_skillpack_14310=<font color="#00ff00">Increase damage for Step Backwards Over Seven Stars by 15%</font>
tips_resetprop_4=Can be refined
