tips_lingxiao_flaw_count_01=When recruiting masters, Exposure Value will increase when spies commit destructions, upon reaching 100 Exposure Value, you will be returned to your force.
desc_buf_hiddenwp_kql=The power of the attack results in the target being knocked back, with the powerful Chi also resulting in chaos in the enemies near and around the target
