tips_eqp_test21_1=</font><font color="#6699ff">A Unified Entity</font><br><font color="#00ff00">Active when equip more than 10 tier 5 jade equipment: Won't be affected by attached effect of lower tier equipment.
desc_buf_ng_jh_306_6_ngtips=You have not yet learned this skill's essence. <br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 20 seconds. When cultivation or chi power points are used up, movement will automatically stop.  </font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_507_6_ngtips=You have not yet learned this collection's essence. <br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 20 seconds. When cultivation or chi power points are used up, the movement will automatically stop.  </font>
tips_battle_money_introduce=How to gain: <br>VIP players can receive Daily Tasks from Battlefield Supply Merchant Gu Mu and gain massive points via finishing them.  Players can also gain corresponding points via joining battlefield activities. <br>How to use: <br>They can be used to exchange for advanced battlefield items. <br>Battlefield Supply Merchant Gu Mu is at: <br>Suzhou (537 435)
tip_city03war01_1=Before Ling Yunyu appears, assist the school leaders in defeating the general. Defend the starting point of the attack by the Jubao Gate and Three Mountains Gate (1080,1620), defend the starting point of the attack by the Huaiyuan Gate (1110,1230), defend the starting point of the attack by Xuanwu Lake (1080,1620). Only school leaders have the ability to block the Prince of a Thousand Sentiments Ling Yunyu's advance.
