desc_buf_ng_sl_005_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Wushi Chi</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase own critical hit rate by 2% and critical hit damage by 4%, lasting 40 seconds, up to 4 stacks.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Marrow-Cleansing Recovery</font>: When hit, a chance to recover own HP and remove a debuff.
desc_buf_ng_sl_005_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Wushi Chi</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase own critical hit rate by 2% and critical hit damage by 4%, lasting 40 seconds, up to 4 stacks.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Marrow-Cleansing Recovery</font>: When hit, a chance to recover own HP and remove a debuff.
desc_buf_ng_sl_005_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Wushi Chi</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase own critical hit rate by 2% and critical hit damage by 4%, lasting 40 seconds, up to 5 stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Marrow-Cleansing Recovery</font>: When hit, a chance to recover own HP and remove a debuff.
desc_buf_ng_sl_005_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Wushi Chi</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase own critical hit rate by 2% and critical hit damage by 4%, lasting 40 seconds, up to 5 stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Marrow-Cleansing Recovery</font>: When hit, a chance to recover own HP and remove a debuff.
desc_buf_ng_sl_005_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Wushi Chi</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to increase your critical hit rate by 2% and critical hit damage by 4%, lasting 40 seconds, up to 6 stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Marrow-Cleansing Recovery</font>: When hit, a chance to recover own HP and remove most debuffs and be immune to these effects temporarily.
desc_buf_ng_em_005_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Nirvana Land</font>: When attacking or attacked, players will gain a Protection Shield that can absorb damage, deal Yang Damage to surrounding enemies continuously and reduce the target's internal skill defense, lasting 6 seconds.  <br><font color="#CFB53B">When the protection shield is broken, Nirvana Land effect will be removed.  </font>
desc_buf_ng_em_005_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Nirvana Land</font>: When attacking or attacked, players will gain a Protection Shield that can absorb damage, deal Yang Damage to surrounding enemies continuously and reduce the target's internal skill defense, lasting 7 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">When the protection shield is broken, Nirvana Land effect will be removed. </font>
desc_buf_ng_em_005_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Nirvana Land</font>: When attacking or attacked, players will gain a Protection Shield that can absorb damage, deal Yang Damage to surrounding enemies continuously and reduce the target's internal skill defense, lasting 8 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">When the protection shield is broken, Nirvana Land effect will be removed. </font>
desc_buf_ng_em_005_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Nirvana Land</font>: When attacking or attacked, players will gain a Protection Shield that can absorb damage, deal Yang Damage to surrounding enemies continuously and reduce the target's internal skill defense, lasting 9 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">When the protection shield is broken, Nirvana Land effect will be removed. </font>
desc_buf_ng_em_005_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Nirvana Land</font>: When attacking or attacked, players will gain a Protection Shield that can absorb damage, deal Yang Damage to surrounding enemies continuously and reduce the target's internal skill defense, lasting 10 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">No matter how the protection shield disappears, it will explode, deal an AOE and reduce the affected targets' Attack by 30%, lasting 10 seconds.  </font>
desc_buf_ng_gb_005_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dragon out of Water</font>: Increases your attack.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Catch Dragon</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase critical hit rate and deal an additional Splatter damage which can reduce the target's speed by 40%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_005_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dragon out of Water</font>: Increases your attack.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Catch Dragon</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase critical hit rate and deal an additional Splatter damage which can reduce the target's movement speed by 40%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_005_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dragon out of Water</font>: Increases your attack.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Catch Dragon</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase critical hit rate and deal an additional Splatter damage which can reduce the target's movement speed by 40%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_005_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dragon out of Water</font>: Increases your attack.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Catch Dragon</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase critical hit rate and deal an additional Splatter damage which can reduce the target's movement speed by 40%.
desc_buf_ng_gb_005_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dragon out of Water</font>: Increases your attack. <br><font color="#9932CD">Catch Dragon</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase critical hit rate and deal an additional Splatter damage which can reduce the target's speed by 40%. <br><font color="#CFB53B">General's Order</font>: Trigger Catch Dragon that bans the affected targets from using flying skills for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tm_005_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Extremely Soft and Cold Poison</font>: When attacking, a chance to poison the target, lasting 30 seconds, up to 4 stacks. Poison effect:  Every time the target uses skills or flying skills, he/she will lose HP continuously, lasting for 30 seconds, up to 4 stacks.
desc_buf_ng_tm_005_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Extremely Soft and Cold Poison</font>: When attacking, a chance to poison the target, lasting 30 seconds, up to 4 stacks. Poison effect:  Every time the target uses skills or flying skills, he/she will lose HP continuously, lasting for 30 seconds, up to 4 stacks.
desc_buf_ng_tm_005_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Extremely Soft and Cold Poison</font>: When attacking, a chance to poison the target, lasting 30 seconds, up to 4 stacks. Poison effect:  Every time the target uses skills or flying skills, he/she will lose HP continuously, lasting for 30 seconds, up to 4 stacks.
desc_buf_ng_tm_005_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Extremely Soft and Cold Poison</font>: When attacking, a chance to poison the target, lasting 30 seconds, up to 4 stacks. Poison effect:  Every time the target uses skills or flying skills, he/she will lose HP continuously, lasting for 30 seconds, up to 4 stacks.
desc_buf_ng_jz_005_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Phoenix Dancing and Singing</font>: When attacking or attacked, a chance to increase your attack by 20% and Damage Reduction by 22%, lasting 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_005_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Phoenix Dancing and Singing</font>: When attacking or attacked, a chance to increase your attack by 22% and Damage Reduction by 22%, lasting 16 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_005_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Phoenix Dancing and Singing</font>: When attacking or attacked, a chance to increase your attack by 25% and Damage Reduction by 22%, lasting 17 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_005_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Phoenix Dancing and Singing</font>: When attacking or attacked, a chance to increase your attack by 28% and Damage Reduction by 22%, lasting 18 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_005_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Phoenix Dancing and Singing</font>: When attacking or attacked, a chance to increase your attack by 33% and Damage Reduction by 22%, lasting 20 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Soaring Phoenix</font>: When Phoenix Dancing and Singing is triggered, it deals an additional damage in the air attack.  In some time, it is immune to Thrown, Knocked down, Knock Back once and gains Yellow Armor temporarily.
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Bloodshed in the Wind</font>: Each attack has a chance to make the target bleed continuously, lasting 6 seconds.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font>: When attacking the target with the effect of Bloodshed in the Wind, absorb the target's HP. (It can be triggered once every 0.5 second at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Bloodshed in the Wind</font>: Each attack has a chance to make the target bleed continuously, lasting 7 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font>: When attacking the target with the effect of Bloodshed in the Wind, absorb the target's HP. (It can be triggered once every 0.5 second at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Bloodshed in the Wind</font>: Each attack has a chance to make the target bleed continuously, lasting 8 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font>: When attacking the target with the effect of Bloodshed in the Wind, absorb the target's HP. (It can be triggered once every 0.5 second at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Bloodshed in the Wind</font>: Each attack has a chance to make the target bleed continuously, lasting 9 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font>: When attacking the target with the effect of Bloodshed in the Wind, absorb the target's HP. (It can be triggered once every 0.5 second at most.)
desc_buf_ng_jl_005_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Bloodshed in the Wind</font>: Each attack has a chance to make the target bleed continuously, lasting 10 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Shadow-catching Bloodthirst</font>: When attacking the target with the effect of Bloodshed in the Wind, absorb the target's HP. (It can be triggered once every 0.5 second at most.) It can also increase own critical hit rate by 6% for some time.
desc_buf_ng_jy_005_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Possessed by the Ghost</font>: When hit, have a  chance to be immune to all damages for 1 second; When attacking, a chance to increase your attack by 24% for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_005_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Possessed by the Ghost</font>: When hit, have a  chance to be immune to all damages for 1 second; When attacking, a chance to increase your attack by 28% for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_005_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Possessed by the Ghost</font>: When hit, have a  chance to be immune to all damages for 1 second; When attacking, a chance to increase your attack by 32% for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_005_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Possessed by the Ghost</font>: When hit, have a  chance to be immune to all damages for 1 second; When attacking, a chance to increase your attack by 36% for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_005_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Possessed by the Ghost</font>: When hit, have a  chance to be immune to all damages for 3 seconds; When attacking, a chance to increase your attack by 40% and own critical hit rate greatly for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_8_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>: When  attacked once, if the player is not attacked again within 6 seconds, player will recover 6.8% of maximum HP and 4.8% of maximum energy <br><font color="#9932CD">Resurrection</font>: recover a large amount of HP and Energy for teammates within a 16-meter radius of the player when the player enters Fatal Injury State, and gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Fox Mourns for Dead Hare"</font> buff (effect: skill damage is increased by 30% for 30 seconds).  <br>(Amount of HP and energy recovered is equal to 60% of player's maximum HP and 60% of player's maximum energy) <br>(After teammates recover HP and energy in this manner, cannot recover HP and energy in the same way in the next 5 minutes)
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_9_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Premium Cleansing breath</font>: 15% chance of receiving a "Premium Cleansing breath" when attacking, causing a dramatic increase in attack accuracy and immunity from Disarm and Seal skill; lasts for 16 seconds.  (Recover for 30 seconds) <br><font color="#9932CD">Harmony in Conflict</font>: has 15% chance of reducing damage received by 1% when attacked. This effect lasts for 60 seconds and can be stacked 15 times. Also increases player's skill damage by 1% for 60 seconds. The effect can stack 15 layers.
desc_buf_ng_ws_001_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Chi Circulates</font>When attacking, it has 15% chance that the use of the next skill does not cost energy and recovers 312 energy, and increases your skill Damage by 20% for 7 seconds. (Cooldown period: 20 seconds)<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Turns to Life</font><br>: When player's HP is less than 15%, any attack will trigger Energy Body Protection and 90% of the damage will be transferred to the player's energy; the effect lasts for 15 seconds.   (1 point of energy decrease for every 5 points damage)
desc_buf_ng_th_001_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rising Tide: </font>The water rages and the white wave crests resemble mountains. When attacking, player has 50% chance of causing an additional 60% damage + 603 points softness damage, and decreasing the target's speed by 40% and banning the target from using flying skills in the next 3 seconds, cooldown is 25 seconds.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Ebbing Tide</font>: Turbulent undercurrents and hidden and dangerous. When attacked, there is 50% chance of causing paralysis in the attacker for 4 seconds, cooldown is 40 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack: </font>has 50% chance of increasing player's evasion by 20% when attacked; effect lasts for 10 seconds, 27 second cooldown.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: graceful yet improper, you become invincible; successful evasion recovers 4% of maximum HP and increases your next attack damage by 60%, 4 second cooldown.
