tips_gcboxitem_count=This item can be open <font color="#08E905">{@0:次数}</font> times.
tips_itemtype_222=<font color="#FFFFFF">Pet</font>
desc_buf_ng_tm_005_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Extremely Soft and Cold Poison</font>: When attacking, there are chances to add a stack of poison to the target. Poison effect: Each time the target uses a skill or flying skill, he/she will lose HP, maximum 5 stacks (Each stack reduces an additional 3% movement damage), lasting 30 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Extremely Yin and Wet Poison</font>: When Extremely Soft and Cold Poison is refreshed, disable the enemy's skills for 3 seconds.
tips_proppack_95252=Increase maximum of Flying Skills according to power of character.
tips_proppack_95253=Increase maximum of Internal Skills according to power of character.
tip_equipmodel_3_3=<font color1="#00BFFF">Equipment dropped in core game (old world). </font>
tips_itemtype_1071=<font color="#FFFFFF">Lance (Can be used as a Staff)</font>
tips_xw_condition_ni=Requirement of breaking through acupoint reverse cultivation:
tips_xw_condition_2_ni=This acupoint has been broken through.
