tips_xw_condition_ni_1=<font color="#FF0000">You have not studied Merdian Reversal</font>
tips_marry_jn_19=Convey blessings to the newly wedded couple. They <font color="#00ff00">will each </font> get<font color="#00ff00"> 850</font> Blessing Points.
tips_school_ng_xd=Blood Blade Internal Skill
tips_school_ng_gm=Ancient Tomb Internal Skill
tips_school_ng_nl=Nianluo Dam Internal Skill
tips_school_ng_cf=Changfeng Escort Agency Internal Skill
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg_8_ngtips=Reduce all damage taken by 25%. Decrease critical hit damage by 25%. Nullify your Damage Reduction while attacking. Ignore 15% of the target's Internal and External Defense and increase your damage and critical hit damage done by 10%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_8_ngtips=Each attack can decrease the target's Breath, Spirit and Stamina by one point, and convert them into your Breath for 30 seconds.  Each time you attack, there is a 80% chance to get one extra stack of this effect, maximum 57 stacks. Upon attack, there is a chance to deal Soft Damage to the target. The higher the Breath converted, the higher damage you will deal.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wxxf_8_ngtips=Gather Chi to protect yourself while you cast a skill and while you are attacked. Grant Super Armor for four seconds. While Super Armor is applied when being hit, there is a 30% chance that the target's skill will be interrupted. When your HP is less than 50%, there are 30% chances to remove most of the debuffs.  It takes 14 seconds to recharge Chi.
desc_buf_ng_jh_108_8_ngtips=When you are attacked in the state of being forbidden from using flying skills, paralyzed, or faint, then you can continuously recover HP for three seconds, and there is a chance that all the debuffs will be eliminated once. (Direct attacks from enemies that forbid flying skills, paralyze, or cause faint will directly trigger recovery. If your HP is lower than 50%, there is a chance to recover double HP. Double Recovery effect cannot be triggered in short period.)
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_8_ngtips=There is a chance that Parry can trigger Icy Heart Defense: Parry within 11 seconds can restore HP and reduce enemy's Parry Endurance Points (the amount of recovery is 270% of Attack Damage suffered, and basic maximum recovery is 1,000 points, subject to the Internal Attack Damage. The Parry Endurance Points that enemy loses is 3% of his max Parry Endurance Points. Can be triggered once per 0.5 seconds at most), and your Parry Endurance recovery speed will increase extraordinarily when protecting yourself.
desc_buf_ng_jh_307_8_ngtips=There is a chance to deal extra damage when attacking and continuously lose HP for eight seconds.  <br/><font color="#FF3030">Deadly: </font>Target bleeds continuously and all recovery effects are reduced by 80%. All Defense is reduced by 30%.
