tips_taozhuang_10005_7=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Caltrop Poisonous Garment</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases External Defense. If you are attacked, gives you a chance to make opponents poisoned, restraining their movements and abilities to parry.
tips_taozhuang_10006_7=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Garment Soaked in Insect Venom</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Resilience. If you are attacked, gives you a chance to numb opponents' meridians and paralyze them after five times, leaving them unable to move.
tips_taozhuang_10011_7=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Caltrop Poisonous Garment</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases External Defense. If you are attacked, gives you a chance to make opponents poisoned, restraining their movements and abilities to parry.
tips_taozhuang_10012_7=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Garment Tainted with Insect Venom</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Resilience. If you are attacked, gives you a chance to numb opponents' meridians and paralyze them after five times.
tips_taozhuang_10022_7=</font><font color="#6699ff">Refined Weapon </font><br><font color="#00ff00">3 items: after 9 or more chained attacks, ignore a large amount of your opponent's parry as well as internal and external defense.
tips_taozhuang_10023_7=</font><font color="#6699ff">Flamboyant Garment </font><br><font color="#00ff00">6 items: Your attackers get blurred vision, significantly reducing their accuracy and evasion.
