desc_buf_ng_xd_001_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Gets a chance to increase all move damage inflicted by you by 5% and your movement speed by 25%. <br><font color="#9932CD"> Invade Body Parts </font>: Gets a chance to decrease the target's recovery effect by 25% in 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Gets a chance to increase all move damage inflicted by you by 10% and your movement speed by 30%. <br><font color="#9932CD"> Invade Body Parts </font>: Gets a chance to decrease the target's recovery effect by 30% in 6 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Gets a chance to increase all move damage inflicted by you by 15% and your movement speed by 35%. <br><font color="#9932CD"> Invade Body Parts </font>: Gets a chance to decrease the target's recovery effect by 35% in 7 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Gets a chance to increase all move damage inflicted by you by 20% and your movement speed by 40%. <br><font color="#9932CD"> Invade Body Parts </font>: Gets a chance to decrease the target's recovery effect by 40% in 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Gets a chance to increase all move damage inflicted by you by 25% and your movement speed by 45%. <br><font color="#9932CD"> Invade Body Parts </font>: Gets a chance to decrease the target's recovery effect by 45% in 9 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Possessed by the Blood Devil</font>: If HP is lower than 30%, gets a chance to absorb 75% of the HP damage caused to the target in 9 seconds as long as your HP is lower than 50%.
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rank Amok</font>: Gets a chance to increase all move damage inflicted by you by 30% and your movement speed by 50%. <br><font color="#9932CD"> Invade Body Parts </font>: Gets a chance to decrease the target's recovery effect by 50% in 10 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Possessed by the Blood Devil</font>: If HP is lower than 30%, gets a chance to absorb 100% of the HP damage caused to the target in 10 seconds as long as your HP is lower than 50%.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: When attacking, gets a chance to add Yin Damage to your attack in 5 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When attacked, gets a chance to continuously recover your HP in 5 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more HP will be recovered.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: When attacking, gets a chance to add Yin Damage to your attack in 6 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When attacked, gets a chance to continuously recover your HP in 6 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more HP will be recovered.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: When attacking, gets a chance to add Yin Damage to your attack in 7 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When attacked, gets a chance to continuously recover your HP in 7 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more HP will be recovered.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: When attacking, gets a chance to add Yin Damage to your attack in 8 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When attacked, gets a chance to continuously recover your HP in 8 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more HP will be recovered.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: When attacking, gets a chance to add Yin Damage to your attack in 9 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When attacked, gets a chance to continuously recover your HP in 9 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more HP will be recovered. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Yang Meshes With Yin</font>: Immune to most of the negative states when Advancement Of Yin and Cessation Of Yang both exist.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Advancement Of Yin</font>: When attacking, gets a chance to add Yin Damage to your attack in 10 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation Of Yang</font>: When attacked, gets a chance to continuously recover your HP in 10 seconds. The more your Internal Attack Damage is, the more HP will be recovered. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Yang Meshes With Yin</font>: Immune to most of the negative states when Advancement Of Yin and Cessation Of Yang both exist.
