desc_buf_ng_cf_002_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to absorb 12% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: There is a chance to save Force when taking damage every time. When you attack the target, all the Force will be attached and deal additional hardness damage to the target. The more powerful the Melee Damage is, the more Force and damage are.
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to absorb 15% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: There is a chance to save Force when taking damage every time. When you attack the target, all the Force will be attached and deal additional hardness damage to the target. The more powerful the Melee Damage is, the more Force and damage are.
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to absorb 18% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: There is a chance to save Force when taking damage every time. When you attack the target, all the Force will be attached and deal additional hardness damage to the target. The more powerful the Melee Damage is, the more Force and damage are.
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to absorb 21% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: There is a chance to save Force when taking damage every time. When you attack the target, all the Force will be attached and deal additional hardness damage to the target. The more powerful the Melee Damage is, the more Force and damage are.
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to absorb 25% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: Save Force when taking damage every time. When you attack the target, all the Force will be attached and deal additional hardness damage to the target. The more powerful the Melee Damage is, the more Force and damage are.
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to absorb 30% of the damage you take in the next seven attacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: Save Force when taking damage every time. When you attack the target, all the Force will be attached and deal additional hardness damage to the target. The more powerful the Melee Damage is, the more Force and damage are.
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_1_ngtips=There is a chance to create a Fist Force upon every attack: increases Melee Damage by four. The Fist Force is unable to affect for a short period when reaching ten stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font>: If you are attacked when the Fist Force reaches full stacks, there is a chance to create Force which makes you resist 120 damage at most for ten seconds.
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_2_ngtips=There is a chance to create a Fist Force upon every attack: increases Melee Damage by six. The Fist Force is unable to affect for a short period when reaching ten stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font>: If you are attacked when the Fist Force reaches full stacks, there is a chance to create Force which makes you resist 180 damage at most for ten seconds.
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_3_ngtips=There is a chance to create a Fist Force upon every attack: increases Melee Damage by eight. The Fist Force is unable to affect for a short period when reaching ten stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font>: If you are attacked when the Fist Force reaches full stacks, there is a chance to create Force which makes you resist 240 damage at most for ten seconds.
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_4_ngtips=There is a chance to create a Fist Force upon every attack: increases Melee Damage by ten. The Fist Force is unable to affect for a short period when reaching ten stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font>: If you are attacked when the Fist Force reaches full stacks, it will become Force which makes you resist 320 damage at most for ten seconds.
desc_buf_ng_cf_001_5_ngtips=There is a chance to create a Fist Force upon every attack: increases Melee Damage by 12. The Fist Force is unable to affect for a short period when reaching ten stacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Force Defense</font>: If you are attacked when the Fist Force reaches full stacks, it will become Force which makes you resist 400 damage at most for ten seconds.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_1_ngtips=When you are attacked, there is a chance to throw Miasma to the target. The target will lose HP continuously in four seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Sweet Erosive Bone</font>: When being attacked by target who is hit by Miasma, there is a chance to deal 10% Damage to the target.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_2_ngtips=When you are attacked, there is a chance to throw Miasma to the target. The target will lose HP continuously in five seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Sweet Erosive Bone</font>: When being attacked by target who is hit by Miasma, there is a chance to deal 12% Damage to the target.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_3_ngtips=When you are attacked, there is a chance to throw Miasma to the target. The target will lose HP continuously in six seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Sweet Erosive Bone</font>: When being attacked by target who is hit by Miasma, there is a chance to deal 14% Damage to the target.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_4_ngtips=When you are attacked, there is a chance to throw Miasma to the target. The target will lose HP continuously in seven seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Sweet Erosive Bone</font>: When being attacked by target who is hit by Miasma, you will deal 17% Damage to the target.
desc_buf_ng_nl_001_5_ngtips=When you are attacked, there is a chance to throw Miasma to the target. The target will lose HP continuously in eight seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Sweet Erosive Bone</font>: When being attacked by target who is hit by Miasma, you will deal 20% Damage to the target.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for five seconds.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 12% for five seconds.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for six seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 15% for six seconds.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for seven seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 18% for seven seconds.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for eight seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 21% for eight seconds.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for ten seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 25% for ten seconds. <font color="#CFB53B">Heaven Demo Dreamland</font>: When being influenced by Demon Song and Addicted Dance at the same time, the target will be in the Dreamland and get confused. He will lose direction and Rage.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demon Song</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gather Internal Skill and make sharp sound to deal continuous Yin Damage to the target for 12 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Addicted Dance</font>: When being attacked, there is a chance to make the attacker fatigue and all of his attack damage is reduced by 30% for 12 seconds. <font color="#CFB53B">Heaven Demo Dreamland</font>: When being influenced by Demon Song and Addicted Dance at the same time, the target will be in the Dreamland and get confused. He will lose direction and Rage.
tips_itemtype_2496=Changfeng Escort Agency Contribution Token
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_tm_hf01=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to decrease target's All Attributes by 15 and Accuracy by 50 for six seconds. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_tm_hf02=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to decrease target's All Attributes by 15 and Energy by 20 for six seconds. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_tm_hf03=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to make target Paralyzed for one second. Inflicts extra 50 damage when target is attacked. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_tm_hf04=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to make target Poisoned for three second. Slows it down and deals 100 HP damage for three seconds. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_tm_hf05=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to decrease target's All Attributes by 30 and make it Paralyzed for two seconds. Inflicts extra 50 damage when target is attacked. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_tm_hf06=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to make target disarmed and unable to parry for three seconds. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_smdh_red=Poison: With a {@0:sum}% chance to reduce target's 800 External Defense and 100 Internal External Parry by 100 within 6 seconds. Inflicts Bleeding effect. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_smdh_Orange=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to debuff target with Scald within five seconds, dealing 30 damage per second. Inflicts extra damage when target is attacked. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_smdh_yellow=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to make target Paralyzed for two seconds. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_smdh_green=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to make target dizzy for 1 second. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_smdh_cyan=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to make target carry with seeds within six seconds, and debuff it with Vampire when it is attacked. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_smdh_blue=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to make target unable to use skills or parry for three seconds. {@1:num} uses remaining.
tips_duyao_buff_nlb_smdh_purple=Poison: {@0:sum}% chance to debuff target with Confusion within three seconds and cost it tentimes Energy to use Flying Skills. {@1:num} uses remaining.
