tips_count_cfbj_slyb_001=Use the <font color="#ffff00">Cannon near the deck</font> to spitcher the pirate ships.
tips_count_cfbj_slyb_002=Fetch water from the <font color="#ffff00">water tank on the deck</font> to put out the fire. Be careful of the pirate. Kill them before they set fire again, otherwise the ship will be burned out and everybody will die.
tips_count_cfbj_slyb_003=Kill the pirates, pick up the <font color="#ffff00">broadsword</font> and cut off the iron chain to prevent the pirates from borading the ship. And kill the Pirate Lieutenant Xue Kun at last.
tips_count_cfbj_slyb_005=Prevent the pirates from snatching the goods. If all of the goods are snatches by the pirates, the reputation of the Escort Agency will plummet.
tips_count_cfbj_slyb_004=Ship Durability. The Durability decreases every time when the pirates set fire successfully. When the Durability is 0, the ship will sink.
