tips_jyz_count_sl_2_6_0=Please collect 5 of each of the following items: gaultheria, yellow wine, linen, white poplar wood, and mint. This task is recommended for a solo player, and can be completed only once. Excess materials will not be accepted.<br/>The doctor who gives you this task can be found at the following locations: <br/>Qiandeng Town (387, 1015)<br/>Yanyu Villa (134,1373)<br/>Jiming Posthouse (-87, 982) <br/>Chengdu (215, 760)
tips_jyz_count_sl_2_6_1=Please collect 5 of each of the following items: gaultheria, yellow wine, linen, white poplar wood, and mint. This task is recommended for a solo player, and can be completed only once. Excess materials will not be accepted.<br/>The doctor who gives you this task can be found at the following locations: <br/>Qiandeng Town (387, 1015)<br/>Yanyu Villa (134,1373)<br/>Jiming Posthouse (-87, 982) <br/>Chengdu (215, 760)
tips_itemtype_87=<font color="#FFFFFF">Special Item</font>
desc_item_wfqb01_0=Directly know the secret of the enemy's sect. Using it in spying can get 5 pieces of Intelligence immediately. The number of spying Intelligence will not be more than 10. Please use it carefully. <font color="#ff0000">You can get it through Roaming the World, Eight Schools Tournament, Dragon and Tiger Tournament, Team-buying Gift Pack, Egg Breaking Activity and gift packs of other events. </font>(The number of spying Intelligence will not be more than 10. Please use it carefully.)
tips_xw_condition=Requirement of breaking through acupoint:
tips_xw_condition_2=This acupoint has been broken through.
tips_itemtype_212=Guild Item
ui_tonic_001=You need to spend <font color="#0000FF">10 Silver Taels or Silver Coins</font> to purchase Catalyst (Paid automatically).
ui_tonic_002=Activating the corresponding Meridians will boost the effect of the consumed Artifact (You need to increase the enhancing effect of Artifact before increasing that of Secret Script). Details:
tips_marry_jn_4=When throwing white flower petals, there can be up to <font color="#00ff00">24</font> guests around the couple. They will receive 2,000 cultivation points, 20,000 Chi and 100%<br> inner cultivation enhancement in 6 minutes. <br>After using it, the <font color="#00ff00">couple</font> will receive <font color="#00ff00">100</font> blessing points.
tips_marry_jn_5=When throwing pink flower petals, there can be up to <font color="#00ff00">36</font> guests around the couple. They will receive 3,000 cultivation points, 50,000 Chi and 200%<br> inner cultivation enhancement in 6 minutes. <br>After using it, the <font color="#00ff00">couple</font> will receive <font color="#00ff00">500</font> blessing points.
tips_marry_jn_6=When throwing colorful flower petals, there can be up to <font color="#00ff00">48</font> guests around the couple. They will receive 4,000 cultivation points, 80,000 Chi and 500%<br> inner cultivation enhancement in 6 minutes. <br>After using it, the <font color="#00ff00">couple</font> will receive <font color="#00ff00">800</font> blessing points.
tips_marry_jn_7=Send the newly-wed couple a Red Envelope worth <font color="#00ff00">50</font> Liang Silver (Received by the groom)./font>
tips_marry_jn_8=Send the newly-wed couple a Red Envelope worth <font color="#00ff00">100</font> Liang Silver (Received by the groom)./font>
tips_marry_jn_9=Send the newly-wed couple a Red Envelope worth <font color="#00ff00">150</font> Liang Silver (Received by the groom)./font>
tips_marry_jn_10=Toss <font color="#00ff00">5</font> pieces of Wedding Money to the guests.<br>After that the <font color="#00ff00">groom</font> will receive <font color="#00ff00">50</font> Blessing Points.
tips_marry_jn_11=Toss <font color="#00ff00">10</font> Red Packets to the guests.<br>After that the <font color="#00ff00">groom</font> will receive <font color="#00ff00">100</font> Blessing Points.
tips_marry_jn_12=Toss <font color="#00ff00">15</font> Gift Bags to the guests.<br>After that the <font color="#00ff00">groom</font> will receive <font color="#00ff00">150</font> Blessing Points.
tips_marry_jn_13=Send wishes to the newly-wed couple and they <font color="#00ff00">each</font> will get <font color="#00ff00">10</font> blessing points.
tips_marry_jn_14=Send wishes to the newly-wed couple and they <font color="#00ff00">each</font> will get <font color="#00ff00">20</font> blessing points.
tips_marry_jn_15=Send wishes to the newly-wed couple and they <font color="#00ff00">each</font> will get <font color="#00ff00">30</font> blessing points.
tips_marry_jn_16=Send a 3-Star Lore Gift to the happy couple <font color="#00ff00">(Received by the groom)</font>.
tips_marry_jn_17=Give a Ferret to the happy couple <font color="#00ff00">(Received by the groom)</font>.
tips_eqp_wrist_01_1=After parry the attack, External Parry will by increased a lot and Internal Skill Conversion will be increased for six seconds. It can only be triggered once in a certain period.
tips_taozhuang_10014_6=</font><font color="#6699ff">Energy Surging </font><br><font color="#00ff00">3 items: Withhold your attack for 8 seconds and the next attack will deal extra damage. The more the Energy remains, the greater the damage will be.
tips_taozhuang_10018_6=</font><font color="#6699ff">Energy Erupting</font><br><font color="#00ff00">3 items: Withhold your attack for 12 seconds and the next attack will deal extra damage. The more the Energy remains, the greater the damage will be.
tips_btn_home_7=Home Durability: <font color="#00FF00">{@0:当前耐久}/{@1:总耐久}</font><br>If the home owner doesn't repair his or her home when its durability is reduced to <font color="#00FF00">0</font>, the home will be repossessed in <font color="#00FF00">30 days</font> and cannot be restored.
tips_btn_home_22=Increase home Feng Shui by placing furniture in right places. When entering the home for the first time each day, the home owner will get Feng Shui buff for <font color="#00FF00">two hours</font>.
tips_item_amount=Quantity: <font color="{@0:color}">{@1:cur}</font>
desc_buf_ng_sj_001_9_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Golden Lock</font>:Locks incoming attacks for 6 seconds while restoring HP by 7.2% and Energy by 5.2%<br><font color="#9932CD">Critical Healing</font>: When injured, restores HP and Energy to yourself and allies within 16 meters. Additionally it activates <font color="#f9fc00">“Fox Mourns for Dead Hare”</font>: Damage increased by 30% for 30 seconds.<br>(Health and Energy are restored by 60% of their maximum value)<br>(Allies cannot receive this restoration effect aagin for 5 minutes)
desc_buf_ng_xj_001_10_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">一Cleansing Breath</font>: When attacking there is a 15% chance to activate Chi of Three Purities - Increased accuracy, resistant to being disarmed and can seal enemy skills. Active for 17 seconds. 30 second cooldown.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi of Peace</font>: Chance to reduce damage from enemy attacks by 1% for 60 seconds (Can be stacked up to 15 times). Increases damage dealt by 1.2% for 60 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times (Can be stacked up to 15 times).
desc_buf_ng_ws_001_8_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Chi Circulates</font>: Attacks have a 15% chance to bypass Energy consumption while restoring 378 Energy. Additionally, damage is increased by 20% for 8 seconds. (20 second cooldown)<br><font color="#FF3030">Chi Turns to Life</font><br>Once health drops below 15%, expend Energy to withstand 90% of damage received for 16 seconds.(Convert loss of 6 HP into loss of 1 Energy. 60 second cooldown.)
desc_buf_ng_th_001_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rising Tide</font>: Grants a 50% chance to increase damage by 65% with an addition 736 Softness damage for 3 seconds. Also reducing target movement speed by 50% and disables Evasion. 25 second cooldown.<br><font color="#9932CD">Ebbing Tide</font>: Grants a 50% chance to paralyze the attacker for 4 seconds. 40 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_yh_001_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Anticipating an Attack</font>:  When attacked there is a 50% chance to increase Evasion by 20% for 11 seconds. 26 second cooldown.<br><font color="#9932CD">Grafting</font>: Evading an attack restores 5% HP and increases the damage for your next attack by 60%. 4 second cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_wg_001_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Restore Constitution: </font>When attacking, absorbs 309 HP with each attack. (More Energy is absorbed depending on the Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Red Mist: </font>Parrying and attacking recovers 56 Energy. (More Energy is absorbed depending on Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br>(This Internal Skill can only be used by players who have been castrated)
tips_itemtype_1913=Raw Jade Item - Twin Axes
tip_equipmodel_28=<font color1="#00BFFF">School jade items - Mount Hua Sect</font>
tip_equipmodel_29=<font color1="#00BFFF">School jade items - Divine Water Palace</font>
