tip_equipmodel_29_29=<font color1="#00BFFF">School equipment exchange - Divine Water Palace</font>
tip_equipmodel_30_30=<font color1="#00BFFF">School-Redeemed Equipment - Wudang</font>
desc_buf_ng_xd_001_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Ran Amok</font>: Grants a chance to increase damage by 30% and movement speed by 50% for 12 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Invade Body Parts</font>: Attacking a target may reduce their restoration skills by 50% for 12 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Blood Demon Armor</font>: When your HP drops below 30%, your attacks have a chance within the next 12 seconds to absorb 100% damage as HP as long as your HP remains below 50%.
desc_buf_ng_gm_001_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Advancement of Yin</font>: Gain a chance to add Yin damage to your attacks for 11 seconds. The stronger your internal skill, the greater damage you inflict. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cessation of Yang</font>: When attacked, gain a chance to restore HP over 11 seconds. The stronger your internal skill, the more HP you recover. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Yang Meshes with Yin</font>: When Advancement of Yin and Cessation of Yang are both active, gain immunity against many negative conditions.
tips_ng_ssg=Divine Water Palace
tips_ng_hs=Mount Hua Sect
tips_ng_bh=For guild use
desc_buf_ng_cf_002_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Pick</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to absorb 36% damage from the next 7 attacks. <br><font color="#9932CD">Cloud Lead</font>: Gather strength each time you absorb damage, increasing the damage you inflict. The closer you are to your target, the more damge you inflict.
desc_buf_ng_nl_002_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demonic Chant</font>: While attacking, there is a chance to emit a shrill sound which inflicts Yin damage over 15 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Ghostly Dance</font>:When attacked, there is a chance to exhaust the attacker, lowering their attack power by 30% for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Demonic Illusion</font>: Targets under both the Demonic Chant and Ghostly Dance effect will suffer from hallucinations, their movement keys randomized and their Rage will gradually dissipate.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_001_1_ngtips=When attacked, grants a chance for Chi to enter the target's body and inflict Yin damage.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_001_2_ngtips=Condensable gas into water has a chance to break into the target body of a female group drops inflicting damage when attacked.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_001_3_ngtips=Condensable gas into water has a chance to break into the target body of a female group drops inflicting damage when attacked.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_001_4_ngtips=When attacked, grants a chance for Chi to enter the target's body and inflict Yin damage.<br><font color="#9932CD">Watery End</font>: Randomly damages multiple targets with yin damage. Damage dealt gradually decreases.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_001_5_ngtips=Condensable gas into water has a chance to break into the target body of a female group drops inflicting damage when attacked. <br> <font color="#9932CD"> water potential impermanence </font>: drops randomly shuttle and cause damage in the shade between multiple targets, its power will be gradually decreasing.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 12% or decrease the target's defense by 12%. Active for 7 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 12% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 12%. Active for 7 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 15% or decrease the target's defense by 15%. Active for 8 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 15% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 15%. Active for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 18% or decrease the target's defense by 18%. Active for 9 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 18% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 18%. Active for 9 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 21% or decrease the target's defense by 21%. Active for 10 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 21% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 21%. Active for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 25% or decrease the target's defense by 25%. Active for 11 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 21% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 25%. Active for 11 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Shifting Tidal Wave</font>: Shocking Tide and Mountainous Waves will continue to restore your health while draining it from the target.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 30% or decrease the target's defense by 30%. Active for 12 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 30% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 30%. Active for 12 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Shifting Tidal Wave</font>: Shocking Tide and Mountainous Waves will continue to restore your health while draining it from the target.
desc_buf_ng_ssg_002_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Shocking Tide</font>Chance to increase attack damage by 30% or decrease the target's defense by 30%. Active for 14 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mountainous Waves</font>: Attacks have a chance to increase defense by 30% or lower the damage of enemy attacks by 30%. Active for 14 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Shifting Tidal Wave</font>: Shocking Tide and Mountainous Waves will continue to restore your health while draining it from the target.
desc_buf_ng_hs_001_1_ngtips=When attacked, you have a chance to reduce damage by 8% for 4 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_hs_001_2_ngtips=When attacked, you have a chance to reduce damage by 11% for 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_hs_001_3_ngtips=When attacked, you have a chance to reduce damage by 14% for 6 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_hs_001_4_ngtips=When attacked, you have a chance to reduce damage by 17% for 8 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mental Hold - First Defense</font>: Attacks cause an addition 17% soft damage.
desc_buf_ng_hs_001_5_ngtips=When attacked, you have a chance to reduce damage by 20% for 10 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Mental Hold - First Defense</font>: Attacks cause an additional 20% soft damage.
desc_buf_ng_hs_002_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soul Power</font>Each attack has a chance to deal additional yin damage. Active for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Purple Vortex</font>: Parrying attacks grants a chance to reduce the targets Rage. Active for 5 seconds, then enters a cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_hs_002_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soul Power</font>Each attack has a chance to deal additional yin damage. Active for 6 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Purple Vortex</font>: Parrying attacks grants a chance to reduce the target's Rage. Active for 6 seconds, then enters a cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_hs_002_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soul Power</font>Each attack has a chance to deal additional yin damage. Active for 7 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Purple Vortex</font>: Parrying attacks grants a chance to reduce the target's Rage. Active for 7 seconds, then enters a cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_hs_002_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soul Power</font>Each attack has a chance to deal additional yin damage. Active for 8 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Purple Vortex</font>: Parrying attacks grants a chance to reduce the target's Rage. Active for 8 seconds, then enters a cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_hs_002_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soul Power</font>Each attack has a chance to deal additional yin damage. Active for 9 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Purple Vortex</font>: Parrying attacks grants a chance to reduce the target's Rage. Active for 9 seconds, then enters a cooldown.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Air transport</font>：Has rate to clear cooldown of Soul Power and Purple Vortex when attack or defense.
desc_buf_ng_hs_002_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soul Power</font>Each attack has a chance to deal additional yin damage. Active for 10 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Purple Vortex</font>: Parrying attacks grants a chance to reduce the target's Rage. Active for 10 seconds, then enters a cooldown.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Air transport</font>：Has rate to clear cooldown of Soul Power and Purple Vortex when attack or defense.
desc_buf_ng_hs_002_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soul Power</font>Each attack has a chance to deal additional yin damage. Active for 11 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Purple Vortex</font>: Parrying attacks grants a chance to reduce the target's Rage. Active for 11 seconds, then enters a cooldown.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Air transport</font>：Has rate to clear cooldown of Soul Power and Purple Vortex when attack or defense.
desc_buf_ng_bh_001_1_ngtips=<<font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Time</font>: For 6 seconds, your attacks have a certain chance of gaining Yang damage. <br><font color="#9932CD">Favorable Terrain</font>: For 6 seconds, <br><font color="#CC3299">Only one effect from either Heaven's Time or Favorable Terrain can be active for a period of time. This effect takes place only when the player's character or the enemy character is targeted.</font>
desc_buf_ng_bh_001_2_ngtips=<<font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Time</font>: For 7 seconds, your attacks have a certain chance of gaining Yang damage. <br><font color="#9932CD">Favorable Terrain</font>: For 7 seconds, <br><font color="#CC3299">Only one effect from either Heaven's Time or Favorable Terrain can be active for a period of time. This effect takes place only when the player's character or the enemy character is targeted.</font>
