desc_buf_ng_bh_003_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030"> days </font>: attack has a chance to make their own within 6 seconds all attacks overcast additional damage. <br> <font color="#9932CD"> geography </font>: when there is the chance to make their own attack within 6 seconds continued to absorb some damage. <br> <font color="#CC3299"> "day" and "location" can only be triggered one of the effects over time, and its goal is to effect only the player or the object is triggered when players take effect. </font>
