ui_wxjz_fly=<font color="#f9fc00">Flying Cloud Jumping</font><br>Winter's Light sword array skill<br>Recovery: 30 seconds<br>Range: 15 meters<br>Click on where you want to go, then left-click to use skill. While skill is in use, match the circles on the screen to reach your destination.
ui_wxjz_throw=<font color="#f9fc00">Flying Sword of Honor</font><br>Winter's Light sword array skill<br>Recovery: 30 seconds<br>Range: 30 meters<br>Throw your sword to break the array eye. The shorter the throw, the more damage you inflict.
tips_school_ng_hs=Mount Hua Internal Skill
tips_school_ng_ss=Divine Water Palace Internal Skill
tips_jyz_6_1=Tier Six Internal Skill
desc_buf_ng_wd_006_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dissolve Chi</font>: Grants a chance to absorb 15% of damage received and deal damage to the attacker. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lead Force</font>: Grants a chance to absorb 15% of damage received and hurt the attacker with Softness damage.
desc_buf_ng_wd_006_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dissolve Chi</font>: Grants a chance to absorb 18% of damage received and deal damage to the attacker. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lead Force</font>: Grants a chance to absorb 18% of damage received and hurt the attacker with Softness damage.
desc_buf_ng_wd_006_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dissolve Chi</font>: Grants a chance to absorb 21% of damage received and deal damage to the attacker. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lead Force</font>: Grants a chance to absorb 21% of damage received and hurt the attacker with Softness damage.
desc_buf_ng_wd_006_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dissolve Chi</font>: Grants a chance to absorb 25% of damage received and deal damage to the attacker. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lead Force</font>: Grants a chance to absorb 25% of damage received and hurt the attacker with Softness damage.
desc_buf_ng_wd_006_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dissolve Chi</font>: Grants a chance to absorb 25% of damage received and deal damage to the attacker. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lead Force</font>: Grants a chance to absorb 25% of damage received and hurt the attacker with Softness damage.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Way of the Tai Chi</font>: Chance to activate Dissolve Chi and Lead Force, increasing damage by 10% and redirecting damage back to the attacker. Can be stacked up to 5 times. Active for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sl_006_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Bitter Transmigration</font>: Chance for attack damage to be increased by 8% within 8 seconds and grants an 8% chance to bypass a target's defense.<br><font color="#9932CD">Solitary Alms</font>: Parrying grants a chance to recover some HP for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sl_006_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Bitter Transmigration</font>: Chance for attack damage to be increased by 9% within 9 seconds and grants an 9% chance to bypass a target's defense.<br><font color="#9932CD">Solitary Alms</font>: Parrying grants a chance to recover some HP for 9 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sl_006_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Bitter Transmigration</font>: Chance for attack damage to be increased by 10% within 10 seconds and grants an 10% chance to bypass a target's defense.<br><font color="#9932CD">Solitary Alms</font>: Parrying grants a chance to recover some HP for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sl_006_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Bitter Transmigration</font>: Chance for attack damage to be increased by 12% within 12 seconds and grants an 12% chance to bypass a target's defense.<br><font color="#9932CD">Solitary Alms</font>: Parrying grants a chance to recover some HP for 12 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sl_006_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Bitter Transmigration</font>: Chance for attack damage to be increased by 15% within 15 seconds and grants an 15% chance to bypass a target's defense.<br><font color="#9932CD">Solitary Alms</font>: Parrying grants a chance to recover some HP for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#CFB53B">On the Go</font>: Attacks have a chance to break defense, cause fainting or sealing skills.
desc_buf_ng_gb_006_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Transcendence</font>: When attacking, you increase your chance of ignoring enemy defense by 15% for 8 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lunar Flame</font>: Gain a chance to deal extra Yang damage with your attack.
desc_buf_ng_gb_006_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Transcendence</font>: When attacking, you increase your chance of ignoring enemy defense by 18% for 9 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lunar Flame</font>: Gain a chance to deal extra Yang damage with your attack.
desc_buf_ng_gb_006_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Transcendence</font>: When attacking, you increase your chance of ignoring enemy defense by 21% for 10 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lunar Flame</font>: Gain a chance to deal extra Yang damage with your attack.
desc_buf_ng_gb_006_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Transcendence</font>: When attacking, you increase your chance of ignoring enemy defense by 25% for 11 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lunar Flame</font>: Gain a chance to deal extra Yang damage with your attack.
desc_buf_ng_gb_006_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Transcendence</font>: When attacking, you increase your chance of ignoring enemy defense by 30% for 12 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Lunar Flame</font>: Gain a chance to deal extra Yang damage with your attack. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Solar Calamity</font>: When being attacked, gain a chance to inflict the attacker with an attribute-specific damage. Gain the chance to ignore enemy defense, which can directly or indirectly increase your attack power.
desc_buf_ng_em_006_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Blooming Season</font>: Receive a stack of Wilting effect every time you attack or are attacked. When Wilting is stacked 6 times, you gain the Blossoms effect, which reduces 15% of the damage you receive while adding 15% soft damage to your attacks. This effect ends after you attack or are attacked 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Soul Collecting Lotus</font>: Recover 8% HP when you receive damage that otherwise would have been fatal. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_em_006_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Blooming Season</font>: Receive a stack of Wilting effect every time you attack or are attacked. When Wilting is stacked 6 times, you gain the Blossoms effect, which reduces 18% of the damage you receive while adding 18% soft damage to your attacks. This effect ends after you attack or are attacked 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Soul Collecting Lotus</font>: Recover 9% HP when you receive damage that otherwise would have been fatal. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_em_006_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Blooming Season</font>: Receive a stack of Wilting effect every time you attack or are attacked. When Wilting is stacked 6 times, you gain the Blossoms effect, which reduces 21% of the damage you receive while adding 21% soft damage to your attacks. This effect ends after you attack or are attacked 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Soul Collecting Lotus</font>: Recover 10% HP when you receive damage that otherwise would have been fatal. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_em_006_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Blooming Season</font>: Receive a stack of Wilting effect every time you attack or are attacked. When Wilting is stacked 6 times, you gain the Blossoms effect, which reduces 25% of the damage you receive while adding 25% soft damage to your attacks. This effect ends after you attack or are attacked 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Soul Collecting Lotus</font>: Recover 12% HP when you receive damage that otherwise would have been fatal. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_em_006_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Blooming Season</font>: Receive a stack of Wilting effect every time you attack or are attacked. When Wilting is stacked 6 times, you gain the Blossoms effect, which reduces 30% of the damage you receive while adding 30% soft damage to your attacks. This effect ends after you attack or are attacked 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Soul Collecting Lotus</font>: Recover 15% HP when you receive damage that otherwise would have been fatal. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_buf_ng_jy_006_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Asura's Arrival</font>: Striking a target that fails to parry grants a chance to deal an additional 20% Yin damage.<br><font color="#9932CD">Blood Feast</font>: Your attack has a chance to gain the Blood Ritual effect. Once the effect ends, the target receives Yin damage equal to 15% to damage sustained during the prior 6 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_006_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Asura's Arrival</font>: Striking a target that fails to parry grants a chance to deal an additional 25% Yin damage.<br><font color="#9932CD">Blood Feast</font>: Your attack has a chance to gain the Blood Ritual effect. Once the effect ends, the target receives Yin damage equal to 18% to damage sustained during the prior 7 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_006_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Asura's Arrival</font>: Striking a target that fails to parry grants a chance to deal an additional 30% Yin damage.<br><font color="#9932CD">Blood Feast</font>: Your attack has a chance to gain the Blood Ritual effect. Once the effect ends, the target receives Yin damage equal to 21% to damage sustained during the prior 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_006_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Asura's Arrival</font>: Striking a target that fails to parry grants a chance to deal an additional 36% Yin damage.<br><font color="#9932CD">Blood Feast</font>: Your attack has a chance to gain the Blood Ritual effect. Once the effect ends, the target receives Yin damage equal to 25% to damage sustained during the prior 9 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jy_006_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Asura's Arrival</font>: Striking a target that fails to parry grants a chance to deal an additional 50% Yin damage.<br><font color="#9932CD">Blood Feast</font>: Your attack has a chance to gain the Blood Ritual effect. Once the effect ends, the target receives Yin damage equal to 30% to damage sustained during the prior 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_006_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Fear for the Cold Moon</font>: Chance to receive 5 stacks of Cold Moon - increases damage by 6% with 6% immunity from incoming attacks. Each attack will remove a stack. Active for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Hidden Fragrance Drenches the Bone</font>: Parrying grants a chance to receive 5 stacks of Hidden Fragrance - Parrying increases damage by 6% and increases the rate to bypass target's defense by 6%. Parrying or being parried will remove a stack. Active for 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_006_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Fear for the Cold Moon</font>: Chance to receive 5 stacks of Cold Moon - increases damage by 7% with 7% immunity from incoming attacks. Each attack will remove a stack. Active for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Hidden Fragrance Drenches the Bone</font>: Parrying grants a chance to receive 5 stacks of Hidden Fragrance - Parrying increases damage by 7% and increases the rate to bypass target's defense by 7%. Parrying or being parried will remove a stack. Active for 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_006_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Fear for the Cold Moon</font>: Chance to receive 5 stacks of Cold Moon - increases damage by 8% with 8% immunity from incoming attacks. Each attack will remove a stack. Active for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Hidden Fragrance Drenches the Bone</font>: Parrying grants a chance to receive 5 stacks of Hidden Fragrance - Parrying increases damage by 8% and increases the rate to bypass target's defense by 8%. Parrying or being parried will remove a stack. Active for 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_006_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Fear for the Cold Moon</font>: Chance to receive 5 stacks of Cold Moon - increases damage by 9% with 9% immunity from incoming attacks. Each attack will remove a stack. Active for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Hidden Fragrance Drenches the Bone</font>: Parrying grants a chance to receive 5 stacks of Hidden Fragrance - Parrying increases damage by 9% and increases the rate to bypass target's defense by 9%. Parrying or being parried will remove a stack. Active for 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jz_006_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Fear for the Cold Moon</font>: Chance to receive 5 stacks of Cold Moon - increases damage by 10% with 10% immunity from incoming attacks. Each attack will remove a stack. Active for 15 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Hidden Fragrance Drenches the Bone</font>: Parrying grants a chance to receive 5 stacks of Hidden Fragrance - Parrying increases damage by 10% and increases the rate to bypass target's defense by 10%. Parrying or being parried will remove a stack. Active for 15 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jl_006_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Lonely Wolf Howls at the Moon</font>:Strikes the target with a 6 hit combo, while the next 3 attacks absorb 30% of damage received as HP.<br><font color="#9932CD">Eclipsed Shadow</font>:  When your health is above 70%, target has a chance to receive Cruor effect, reducing Energy used by your next attack by 2%. Active for 100 seconds. Can be stacked up to 8 times.  This effect will restore your health if it drops below 30%. The more this effect is stacked, the more HP will be restored.
desc_buf_ng_jl_006_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Lonely Wolf Howls at the Moon</font>:Strikes the target with a 6 hit combo, while the next 3 attacks absorb 36% of damage received as HP.<br><font color="#9932CD">Eclipsed Shadow</font>:  When your health is above 70%, target has a chance to receive Cruor effect, reducing Energy used by your next attack by 2%. Active for 100 seconds. Can be stacked up to 9 times.  This effect will restore your health if it drops below 30%. The more this effect is stacked, the more HP will be restored.
desc_buf_ng_jl_006_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Lonely Wolf Howls at the Moon</font>:Strikes the target with a 6 hit combo, while the next 3 attacks absorb 42% of damage received as HP.<br><font color="#9932CD">Eclipsed Shadow</font>:  When your health is above 70%, target has a chance to receive Cruor effect, reducing Energy used by your next attack by 2%. Active for 100 seconds. Can be stacked up to 10 times.  This effect will restore your health if it drops below 30%. The more this effect is stacked, the more HP will be restored.
desc_buf_ng_jl_006_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Lonely Wolf Howls at the Moon</font>:Strikes the target with a 6 hit combo, while the next 3 attacks absorb 50% of damage received as HP.<br><font color="#9932CD">Eclipsed Shadow</font>:  When your health is above 70%, target has a chance to receive Cruor effect, reducing Energy used by your next attack by 2%. Active for 100 seconds. Can be stacked up to 12 times.  This effect will restore your health if it drops below 30%. The more this effect is stacked, the more HP will be restored.
desc_buf_ng_jl_006_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Lonely Wolf Howls at the Moon</font>:Strikes the target with a 6 hit combo, while the next 3 attacks absorb 60% of damage received as HP.<br><font color="#9932CD">Eclipsed Shadow</font>:  When your health is above 70%, target has a chance to receive Cruor effect, reducing Energy used by your next attack by 2%. Active for 100 seconds. Can be stacked up to 15 times.  This effect will restore your health if it drops below 30%. The more this effect is stacked, the more HP will be restored.
desc_buf_ng_tm_006_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demonic Horde</font> Chance to increase critical hit damage by 2% while reducing the attacker's critical hit damage by 2% for 30 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times.<br><font color="#9932CD">Furious Culling</font>: Grants a chance to increase critical hits by 2% and increases general damage by 2%. Removed after stacking 5 times.
desc_buf_ng_tm_006_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demonic Horde</font> Chance to increase critical hit damage by 3% while reducing the attacker's critical hit damage by 3% for 30 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times.<br><font color="#9932CD">Furious Culling</font>: Grants a chance to increase critical hits by 3% and increases general damage by 3%. Removed after stacking 5 times.
desc_buf_ng_tm_006_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demonic Horde</font> Chance to increase critical hit damage by 4% while reducing the attacker's critical hit damage by 4% for 30 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times.<br><font color="#9932CD">Furious Culling</font>: Grants a chance to increase critical hits by 4% and increases general damage by 4%. Removed after stacking 5 times.
desc_buf_ng_tm_006_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demonic Horde</font> Chance to increase critical hit damage by 5% while reducing the attacker's critical hit damage by 5% for 30 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times.<br><font color="#9932CD">Furious Culling</font>: Grants a chance to increase critical hits by 5% and increases general damage by 5%. Removed after stacking 5 times.
desc_buf_ng_tm_006_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Demonic Horde</font> Chance to increase critical hit damage by 6% while reducing the attacker's critical hit damage by 6% for 30 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times.<br><font color="#9932CD">Furious Culling</font>: Grants a chance to increase critical hits by 6% and increases general damage by 6%. Removed after stacking 5 times.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Chi Becomes Form</font>: Grants a chance to cancel out the targets defensive effects such as damage reduction or damage absorption.
