desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg_1_ngtips=Reduces damage received by 8%. Removes Damage Reduction effect when attacking while reducing the target's Internal and External Defense by 4%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg_2_ngtips=Reduces damage received by 10%. Removes Damage Reduction effect when attacking while reducing the target's Internal and External Defense by 5%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg_3_ngtips=Reduces damage received by 12%. Removes Damage Reduction effect when attacking while reducing the target's Internal and External Defense by 6%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_wwsg_4_ngtips=Reduces damage received by 16%. Removes Damage Reduction effect when attacking while reducing the target's Internal and External Defense by 8%.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_1_ngtips=Reduce a target's Spirit, Breath and Stamina by 1 and convert them to your own Breath. Active for 30 minutes. Can be stacked up to 6 times.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_2_ngtips=Reduce a target's Spirit, Breath and Stamina by 1 and convert them to your own Breath. Active for 30 minutes. Can be stacked up to 10 times.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_3_ngtips=Reduce a target's Spirit, Breath and Stamina by 1 and convert them to your own Breath. Active for 30 minutes. Can be stacked up to 15 times.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_4_ngtips=Reduce a target's Spirit, Breath and Stamina by 1 and convert them to your own Breath. Active for 30 minutes. Can be stacked up to 21 times.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_5_ngtips=When attacking, reduces the target's Spirit, Breath and Stamina by 1, turning these into your own Breath. Each of your attacks also grants an 80% chance to receive  1 extra stack of this effect. Can be stacked up to 27 times. Active 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_cygj_6_ngtips=When attacking, reduces the target's Spirit, Breath and Stamina by 1, turning these into your own Breath. Each of your attacks also grants an 80% chance to receive  1 extra stack of this effect. Can be stacked up to 35 times. Active 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_zxg_8_ngtips=Your attacks deal an amount of damage equal to 0.85 times the target's used Energy, and deal an additional 640 (Amount subject to Internal Attack Damage) Yin damage. Also recovers an amount of HP equal to 0.15 times the target's current Energy, along with an additional 640 HP (Only effective on players)
desc_buf_ng_jh_208_8_ngtips=Applies a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Evil</font> Influence to yourself each time your attack is not parried, increasing damage dealt by 1.5% for 20 seconds. Can be stacked up to 18 times. Lose one stack of <font color="#FF3030">Evil</font> Influence when your attack is parried. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Evil Opposing Heaven</font>: Grants a chance that your potential will be triggered while <font color="#FF3030"> Evil</font> Influence disperses, increasing Defense by 70% and making all attacks deal a large amount of additional Soft damage. Active for 20 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_205_8_ngtips=Failing to parry grants a chance to cast <font color="#FF3030">Toad Venom</font>. If the target is Critically Hit at the same time, a stack will be added. When Critical Hitting a target that doesn't parry, there is also a chance to cast <font color="#FF3030">Toad Venom</font>. Active for 9 seconds and can be stacked up to 8 times. When <font color="#FF3030">Toad Venom</font> reaches 8 stacks, it will trigger a venom explosion that will override the current move and Paralyze for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_5_ngtips=Parrying has a chance trigger Icy Heart Defense: Parries can recover HP for 8 seconds (Recovery amount is 250% of damage received. Max recovery amount is 298 and influenced by Internal Attack Damage. Can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds), during this period, Parry Endurance regeneration speed is greatly increased.
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_6_ngtips=Parrying has a chance trigger Icy Heart Defense: Parries can recover HP for 9 seconds (Recovery amount is 250% of damage received. Max recovery amount is 388 and influenced by Internal Attack Damage. Can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds), during this period, Parry Endurance regeneration speed is greatly increased.
desc_buf_ng_jh_209_7_ngtips=Parrying has a chance trigger Icy Heart Defense: Parries can recover HP for 10 seconds (Recovery amount is 250% of damage received. Max recovery amount is 860 and influenced by Internal Attack Damage. Can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds), during this period, Parry Endurance regeneration speed is greatly increased.
desc_buf_ng_wg_001_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Restore Constitution: </font>When attacking, absorbs 100 HP with each attack. (More Energy is absorbed depending on the Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Red Mist: </font>Parrying and attacking recovers 18 Energy. (More Energy is absorbed depending on Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br>(This Internal Skill can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_buf_ng_wg_001_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Restore Constitution: </font>When attacking, absorbs 118 HP with each attack. (More Energy is absorbed depending on the Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Red Mist: </font>Parrying and attacking recovers 22 Energy. (More Energy is absorbed depending on Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br>(This Internal Skill can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_buf_ng_wg_001_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Restore Constitution: </font>When attacking, absorbs 138 HP with each attack. (More Energy is absorbed depending on the Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Red Mist: </font>Parrying and attacking recovers 27 Energy. (More Energy is absorbed depending on Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br>(This Internal Skill can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_buf_ng_wg_001_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Restore Constitution: </font>When attacking, absorbs 157 HP with each attack. (More Energy is absorbed depending on the Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Red Mist: </font>Parrying and attacking recovers 30 Energy. (More Energy is absorbed depending on Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br>(This Internal Skill can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_buf_ng_wg_001_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Restore Constitution: </font>When attacking, absorbs 178 HP with each attack. (More Energy is absorbed depending on the Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Red Mist: </font>Parrying and attacking recovers 36 Energy. (More Energy is absorbed depending on Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br>(This Internal Skill can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_buf_ng_wg_001_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Restore Constitution: </font>When attacking, absorbs 244 HP with each attack. (More Energy is absorbed depending on the Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Red Mist: </font>Parrying and attacking recovers 46 Energy. (More Energy is absorbed depending on Internal Attack Damage.) Enters a 25 second cooldown period after stacking 6 times. <br>(This Internal Skill can only be used by players who have been castrated)
