tips_eqp_test23_1=</font><font color="#6699ff">Chaotic Taichi</font><br><font color="#00ff00">10-pieces set effect: Unaffected by level 5 equipment. Unaffected by other lower gear currently equipped.
tips_taozhuang_10001_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Resurgence</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases your Break Defense. Landing a combo of 6 hits or more grants a chance to greatly increase your critical hit rate and accuracy for a short time.
tips_taozhuang_10002_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Cosmic Chaos</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases your ability to bypass Internal Skill Defense.  Landing a combo of 6 hits or more grants to disorder the target's meridians and disorientate them for a short time.
tips_taozhuang_10007_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Surging Vitality</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases your ability to break Defense. Landing a 9 hit combo or more grants a chance to greatly increase your critical hit rate and accuracy for a short time.
tips_taozhuang_10008_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Reverse Yin and Yang</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases your ability to bypass Internal Skill Defense. Landing a combo of 9 hits or more grants to disorder the target's meridians and disorientate them for a short time.
tips_taozhuang_10015_7=Six pieces of </font><font color="#6699ff">Bone Softening Poisonous Garment</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Internal Skill Defense. If you are attacked, you are granted a chance to cause the enemy to become fatigued and receive a reduction to damage dealt.
tips_taozhuang_10009_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Cuts Iron Like Mud</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Max HP. Landing a combo of 9 hits or more grants to disorder the target's meridians and disorientate them for a short time.
tips_taozhuang_10019_6=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Bone Brittling Poisonous Garment</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: The attacking enemy is poisoned and has their attack power significantly reduced.
tips_taozhuang_10019_7=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Bone Brittling Poisonous Garment</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Internal Skill Defense. The attacking enemy is poisoned and has their attack power significantly reduced.
tips_taozhuang_10003_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Too Sharp to Block</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Max HP. Landing a 6 hit combo or more will allow you to bypass the target's parry and defense.
tips_btn_home_23=When the durability of the lock drops to <font color="#00FF00">0</font>, the gate will be unlocked. The lock will later be reset to its initial level of difficulty. <font color="#FF0000">(You will not be able to pick lock at this time, during which the lock cannot be damaged by lockpicking.) </font>
tips_school_ng_wx=Five Immortals Sect Internal Skill
tips_school_ng_ssg=Divine Water Palace Internal Skill
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 44 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 44 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 56 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 56 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 70 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 70 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 84 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 84 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 103 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 103 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Lord of the Dominion</font>: After being continouously attacked by 7 times, there is a chance to knock back nearby enemies who are not parrying and deal 464 points of damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) to them.<font color="#CC3299">(This effect can be triggered under the state of Slender or Petite body size of 81 - 100 points.)</font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 134 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 134 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Lord of the Dominion</font>: After being continouously attacked by 7 times, there is a chance to knock back nearby enemies who are not parrying and deal 600 points of damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) to them.<font color="#CC3299">(This effect can be triggered under the state of Slender or Petite body size of 81 - 100 points.)</font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 171 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, recover 171 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Lord of the Dominion</font>: After being continouously attacked by 7 times, there is a chance to knock back nearby enemies who are not parrying and deal 770 points of damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) to them.<font color="#CC3299">(This effect can be triggered under the state of Slender or Petite body size of 81 - 100 points.)</font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_501_8_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Break Eight Remote Areas</font>: Attacks have a chance to add enemies with a 10-second Shaking state which causes continuously lose 226 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second. Cause Shocking state at the same time, getting one of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Skill Disabled effects for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Chi Goes Through Six Directions</font>: Have a chance to get Upwelling state for 10 seconds, ignore enemies' Internal Defense Reduction by 8%, recover 226 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) per second.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Lord of the Dominion</font>: After being continouously attacked by 7 times, there is a chance to knock back nearby enemies who are not parrying and deal 1016 points of damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage) to them.<font color="#CC3299">(This effect can be triggered under the state of Slender or Petite body size of 81 - 100 points.)</font>
tips_buff_BattleS3_jiance_5_0=Activated by wearing 5 items of Tier 7 Dace or Tier 7 Wyvern set: if attacked when your HP Value is below 40%, there is a strong chance you will obtain a boost, allowing you to be immune to 40% of damage, and resulting in your movement speed being enhanced by 20%
tips_buff_BattleS3_jiance_5yu_0=Activated by wearing 5 items of Tier 7 Wyvern set: if attacked when your HP Value is below 40%, there is a strong chance you will obtain a boost, allowing you to be immune to 40% of damage, and resulting in your movement speed being enhanced by 20%. Also you have a chance to seal the attacker's skills for 2 seconds.
