desc_buf_ng_wx_001_1_ngtips=Have a chance to get Overturn Insect state for 5 seconds when being attacked. Deals 48 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage) to attackers each time of being attacked.
desc_buf_ng_wx_001_2_ngtips=Have a chance to get Overturn Insect state for 5 seconds when being attacked. Deals 65 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage) to attackers each time of being attacked.
desc_buf_ng_wx_001_3_ngtips=Have a chance to get Overturn Insect state for 5 seconds when being attacked. Deals 82 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage) to attackers each time of being attacked.
desc_buf_ng_wx_001_4_ngtips=Have a chance to get Overturn Insect state for 5 seconds when being attacked. Deals 100 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage) to attackers each time of being attacked.<br><font color="#9932CD">Insect God Disater</font>: During the period of Overturn Insect, Being critical hit will make you recover 100 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage. Recovery can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds).
desc_buf_ng_wx_001_5_ngtips=Have a chance to get Overturn Insect state for 5 seconds when being attacked. Deals 119 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage) to attackers each time of being attacked.<br><font color="#9932CD">Insect God Disater</font>: During the period of Overturn Insect, Being critical hit will make you recover 119 points of HP (Affected by Internal Attack Damage and Melee Damage. Recovery can only be triggered once per 0.5 seconds).
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 6% for 5 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 9% for 6 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 12% for 7 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 15% for 8 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 18% for 9 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#CFB53B">All Insects Ringing</font>: When a target gets 3 kinds of Insects, there is a chance to activate these Insects and continouously recover their master's HP for 9 seconds. If the target tries to attack during this period there is also a chance that this attack will be interrupted.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 21% for 10 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#CFB53B">All Insects Ringing</font>: When a target gets 3 kinds of Insects, there is a chance to activate these Insects and continouously recover their master's HP for 10 seconds. If the target tries to attack during this period there is also a chance that this attack will be interrupted.
desc_buf_ng_wx_002_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rain and Dew</font>: When attacking or being attacked, have a chance to add your target with one of the following insects, Toad, Spider, Scorpion, Centipede and Snake Insect, which can correspondingly decrease your target's Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 25% for 10 seconds correspondingly.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cold Flower Soak With Blood</font>: Deal additional Yin Damage to targets with insects. The more insects they have, the more Yin Damage will be. <br><font color="#CFB53B">All Insects Ringing</font>: When a target gets 3 kinds of Insects, there is a chance to activate these Insects and continouously recover their master's HP for 10 seconds. If the target tries to attack during this period there is also a chance that this attack will be interrupted.
