ui_linxiaozhizun_mail_detail=You earned Lingxiao City rewards. Please claim them in time.
lx_titleitem001_dress=Donation Place: <font color="#00FFFF">Earth Stone Tablet (544,204)</font>. <font color="#00FFFF">identity token (Stepping on Snow Without a Trace)</font> can be got by killing <font color="#00FFFF">Saucy Hunter</font> and <font color="#00FFFF">Wandering Frost Girl</font> during the donating period.
ronghe_10003_dress=Donation Place: <font color="#00FFFF">Heaven Stone Tablet (517,208)</font>.
tips_lxjx_time=Time limit of offering items to Lingxiao City is 24 hours: Players who make offerings during this period will get rewards sent by Lingxiao City. If all the offerings are completed, there will be a chance to get extra rewards.
tips_itemtype_2558=Event item
tips_buff_battles1_3_05_0=Activated by wearing 5 items of Fighting Soul set: if attacked when your HP is below 30%, there is a strong chance you will obtain a buff, allowing you to be immune to 30% of damage, and increasing your movement speed by 20%.
tips_buff_BattleS2_jiance_5_0=Activated by wearing 5 items of Level 6 Fighter's Soul or Fighter's Spirit set: if attacked when your HP is below 40%, there is a strong chance you will obtain a buff, allowing you to be immune to 40% of damage, and increasing your movement speed by 20%.
tips_buff_BattleS25_jiance_3_0=Activated by wearing 5 items of Fighter's Spirit set: Full usage of fighting skill - Rage of the Fighter's Spirit, with immunity to all types of control for 4 seconds. Used with Rage of the Fighter's Spirit, with a cooldown of 2 minutes.
tips_taozhuang_10021_5=Activates when wearing 3 items of Fighting Soul set: Killing other players recovers some Chi and Energy.
tips_taozhuang_10021_6=Activates when wearing 3 items of Level 6 Fighter's Soul or Fighter's Spirit set: Killing other players recovers some Chi and Energy.
tips_taozhuang_10021_7=Activates when wearing 3 items of Level 7 Dace or Wyvern set: Killing other players recovers some Chi and Energy.
tips_taozhuang_10004_7=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Dazzling Gear</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Dodging rate. If you are attacked, gives you a chance to make opponents blurred, dramatically reducing their Accuracy and Dodging rate.
tips_taozhuang_10010_7=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Dazzling Garment</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Dodging rate. If you are attacked, gives you a chance to make opponents blurred, dramatically reducing their Accuracy and Dodging rate.
tips_taozhuang_10013_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Wait patiently</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Accuracy rate. Not attacking for 8 seconds will grant you with much extra Rage next time you receive damage.
tips_taozhuang_10032_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Cloud and Water</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Critical Hit. Not attacking for 8 seconds will grant you with high Accuracy rate and your skill won't be disabled.
tips_taozhuang_10031_7=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Bone-Melting Garment</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Dodging rate. When being attacked, the enemy's critical hit may deal no damage to you. If the enemy doesn't execute critical hit, his skill will be disabled.
tips_taozhuang_10017_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Steady Accumulation</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Accuracy rate. Not attacking for 12 seconds will grant you with much extra Rage next time you receive damage.
