tips_ng_dm=Belongs to: Dharma Sect
desc_buf_ng_dm_001_1_ngtips=When attacked, there is a chance of using Chi to deal Yang Damage continuously around target 3 times. <br>
desc_buf_ng_dm_001_2_ngtips=When attacked, there is a chance of using Chi to deal Yang Damage continuously around target 3 times. <br>
desc_buf_ng_dm_001_3_ngtips=When attacked, there is a chance of using Chi to deal Yang Damage continuously around target 3 times. <br>
desc_buf_ng_dm_001_4_ngtips=When attacked, there is a chance of using Chi to deal Yang Damage continuously around target 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Almighty Maha</font> When using Chi, if there are targets nearby, user will recover some HP. The more targets, the more healing.
desc_buf_ng_dm_001_5_ngtips=When attacked, there is a chance of using Chi to deal Yang Damage continuously around target 3 times. <br><font color="#9932CD">Almighty Maha</font> When using Chi, if there are targets nearby, user will recover some HP. The more targets, the more healing.
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 5s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 12% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 5s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 12% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state)
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 6s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 15% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 6s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 15% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state)
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 7s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 18% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 7s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 18% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state)
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 8s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 21% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 8s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 21% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state)
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 9s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 25% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 9s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 25% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state) <br><font color="#CFB53B">Life and Death</font>: Immunity to knockback and knock down when getting "Die Together" and "Survive Alone" at the same time.
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 10s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 30% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 10s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 30% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state) <br><font color="#CFB53B">Life and Death</font>: Immunity to knockback and knock down when getting "Die Together" and "Survive Alone" at the same time.
desc_buf_ng_dm_002_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Destruction</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to get 12s "Die Together" effect. Deals damage enemy after it finishes (damage done equal to 30% damage taken while in "Die Together" state) <br><font color="#9932CD">Withered Zen</font>: When attacked, there is a chance of getting a 12s "Survive Alone" effect. Recover some HP after it is over (amount recovered equal to 30% damage taken while in "Survive Alone" state) <br><font color="#CFB53B">Life and Death</font>: Immunity to knockback and knock down when getting "Die Together" and "Survive Alone" at the same time.
