tips_js_dm_01_0=Holy Bodhi Hearts are very previous, ordering unborn to rise. The order once given doesn’t diminish but grows.
tips_js_dm_02_0=Gate Gate Paragate Parasamgate Bodhi Svaha.
tips_js_dm_03_0=Hell is not empty, vowed not to Buddha, all living degrees, Founder Bodhi
tips_js_dm_04_0=Willing to this merit, solemn Buddha Pure Land, reported four heavy grace, under the three hard work
tip_sys_song_jing_wait_01_0=Chant Preparation Phase: Before the countdown ends, you can register at (-733, -341) with "Yuan Zhiqing" for the Chant Event.
tip_sys_song_jing_wait_01_1=Chant Preparation Phase: Before the countdown ends, you can register at (-733, -341) with "Yuan Zhiqing" for the Chant Event.
tip_sys_song_jing_wait_02_0=Chant Beginning Stage: Before the countdown ends, press the keys according to the rhythm (space bar). Get points for success. Please turn up the volume.
tip_sys_song_jing_wait_02_1=Chant Beginning Stage: Before the countdown ends, press the keys according to the rhythm (space bar). Get points for success. Please turn up the volume.
tip_sys_song_jing_wait_03_0=Chant Next Preparation Phase: Waiting for next Chant
tip_sys_song_jing_wait_03_1=Chant Next Preparation Phase: Waiting for next Chant
tip_song_jing_round_01_0=Event will end after rounds are at max.
tip_song_jing_round_01_1=Event will end after rounds are at max.
tip_songjing_01=Description: <br>1. These are the points for this time.<br>2. Tap within 0.5s of the beat to get 50-100 points.<br>3.Tap within 0.5-1.0s of the beat to get 25-50 points.<br>4. Complete the event to get 400 extra points.<br>5. Max of 200,000 points each week. <br>6. Points are cleared at midnight each Sunday.
tip_songjing_02=Speed Up Lyrics Used when lyrics and music don’t match. Increases lyrics speed 0.1s. Can increase up to 2s.
tip_songjing_03=Slow Down Lyrics Used when lyrics and music don’t match. Decrease lyrics speed 0.1s. Can decrease up to 2s.
tip_depot_limit_01=Not able to use this.
tip_depot_limit_02=Already used up.
