tips_xw_3201_condition_info=Use<font color="#FF0000"> Manual of the Core - Zhaohai (Hidden)</font> to activate.<br>Complete <font color="#FF0000">Lin Liang's </font>daily task of Cultivate Yin/Yang Heel Vessel - Hidden to get Purple Ganoderma. Then you can go to <font color="#FF0000">Zhou Yixian</font> at Suzhou Mortuary and trade for Manual of the Core - Zhaohai (Hidden).
