tips_sys_wywl_mm_01=Central Plains and Foreign Wulin have been fighting hard in the Evil Men's Valley for a long time. Both sides have suffered heavy losses. They dare not act rashly and the situation is deadlocked. Zhuo Bei noticed the troop of Central Plains were getting tired and exhausted. He felt this was his opportunity, so he sent out Foreign perdues to the front line and planed to take over Central Plains. <br><font color1="#eb6100">Defeat the Foreign perdues</font><br><font color="#FF3030">(The second phase starts in 10 minutes.)</font>
