tips_jyz_count_sl_3_3_0=Collect the Mystic Iron Orders in the major cities where outlaw Koreans are found and hand them over to An Zaixi at the Huanxiu Mountain Villa in Suzhou for a reward<br/>Coordinates of outlaw Koreans:<br/>Yanjing: (138,-105)<br/>Suzhou: (328,765)<br/>Jinling: (1092,2256)<br/>Luoyang: (1141,642)<br/>Chengdu: (912,535)<br/>Coordinates of An Zaixi:<br/>Suzhou:(12,1108)<br/>
tips_jyz_count_sl_3_3_1=Collect Mystic Iron Orders at the places where there are unfamiliar Koreans in the major cities and hand them over to An Zaixi at the Huanxiu Mountain Villa in Suzhou to get rewards<br/>Coordinates of unfamiliar Koreans:<br/>Yanjing: (138,-105)<br/>Suzhou: (328,765)<br/>Jinling: (1092,2256)<br/>Luoyang: (1141,642)<br/>Chengdu: (912,535)<br/>Coordinates of An Zaixi:<br/>Suzhou:(12,1108)<br/>
