tips_boxes03_1=You helped the Villagers gather 3 treasure boxes from the North-west Side.
desc_buf_ng_wd_005_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dominating Dragon Blade</font>: Has a chance to increase your attack by 30% and Endurance Ignoring by 20% when attacking, lasting 10 seconds.  <br><font color="#9932CD">Peerless Heaven Sword</font>: Has a chance to increase Damage Reduction by 30% and recover HP for some time, lasting 10 seconds.  <br><font color="#CFB53B">Only one of these two effects can be triggered during the period.</font>
desc_buf_ng_wd_005_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dominating Dragon Blade</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase your attack by 30% and Endurance Ignoring by 20%, lasting 11 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Peerless Heaven Sword</font>: When hit, a chance to increase Damage Reduction by 30% and recover HP for some time, lasting 11 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Only one of these two effects can be triggered during the period.</font>
desc_buf_ng_wd_005_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dominating Dragon Blade</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase your attack by 30% and Endurance Ignoring by 20%, lasting 12 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Peerless Heaven Sword</font>: When hit, a chance to increase Damage Reduction by 30% and recover HP for some time, lasting 12 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Only one of these two effects can be triggered during the period.</font>
desc_buf_ng_wd_005_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dominating Dragon Blade</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase your attack by 30% and Endurance Ignoring by 20%, lasting 13 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Peerless Heaven Sword</font>: When hit, a chance to increase Damage Reduction by 30% and recover HP for some time, lasting 13 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Only one of these two effects can be triggered during the period.</font>
desc_buf_ng_wd_005_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dominating Dragon Blade</font>: When attacking, a chance to increase your attack by 30% and Endurance Ignoring by 20%, lasting 15 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Peerless Heaven Sword</font>: When hit, a chance to increase Damage Reduction by 30% and recover HP for some time, lasting 15 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Wulin Supreme</font>: It can trigger both Heaven and Dragon effects at the same time.
desc_buf_ng_jh_306_1_ngtips=Every attack has a certain chance to decrease target's movement speed by 40%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demented Star Vortex: </font>Absorb the cultivation points dispersed by the target and convert to self and temporary immunity to movement restrictions. Can be stacked up to 20 levels. <br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 20 seconds. When cultivation points or chi power points are used up, movement will automatically stop. </font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_306_2_ngtips=Every attack has a certain chance to decrease target's movement speed by 45%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demented Star Vortex: </font>Absorb the cultivation points dispersed by the target and convert to self and temporary immunity to movement restrictions. Can be stacked up to 20 levels. <br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 20 seconds. When cultivation points or chi power points are used up, movement will automatically stop. </font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_306_3_ngtips=Every attack has a certain chance to decrease target's movement speed by 50%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demented Star Vortex: </font>Absorb the cultivation points dispersed by the target and convert to self and temporary immunity to movement restrictions. Can be stacked up to 20 levels. <br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 20 seconds. When cultivation points or chi power points are used up, movement will automatically stop. </font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_306_4_ngtips=Every attack has a certain chance to decrease target's movement speed by 55%. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Demented Star Vortex: </font>Absorb the cultivation points dispersed by the target and convert to self and temporary immunity to movement restrictions. Can be stacked up to 20 levels. <br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 20 seconds. When cultivation points or chi power points are used up, movement will automatically stop. </font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_306_5_ngtips=Every attack has a certain chance to decrease target's movement speed by 60%.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Star-Absorbing Evil:</font> Absorb the target's dissipated cultivation points to greatly increase your own abilities. While increasing your Chi and HP, your basic attributes will be increased by 10% and will be immune to all movement effects. <br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 20 seconds. When cultivation or chi points are used up, movement will automatically stop.  </font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_507_1_ngtips=Attacks have a chance of stealing the target's movement speed, Jump Across the Cloud and the Wild Goose Flying Skill. When stealing, chance to be temporarily immune from all movement control effects. Can be used up to 6 times within 15 seconds. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps, Thousand Strides: </font>Chance of clearing meridians every time a move is used. No recovery period within 28 seconds for moves of the same skill set.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Chi of the Sunflower</font>No Cool-Down time restrictions within 20 seconds for moves of the same skill set.<br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 20 seconds. When cultivation or chi power points are used up, movement will automatically stop. </font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_507_2_ngtips=Attacks have a chance of stealing the target's movement speed, Jump Across the Cloud and the Wild Goose Flying Skill. When stealing, chance to be temporarily immune from all movement control effects. Can be used up to 6 times within 18 seconds. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps, Thousand Strides: </font>Chance of clearing meridians every time a move is used. No recovery period within 30 seconds for moves of the same skill set.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Chi of the Sunflower</font>No Cool-Down time restrictions within 22 seconds for moves of the same skill set.<br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 22 seconds. When cultivation or chi power points are used up, movement will automatically stop. </font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_507_3_ngtips=Attacks have a chance of stealing the target's movement speed, Jump Across the Cloud and the Wild Goose Flying Skill. When stealing, chance to be temporarily immune from all movement control effects. Can be used up to 6 times within 21 seconds. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps, Thousand Strides: </font>Chance of clearing meridians every time a move is used. No recovery period within 28 seconds for moves of the same skill set.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Chi of the Sunflower</font>No Cool-Down time restrictions within 24 seconds for moves of the same skill set.<br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 20 seconds. When cultivation or chi power points are used up, movement will automatically stop. </font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_507_4_ngtips=Attacks have a chance of stealing the target's movement speed, Jump Across the Cloud and the Wild Goose Flying Skill. When stealing, chance to be temporarily immune from all movement control effects. Can be used up to 6 times within 24 seconds. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps, Thousand Strides: </font>Chance of clearing meridians every time a move is used. No recovery period within 28 seconds for moves of the same skill set.<br/><font color="#FF3030">Chi of the Sunflower</font>No Cool-Down time restrictions within 34 seconds for moves of the same skill set.<br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 27 seconds. When cultivation or chi power points are used up, movement will automatically stop. </font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_507_5_ngtips=Every attack has a chance of stealing the target's movement speed, distance of Jump Across the Cloud and Wild Goose Flying Skill. Max 6 stacks. Lasts for 27 seconds. If stealing is triggered at the same time, there's a chance of immunity to all movement restrictions for a period of time. <br/><font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps Thousand Strides: </font>There is a chance of clearing the meridian every time a move is used. No recovery period needed for moves of the same skill set within 36 seconds. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Chi of the Sunflower</font>The flow of Chi might be freed from each move. No cool down time restrictions for moves of the same skill set within 30 seconds. <font color="#CFB53B">Never Defeated:</font> If <font color="#9932CD">Nimble Steps Thousand Strides</font> and <font color="#FF3030">Chi of Sunflower</font> are both active, you are immune to Stiffness, Knock Back, knock down and knock into air effect. Accuracy rate is also increased. <br/><font color="#CC3299">This movement requires expending 100,000 cultivation points, with 20,000 being expended every 20 seconds. 1 Shenrong Pill can offset 10,0000 Cultivation Points. When cultivation points or chi power points are used up, movement will automatically stop. </font>
desc_buf_ng_jh_105_1_ngtips=When you hit your target, there is a chance that you will unleash a burst of <font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi</font>, and your enemy may suffer <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font> in his body every time he tries to attack. He will also experience rigidity for 6 seconds each time he takes damage, and will suffer certain Yin damage each time he is attacked while the <font color="#9932CD">chill</font> persists. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi: </font>Only using Sit and Breathe for a certain amount of time can dissipate it.
desc_buf_ng_jh_105_2_ngtips=When you hit your target, there is a chance that you will unleash a burst of <font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi</font>, and your enemy may suffer <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font> in his body every time he tries to attack. He will also experience rigidity for 7 seconds each time he takes damage, and will suffer certain Yin damage each time he is attacked while the <font color="#9932CD">chill</font> persists. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi: </font>Only using Sit and Breathe for a certain amount of time can dissipate it.
desc_buf_ng_jh_105_3_ngtips=When you hit your target, there is a chance that you will unleash a burst of <font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi</font>, and your enemy may suffer <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font> in his body every time he tries to attack. He will also experience rigidity for 8 seconds each time he takes damage, and will suffer certain Yin damage each time he is attacked while the <font color="#9932CD">chill</font> persists. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi: </font>Only using Sit and Breathe for a certain amount of time can dissipate it.
desc_buf_ng_jh_105_4_ngtips=When you hit your target, there is a chance that you will unleash a burst of <font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi</font>, and your enemy may suffer <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font> in his body every time he tries to attack. He will also experience rigidity for 9 seconds each time he takes damage, and will suffer certain Yin damage each time he is attacked while the <font color="#9932CD">chill</font> persists. <br/><font color="#FF3030">Ice Chi: </font>the chi will lay latent in the body for a long time and has the chance of triggering <font color="#9932CD">Coldness</font> by itself. Only using Sit and Breathe for a certain amount of time can dissipate it.
