tips_buff_BattleS2_chixu_wuqi_1=Attacks have a chance of resulting in the target suffering from a scratched bleeding effect, thereby causing a 30% drop in movement speed, with Flying Skill consumption increasing by 7 points. In addition, HP and Energy restoration effects will drop by 50%. These effects will last for 12 seconds.
tips_buff_BattleS2_chixu_wuqi_2=Attacks have a chance of resulting in the target suffering from a Scratched Bleeding effect, thereby causing a 30% drop in movement speed, with Flying Skill consumption increasing by 7 points; in addition, Life Value and Energy restoration effects will drop by 50%. These effects will last for a duration of 12 seconds.
