desc_buf_ng_gm_002_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Engulfing Separation</font>: Gets a chance to unleash a burst of icy force to the attacker and decreases his movement speed by 20% in 5 seconds, as well as extra 10% Yin Damage when he is attacked. <br><font color="#9932CD">Jadelike Body And Mind</font>: Heat resistant, increases cold resistance attributes by 10 points.
