tips_taozhuang_10014_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Energy Surging</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Accuracy. If you hold your attacks for eight seconds, gives you a large increase in your attack damage the next time you attack. The more the remaining energy you have, the higher your attack damage will be.
tips_taozhuang_10016_7=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Precious Jade Returns the Soul</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Dodging rate. If you are attacked, gives you a chance to trigger Healing with Treasure. The more energy you have, the better healing effect you will get.
tips_taozhuang_10018_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Energy Erupting</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Accuracy. If you hold your attacks for 12 seconds, gives you a large increase in your attack damage the next time you attack. The more the remaining Energy is, the higher your attack damage will be.
tips_taozhuang_10020_7=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Pure Gold Returns the Spirit</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: Increases Dodging rate. If you are attacked, gives you a chance to trigger Healing with Treasure. The more energy you have, the better healing effect you will get.
tips_taozhuang_10027_7=Six pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Circulate True Spirit</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: If you are attacked when your Energy is above 30% or HP is below 30%, absorbs a large amount of damage.
tips_taozhuang_10028_7=Three pieces of</font><font color="#6699ff"> Dominate Fate</font><br><font color="#00ff00">: If you are attacking target when your Rage is above 75, increases your Accuracy and Critical Hit rate, and ignores target's parry and defense.
