tips_jy_fswf_06=Some merchants is now taking a rest in your home. They have some rare goods with them. You can purchase the items from them but please be hurry.
tips_jy_fswf_07=The merchants have left.
tips_jy_fswf_13=Some mysterious merchants are taking a rest in your home. If you want to purchase some rare items, go to find them.
tips_jy_fswf_14=The merchants have left.
tips_jy_fswf_15=Some suspicious people want to steal the rare treasures from your home. Please hurry to drive them away.
tips_jy_fswf_17=You've submitted the Thief Appears quest.
tips_jy_fswf_20=Some poor people came to your home and sought for help. Please accept the quest and help those poor people. Maybe you can get some unexpected reward from this.
tips_jy_fswf_21=You've accepted the quest and obtained Fresh Food and some skills. Please give the food to the beggars and cure the injured people with the skills.
