tips_jyz_count_mj_1_2_0=Ming Cult stronghold: (-106,-256). The school first to eliminate the stronghold will receive extra rewards.
tips_jyz_count_mj_1_2_1=Ming Cult stronghold: (-106,-256). The school first to eliminate the stronghold will receive extra rewards.
tips_jyz_count_mj_1_3_0=Go to School Storeroom Elder to receive secret message, and then go find secret agent. Secret agent might appear at: (175,141), (175,100), (-184,101), (-184,141), (-139,205), (-183,244), (-156,273), (-55,363), (59,357), (189,258).
tips_jyz_count_mj_1_3_1=Go to School Storeroom Elder to receive secret message, and then go find secret agent. Secret agent might appear at: (175,141), (175,100), (-184,101), (-184,141), (-139,205), (-183,244), (-156,273), (-55,363), (59,357), (189,258).
desc_buf_ng_mj_001_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Scorch the Enemy</font>: Chance to receive "Scorch the Enemy" effect while attacking. Damage increased for 5 seconds (The more rage points saved the more bonus damage given. At least 10% and at most 15% bonus damage).
desc_buf_ng_mj_001_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Scorch the Enemy</font>: Chance to receive "Scorch the Enemy" effect while attacking. Damage increased for 5 seconds (The more rage points saved the more bonus damage given. At least 10% and at most 20% bonus damage).
desc_buf_ng_mj_001_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Scorch the Enemy</font>: Chance to receive "Scorch the Enemy" effect while attacking. Damage increased for 5 seconds (The more rage points saved the more bonus damage given. At least 10% and at most 25% bonus damage).
desc_buf_ng_mj_001_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Scorch the Enemy</font>: Chance to receive "Scorch the Enemy" effect while attacking. Damage increased for 5 seconds (The more rage points saved the more bonus damage given. At least 10% and at most 30% bonus damage); <br><font color="#9932CD">Overcome by Rage</font>: Chance to receive "Overcome by Rage" effect while being attacked. Rage points increases by 10 for 5 seconds (This effect have 30 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_002_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Sunburst Protection</font>: Chance to trigger "Sunburst" effect while being attacked. Reflects 194 damage and 15% of damage taken will heal self instead. Lasts 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_mj_002_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Sunburst Protection</font>: Chance to trigger "Sunburst" effect while being attacked. Reflects 275 damage and 20% of damage taken will heal self instead. Lasts 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_mj_002_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Sunburst Protection</font>: Chance to trigger "Sunburst" effect while being attacked. Reflects 368 damage and 25% of damage taken will heal self instead. Lasts 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_mj_002_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Sunburst Protection</font>: Chance to trigger "Sunburst" effect while being attacked. Reflects 468 damage and 30% of damage taken will heal self instead. Lasts 5 seconds. Healing doubled if player are flying skills disabled, paralyzed, or stunned.
desc_buf_ng_mj_003_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Scorching Sun Blaze</font>: After using rage skill, all damage increased by 12%. Lasts 6 seconds (30 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#FF3030">Blaze</font>: Rage consumption decreases by 20%.
desc_buf_ng_mj_003_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Scorching Sun Blaze</font>: After using rage skill, all damage increased by 18%. Lasts 8 seconds (28 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#FF3030">Blaze</font>: Rage consumption decreases by 20%.
desc_buf_ng_mj_003_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Scorching Sun Blaze</font>: After using rage skill, all damage increased by 25%. Lasts 10 seconds (26 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#FF3030">Blaze</font>: Rage consumption decreases by 20%.
desc_buf_ng_mj_003_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Scorching Sun Blaze</font>: After using rage skill, all damage increased by 30%. Lasts 12 seconds (24 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#FF3030">Blaze</font>: Rage consumption decreases by 20%.
desc_buf_ng_mj_004_1_ngtips=Debuffs enemy with "Fire Kindle" while attacking: deals 73 yang damage every second. "Fire Kindle" grows in power when enemy cast skills or get attacked. Lasts 8 seconds; <br><font color="#FF3030">Prairie Fire</font>: Attacking enemy debuffed with full-grown "Fire Kindle" will trigger "Firestorm". Deals 220 yang damage to debuffed enemy and any other close-by enemy. "Fire Kindle" returns to original power afterwards (20 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_004_2_ngtips=Debuffs enemy with "Fire Kindle" while attacking: deals 91 yang damage every second. "Fire Kindle" grows in power when enemy cast skills or get attacked. Lasts 9 seconds; <br><font color="#FF3030">Prairie Fire</font>: Attacking enemy debuffed with full-grown "Fire Kindle" will trigger "Firestorm". Deals 273 yang damage to debuffed enemy and any other close-by enemy. "Fire Kindle" returns to original power afterwards (20 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_004_3_ngtips=Debuffs enemy with "Fire Kindle" while attacking: deals 110 yang damage every second. "Fire Kindle" grows in power when enemy cast skills or get attacked. Lasts 10 seconds; <br><font color="#FF3030">Prairie Fire</font>: Attacking enemy debuffed with full-grown "Fire Kindle" will trigger "Firestorm". Deals 329 yang damage to debuffed enemy and any other close-by enemy. "Fire Kindle" returns to original power afterwards (20 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_004_4_ngtips=Debuffs enemy with "Fire Kindle" while attacking: deals 129 yang damage every second. "Fire Kindle" grows in power when enemy cast skills or get attacked. Lasts 11 seconds; <br><font color="#FF3030">Prairie Fire</font>: Attacking enemy debuffed with full-grown "Fire Kindle" will trigger "Firestorm". Deals 388 yang damage and 3 seconds flying skill disable to debuffed enemy and any other close-by enemy. "Fire Kindle" returns to original power afterwards (20 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_004_5_ngtips=Debuffs enemy with "Fire Kindle" while attacking: deals 156 yang damage every second. "Fire Kindle" grows in power when enemy cast skills or get attacked. Lasts 12 seconds; <br><font color="#FF3030">Prairie Fire</font>: Attacking enemy debuffed with full-grown "Fire Kindle" will trigger "Firestorm". Deals 468 yang damage and 3 seconds flying skill disable to debuffed enemy and any other close-by enemy. "Fire Kindle" returns to original power afterwards (20 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#9932CD">Fire Bath</font>: While "Firestorm" is triggered, the next rage skill will inflict 20% additional damage (30 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_005_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Unshakable Emperor</font>: Enters "Unshakable Emperor" effect after not attacking for 7 seconds. All incoming damage decreases by 10% for 7 seconds (30 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#9932CD">Wheel Emperor</font>: Enters "Wheel Emperor" effect after casting 7 skills. Increases 15% internal and external defense ignorance for 7 seconds (24 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_005_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Unshakable Emperor</font>: Enters "Unshakable Emperor" effect after not attacking for 7 seconds. All incoming damage decreases by 15% for 7 seconds (30 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#9932CD">Wheel Emperor</font>: Enters "Wheel Emperor" effect after casting 6 skills. Increases 18% internal and external defense ignorance for 7 seconds (24 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_005_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Unshakable Emperor</font>: Enters "Unshakable Emperor" effect after not attacking for 7 seconds. All incoming damage decreases by 20% for 7 seconds (30 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#9932CD">Wheel Emperor</font>: Enters "Wheel Emperor" effect after casting 5 skills. Increases 21% internal and external defense ignorance for 7 seconds (24 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_005_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Unshakable Emperor</font>: Enters "Unshakable Emperor" effect after not attacking for 7 seconds. All incoming damage decreases by 25% for 7 seconds (30 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#9932CD">Wheel Emperor</font>: Enters "Wheel Emperor" effect after casting 4 skills. Increases 25% internal and external defense ignorance for 7 seconds (24 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_005_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Unshakable Emperor</font>: Enters "Unshakable Emperor" effect after not attacking for 7 seconds. All incoming damage decreases by 30% for 7 seconds (30 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#9932CD">Wheel Emperor</font>: Enters "Wheel Emperor" effect after casting 3 skills. Increases 30% internal and external defense ignorance for 7 seconds (24 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#CFB53B">Ever Changing Tathagata</font>: Chance to trigger "Ever Changing Tathagata" while under "Unshakable Emperor" effect. Instantly enters "Ever Changing Tathagata - Wheel Emperor" effect when casting next skill (45 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_006_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Massive Destruction</font>: Chance to deal additional 115 yang damage (If your Blood Stasis is greater than those of enemy, deals additional 10% damage) every hit for 5 seconds while attacking (20 seconds cooldown, additional damage can be triggered 4 times at most); <br><font color="#9932CD">Move the Sky with a Palm</font>: Chance to absorb damage equal to 50% of drained blood for 5 seconds while under attack (40 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_006_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Massive Destruction</font>: Chance to deal additional 139 yang damage (If your Blood Stasis is greater than those of enemy, deals additional 15% damage) every hit for 6 seconds while attacking (20 seconds cooldown, additional damage can be triggered 5 times at most); <br><font color="#9932CD">Move the Sky with a Palm</font>: Chance to absorb damage equal to 60% of drained blood for 5 seconds while under attack (40 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_006_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Massive Destruction</font>: Chance to deal additional 164 yang damage (If your Blood Stasis is greater than those of enemy, deals additional 20% damage) every hit for 7 seconds while attacking (20 seconds cooldown, additional damage can be triggered 6 times at most); <br><font color="#9932CD">Move the Sky with a Palm</font>: Chance to absorb damage equal to 70% of drained blood for 5 seconds while under attack (40 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_006_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Massive Destruction</font>: Chance to deal additional 215 yang damage (If your Blood Stasis is greater than those of enemy, deals additional 25% damage) every hit for 8 seconds while attacking (20 seconds cooldown, additional damage can be triggered 7 times at most); <br><font color="#9932CD">Move the Sky with a Palm</font>: Chance to absorb damage equal to 80% of drained blood for 5 seconds while under attack (40 seconds cooldown).
desc_buf_ng_mj_006_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Massive Destruction</font>: Chance to deal additional 299 yang damage (If your Blood Stasis is greater than those of enemy, deals additional 30% damage) every hit for 9 seconds while attacking (20 seconds cooldown, additional damage can be triggered 8 times at most); <br><font color="#9932CD">Move the Sky with a Palm</font>: Chance to absorb damage equal to 100% of drained blood for 5 seconds while under attack (40 seconds cooldown); <br><font color="#CFB53B">Move the Sky Burn the Sea</font>: After "Move the Sky with a Palm" ends, recover 10% of drained blood.
tips_balance_jingmai_stop_click=The path of this Meridian cannot be customized.
