tips_item_protect_03=Click to open interface for item protection, you may configure the protection for Equipment (including costume and identity costume), treasure, Jade Doll, Skill book, crafting platforms, mounts, pets and VIP card. Drag the item to the interface, and confirm the action in the window.
tips_item_protect_04=1. Equipment (including costume and identity costume), Treasure, Jade Doll, Skill book, Forging Table, Mount (saddle), Familiar and VIP can be configured for protection, default protection is permanent. <br>2. After setting up protection, protected item cannot be deleted, sold, transferred, traded or decomposed. They may only be transferred between <font color="#FFFF00">Inventory</font> and <font color="#FFFF00">Equipment Slot</font>. However, consumption of systematic function is allowed. <br>3. VIP may set up protection for 15 items for free and non VIP may set up protection for 5 items for free. If more items need to be protected, the fee is: <font color="#FFFF00">10 Silver each</font>. <br>4. <font color="#FFFF00">Right-click</font> protected item to choose to cancel protection, a 2-day count-down will begin, and the protection will be removed 2 days later. <br>5. Pending items may be reconfigured for protection, and no more fees will be charged.
