tips_skill_formula_mashp_ywt=(<font color="#FFFF00">{@0:伤害下限}</font>~<font color="#FFFF00">{@1:伤害上限}</font>)<font color="#FF3030">(+{@2:近身加成})</font><font color="#00FF00">(+{@3:远程加成})</font><font color="#F728FF">(+{@4:兵录加成})</font> points of {@5:伤害类型} damage. (For a total of <font color="#FFFF00">{@6:击数}</font> hits, each hit does about <font color="#FFFF00">{@7:每击伤害}</font> points of damage.)
