tips_school_ng_sjy=Shenji Camp Internal Skill
tips_ng_sjy=Belongs to: Shenji Camp
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 50% and increase damage taken by 7% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 10% for 3 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 60% and increase damage taken by 10% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 15% for 3 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 70% and increase damage taken by 13% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 20% for 4 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 80% and increase damage taken by 16% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 25% for 4 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 90% and increase damage taken by 20% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 30% for 5 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground.<br><font color="#9932CD">Gui Gu Tactics</font>: Once <font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font> is over, the target will be inflicted with 1 random effect from <font color="#f9fc00">Seal Skill, Disarmed, Paralyzed, Disable Flying skills</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font>: Chance to decrease target's dodge rate by 100% and increase damage taken by 25% for 5 seconds when attacking, and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air; <br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: Chance to decrease damage taken by 35% for 5 seconds when attacked, and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground.<br><font color="#9932CD">Gui Gu Tactics</font>: Once <font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font> is over, the target will be inflicted with 1 random effect from <font color="#f9fc00">Seal Skill, Disarmed, Paralyzed, Disable Flying skills</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_002_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to reduce the target's Evasion rate by 100% for 6 seconds, increase Damage taken by 30% and double the Vulnerable when the target is in the air.<br><font color="#FF3030">Black Troops Charge</font>: When receiving a hit, there is a chance to get a 40% Damage Decrease for 6 seconds and double the Damage Reduction effect when you are on the ground.<br><font color="#9932CD">Gui Gu Tactics</font>: Once <font color="#FF3030">Plot of Domination</font> is over, the target will be inflicted with 1 random effect from <font color="#f9fc00">Seal Skill, Disarmed, Paralyzed, Disable Flying skills</font> for 2 seconds. When it is over, <font color="#f9fc00">1 more of these debuffs</font> will be inflicted for 2 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_001_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Introspective Calm</font>: Chance to enter Calm Nerve state when attacking: Damage increased by 10%, lasts 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_001_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Introspective Calm</font>: Chance to enter Calm Nerve state when attacking: Damage increased by 12%, lasts 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_001_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Introspective Calm</font>: Chance to enter Calm Nerve state when attacking: Damage increased by 14%, lasts 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_sjy_001_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Introspective Calm</font>: Chance to enter Calm Nerve state when attacking: Damage increased by 17%, lasts 8 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cool Headed</font>: For 20 seconds after leaving the Calm the Nerves mode the first Critical Hit on you will backfire on the attacker with 300 points of Damage (added by Internal Attack Damage bonus).
desc_buf_ng_sjy_001_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Introspective Calm</font>: Chance to enter Calm Nerve state when attacking: Damage increased by 20%, lasts 10 seconds.<br><font color="#9932CD">Cool Headed</font>: For 20 seconds after leaving the Calm the Nerves mode the first Critical Hit on you will backfire on the attacker with 400 points of Damage (added by Internal Attack Damage bonus).
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_1_ngtips=Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 5 times: reflect at least 35 external damage when attacked within 5 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 5 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_2_ngtips=Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 6 times: reflect at least 43 external damage when attacked within 5 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 6 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_3_ngtips=Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 7 times: reflect at least 53 external damage when attacked within 5 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 7 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_4_ngtips=Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 8 times: reflect at least 59 external damage when attacked within 5 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 8 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_5_ngtips=Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 8 times: reflect at least 68 external damage when attacked within 6 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 8 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.<br>Getting <font color="#FF3030">Heart Sword </font> at the same time gives you 5 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Qi Purge</font>: In 5 seconds 554 points of your HP will be recovered (the more stacks of Qi Purge you have, the stronger the recovery effect will be). Using skills once at that time eliminates 1 stack of Qi Purge.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_6_ngtips=Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 8 times: reflect at least 79 external damage when attacked within 7 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 8 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.<br>Getting <font color="#FF3030">Heart Sword </font> at the same time gives you 6 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Qi Purge</font>: In 5 seconds 719 points of your HP will be recovered (the more stacks of Qi Purge you have, the stronger the recovery effect will be). Using skills once at that time eliminates 1 stack of Qi Purge.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_7_ngtips=Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 8 times: reflect at least 91 external damage when attacked within 8 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 8 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.<br>Getting <font color="#FF3030">Heart Sword </font> at the same time gives you 7 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Qi Purge</font>: In 5 seconds 906 points of your HP will be recovered (the more stacks of Qi Purge you have, the stronger the recovery effect will be). Using skills once at that time eliminates 1 stack of Qi Purge.
desc_buf_ng_jh_214_8_ngtips=Receive <font color="#FF3030">"Heart Sword"</font> effect when attacked. Can be stacked 10 times: reflect at least 103 external damage when attacked within 9 seconds (damage scales on melee and internal attack damage, each stack of "Heart Sword" also adds additional damage, reflect damage up to 10 times). Effect can be triggered once every 30 seconds.<br>Getting <font color="#FF3030">Heart Sword </font> at the same time gives you 8 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Qi Purge</font>: In 5 seconds 1107 points of your HP will be recovered (the more stacks of Qi Purge you have, the stronger the recovery effect will be). Using skills once at that time eliminates 1 stack of Qi Purge.
