tips_tlrecord_new_detailed=<font color="#00FF00">The Fatigue today:</font>when the Fatigue reaches <font color="#ff0000">100%</font>, the Team Practice will not get any benefits.<br><font color="#00FF00">Press successfully:</font> accumulate the right pressing times of the Team Practice.<br><font color="#00FF00">Press Failure:</font> accumulate the wrong pressing times of the Team Practice.<br><font color="#00FF00">Drop out:</font> accumulate the Team Practice Drop Out times. (When there is only one player in the Team Practice or the other players leave the Team Practice, or the sponsor of the Team Practice leaves, the Team Practice Drop Out times will not be increased.)<br><font color="#f9fc00">Right Click to check the detailed information.</font>
tips_ng_ts=Belongs to: Tianshan
desc_buf_ng_ts_001_1_ngtips=After 8 attacks, the following attack will deal 97 additional Yin damage to the enemies (Ignore defense and parry. Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage)
desc_buf_ng_ts_001_2_ngtips=After 7 attacks, the following attack will deal 138 additional Yin damage to the enemies (Ignore defense and parry. Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage)
desc_buf_ng_ts_001_3_ngtips=After 6 attacks, the following attack will deal 184 additional Yin damage to the enemies (Ignore defense and parry. Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage)
desc_buf_ng_ts_001_4_ngtips=After 5 attacks, the following attack will deal 234 additional Yin damage to the enemies (Ignore defense and parry. Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage)
desc_buf_ng_ts_002_1_ngtips=After being attacked 6 times, the next time you are attacked in 5 seconds, you will recover 145 HP or deflect 145 Yin damage (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage. Cooldown: 10 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_ts_002_2_ngtips=After being attacked 6 times, the next time you are attacked in 5 seconds, you will recover 207 HP or deflect 207 Yin damage (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage. Cooldown: 10 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_ts_002_3_ngtips=After being attacked 6 times, the next time you are attacked in 5 seconds, you will recover 276 HP or deflect 276 Yin damage (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage. Cooldown: 10 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_ts_002_4_ngtips=After being attacked 5 times, the next time you are attacked, you will recover 351 HP and 5% of max Energy or deflect 351 Yin damage (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage. Cooldown: 10 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_ts_003_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Crane Flies South</font>: generates random bouncing <font color="#FF3030">Crane Chi:</font> When bouncing to yourself, increases skill damage by 3%. When bouncing to the enemies, increases their damage taken by 3%. Both effects can stack 5 times (Cooldown: 30 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Light as Crane</font>: Energy cost reduces by 10%
desc_buf_ng_ts_003_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Crane Flies South</font>: generates random bouncing <font color="#FF3030">Crane Chi:</font> When bouncing to yourself, increases skill damage by 4%. When bouncing to the enemies, increases their damage taken by 4%. Both effects can stack 5 times (Cooldown: 30 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Light as Crane</font>: Energy cost reduces by 10%
desc_buf_ng_ts_003_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Crane Flies South</font>: generates random bouncing <font color="#FF3030">Crane Chi:</font> When bouncing to yourself, increases skill damage by 5%. When bouncing to the enemies, increases their damage taken by 5%. Both effects can stack 5 times (Cooldown: 30 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Light as Crane</font>: Energy cost reduces by 10%
desc_buf_ng_ts_003_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Crane Flies South</font>: generates random bouncing <font color="#FF3030">Crane Chi:</font> When bouncing to yourself, increases skill damage by 6% <font color="#f9fc00">and speed by 10%</font>. When bouncing to the enemies, increases their damage taken by 6% <font color="#f9fc00">and reduces their speed by 10%</font>. Both effects can stack 5 times (Cooldown: 30 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Light as Crane</font>: Energy cost reduces by 10%
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>: After being attacked, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> per second: your rate of Crit Hit reduces by 0.5% and crit damage reduction increases by 1%. Lasts 12 seconds. Can stack 6 times. <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> will transfer to the attacker when being attacked. Each stack will reduce their speed by 5%, increase rate of crit hit by 0.5% and crit damage taken by 1% (Cooldown: 30 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Plum Shadow Guardian</font>: At the end of <font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>, each attack will deal 73 additional Yin damage in 6 seconds (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). The more the enemy's Coldness, the higher the additional damage.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>: After being attacked, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> per second: your rate of Crit Hit reduces by 0.5% and crit damage reduction increases by 1.5%. Lasts 12 seconds. Can stack 6 times. <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> will transfer to the attacker when being attacked. Each stack will reduce their speed by 5%, increase rate of crit hit by 0.5% and crit damage taken by 1.5% (Cooldown: 30 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Plum Shadow Guardian</font>: At the end of <font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>, each attack will deal 91 additional Yin damage in 6 seconds (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). The more the enemy's Coldness, the higher the additional damage.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>: After being attacked, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> per second: your rate of Crit Hit reduces by 1% and crit damage reduction increases by 2%. Lasts 12 seconds. Can stack 6 times. <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> will transfer to the attacker when being attacked. Each stack will reduce their speed by 5%, increase rate of crit hit by 1% and crit damage taken by 2% (Cooldown: 30 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Plum Shadow Guardian</font>: At the end of <font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>, each attack will deal 110 additional Yin damage in 6 seconds (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). The more the enemy's Coldness, the higher the additional damage.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>: After being attacked, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> per second: your rate of Crit Hit reduces by 1% and crit damage reduction increases by 2.5%. Lasts 12 seconds. Can stack 6 times. <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> will transfer to the attacker when being attacked. Each stack will reduce their speed by 5%, increase rate of crit hit by 1% and crit damage taken by 2.5% (Cooldown: 30 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Plum Shadow Guardian</font>: At the end of <font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>, each attack will deal 129 additional Yin damage in 6 seconds (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). The more the enemy's Coldness, the higher the additional damage.
desc_buf_ng_ts_005_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soaring Heroism</font>: When attacking, there's a chance to inject 5 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> Chi which lasts 8 seconds into the enemies' body: deals hard damage continuously (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). The more the Chi stacks, the higher the damage. When attacking the master of Chi during this time, the Chi can be injected to his body;<br><font color="#FF3030">Upright Chi</font>: When being attacked, there's a chance to recover HP in 6 seconds continuously. If being attacked by the enemies with <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> Chi, the recovery effect will be better.
desc_buf_ng_ts_005_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soaring Heroism</font>: When attacking, there's a chance to inject 5 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> Chi which lasts 9 seconds into the enemies' body: deals hard damage continuously (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). The more the Chi stacks, the higher the damage. When attacking the master of Chi during this time, the Chi can be injected to his body;<br><font color="#FF3030">Upright Chi</font>: When being attacked, there's a chance to recover HP in 7 seconds continuously. If being attacked by the enemies with <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> Chi, the recovery effect will be better.
desc_buf_ng_ts_005_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soaring Heroism</font>: When attacking, there's a chance to inject 5 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> Chi which lasts 10 seconds into the enemies' body: deals hard damage continuously (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). The more the Chi stacks, the higher the damage. When attacking the master of Chi during this time, the Chi can be injected to his body;<br><font color="#FF3030">Upright Chi</font>: When being attacked, there's a chance to recover HP in 8 seconds continuously. If being attacked by the enemies with <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> Chi, the recovery effect will be better.
desc_buf_ng_ts_005_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soaring Heroism</font>: When attacking, there's a chance to inject 5 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> Chi which lasts 11 seconds into the enemies' body: deals hard damage continuously (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). The more the Chi stacks, the higher the damage. When attacking the master of Chi during this time, the Chi can be injected to his body;<br><font color="#FF3030">Upright Chi</font>: When being attacked, there's a chance to recover HP in 9 seconds continuously. If being attacked by the enemies with <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> Chi, the recovery effect will be better.
desc_buf_ng_ts_005_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Soaring Heroism</font>: When attacking, there's a chance to inject 8 stacks of <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> Chi which lasts 12 seconds into the enemies' body: deals hard damage continuously (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). The more the Chi stacks, the higher the damage. When attacking the master of Chi during this time, the Chi can be injected to his body;<br><font color="#FF3030">Upright Chi</font>: When being attacked, there's a chance to recover HP in 10 seconds continuously. If being attacked by the enemies with <font color="#FF3030">Broken Meridian</font> Chi, the recovery effect will be better.
desc_buf_ng_ts_006_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font>: When attacking, there's a chance to injure enemies with <font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font> Chi: 15% of the damage taken in 8 seconds will blast after 8 seconds. During this time, each attack (at most 3 times) will increase internal injury by 5%(Cooldown: 40 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font>: When being attacked, there's a chance to trigger <font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font> Chi to heal: 30% of the damage taken in 6 seconds will be converted into HP after 6 seconds. During this time, each attack taken (at most 3 times) will increase conversion effect by 5% (Cooldown: 40 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_ts_006_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font>: When attacking, there's a chance to injure enemies with <font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font> Chi: 20% of the damage taken in 8 seconds will blast after 8 seconds. During this time, each attack (at most 3 times) will increase internal injury by 5%(Cooldown: 38 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font>: When being attacked, there's a chance to trigger <font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font> Chi to heal: 30% of the damage taken in 6 seconds will be converted into HP after 6 seconds. During this time, each attack taken (at most 3 times) will increase conversion effect by 5% (Cooldown: 40 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_ts_006_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font>: When attacking, there's a chance to injure enemies with <font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font> Chi: 25% of the damage taken in 8 seconds will blast after 8 seconds. During this time, each attack (at most 3 times) will increase internal injury by 5%(Cooldown: 36 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font>: When being attacked, there's a chance to trigger <font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font> Chi to heal: 30% of the damage taken in 6 seconds will be converted into HP after 6 seconds. During this time, each attack taken (at most 3 times) will increase conversion effect by 5% (Cooldown: 40 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_ts_006_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font>: When attacking, there's a chance to injure enemies with <font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font> Chi: 30% of the damage taken in 8 seconds will blast after 8 seconds. During this time, each attack (at most 3 times) will increase internal injury by 5%(Cooldown: 34 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font>: When being attacked, there's a chance to trigger <font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font> Chi to heal: 30% of the damage taken in 6 seconds will be converted into HP after 6 seconds. During this time, each attack taken (at most 3 times) will increase conversion effect by 5% (Cooldown: 40 seconds)
desc_buf_ng_ts_006_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font>: When attacking, there's a chance to injure enemies with <font color="#FF3030">Rumble Thunder</font> Chi: Damage taken in 8 seconds increases by 15% and 35% of the damage taken in 8 seconds will blast after 8 seconds. During this time, each attack (at most 4 times) will increase internal injury by 5%(Cooldown: 32 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font>: When being attacked, there's a chance to trigger <font color="#FF3030">Harmonic Tone</font> Chi to heal: 30% of the damage taken in 6 seconds will be converted into HP after 6 seconds. During this time, each attack taken (at most 4 times) will increase conversion effect by 5% (Cooldown: 40 seconds)
