tips_tlrecord_main={@0:name}<br><font color="#00FF00">Daily Fatigue:</font> <s>{@1:fatigue}%<br><font color="#00FF00">Daily Extra Fatigue: </font><s>{@2:fatigue}%<br><font color="#00FF00">Press successfully:</font><s>{@3:success}<br><font color="#00FF00">Press Failure:</font><s>{@4:failure}<br><font color="#00FF00">Drop out:</font><s>{@5:quit}<br><font color="#f9fc00">Right Click to check the detailed information.</font>
tips_tlrecord_detailed=<font color="#00FF00">Daily Fatigue:</font>when the Fatigue reaches <font color="#ff0000">100%</font>, the Team Practice will not get any benefits. <br><font color="#00FF00">Daily Extra Fatigue:</font>when the extra Fatigue reaches <font color="#ff0000">100%</font>, the Team Practice will not get any benefits. <br><font color="#00FF00">Press successfully:</font> accumulate the right pressing times of the Team Practice. <br><font color="#00FF00">Press Failure:</font> accumulate the wrong pressing times of the Team Practice. <br><font color="#00FF00">Drop out:</font> accumulate the Team Practice Drop Out times.  (When there is only one player in the Team Practice or the other players leave the Team Practice, or the sponsor of the Team Practice leaves, the Team Practice Drop Out times will not be increased.) <br><font color="#f9fc00">Right Click to check the detailed information.</font>
tips_jyz_count_sl_3_5_0=Everyone is preparing to attack the Fine Wisdom Pavilion! You must collect as many Jackdaw Herbs as you can. Donate 200 Jackdaw Herbs each time. Open the ranking poll–Age of Wushu Record–School donation to view the related ranking. Once the donation is completed, the player who donated the most will receive a <font color="#ff1cae" >Premium Embroidered Box (which contains Scroll Fragments for Tai Chi Fist, Dog Beating Staff, Dragon Claw, Secret of the Holy Fire, Ghost Shadow Sword, Blood Sea Demon Blade, and Joined Fingers). Open the Box to get 3 random Scroll Fragments.</font><br/>Jackdaw Herb must be donated to Chen Xingwang: <br/>Shaolin: (790,382)<br/>Wudang: (470,366)<br/>Emei: (497,156)<br/>Beggar's Sect: (547,350)<br/>Tangmen: (957,-122)<br/>Scholars: (515,462)<br/>Royal Guards: (385,48)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (135,-21)<br/>Ming Cult (-31 214)<br/>Tianshan Sect (1240 990)
tips_jyz_count_sl_3_5_1=Everyone is preparing to attack the Fine Wisdom Pavilion! You must collect as many Jackdaw Herbs as you can. Donate 200 Jackdaw Herbs each time. Open the ranking poll–Age of Wushu Record–School donation to view the related ranking. Once the donation is completed, the player who donated the most will receive a <font color="#ff1cae" >Premium Embroidered Box (which contains Scroll Fragments for Tai Chi Fist, Dog Beating Staff, Dragon Claw, Secret of the Holy Fire, Ghost Shadow Sword, Blood Sea Demon Blade, and Joined Fingers). Open the Box to get 3 random Scroll Fragments.</font><br/>Jackdaw Herb must be donated to Chen Xingwang: <br/>Shaolin: (790,382)<br/>Wudang: (470,366)<br/>Emei: (497,156)<br/>Beggar's Sect: (547,350)<br/>Tangmen: (957,-122)<br/>Scholars: (515,462)<br/>Royal Guards: (385,48)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (135,-21)<br/>Ming Cult (-31 214)<br/>Tianshan Sect (1240 990)
tips_jyz_count_sl_3_2_0=Wipe out the Korean escort teams heading to the school's forbidden instances. After retrieving their identity badges, go to the school's maid area and exchange them for rewards<br/>Coordinates to the school forbidden instances:<br/>Shaolin: (433, -56)<br/>Wudang: (1047,515)<br/>Emei: (655,-279)<br/>Beggar's Sect: (882,-11)<br/>Tangmen: (1188,-552)<br/>Scholar's Academy: (141,617)<br/>Royal Guards: (-25,-555)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (141,617)<br/>Ming Cult (148 -574)<br/>Tianshan Sect (949 585)<br/>Maid coordinates:<br/>Shaolin: (442,-61)<br/>Wudang: (1027,525)<br/>Emei: (664,-286)<br/>Beggar's Sect: (891,-11)<br/>Tangmen: (1203,-543)<br/>Scholar's Academy: (131,622)<br/>Royal Guards: (-32,-544)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (687,-69)<br/>Ming Cult (148 -574)<br/>Tianshan Sect (949 585)
tips_jyz_count_sl_3_2_1=Wipe out the Korean escort teams heading to the school's forbidden instances. After retrieving their identity badges, go to the school's maid area and exchange them for rewards<br/>Coordinates to the school forbidden instances:<br/>Shaolin: (433, -56)<br/>Wudang: (1047,515)<br/>Emei: (655,-279)<br/>Beggar's Sect: (882,-11)<br/>Tangmen: (1188,-552)<br/>Scholar's Academy: (141,617)<br/>Royal Guards: (-25,-555)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (663,-42)<br/>Ming Cult (148 -574)<br/>Tianshan Sect (949 585)<br/>Maid coordinates:<br/>Shaolin: (442,-61)<br/>Wudang: (1027,525)<br/>Emei: (664,-286)<br/>Beggar's Sect: (891,-11)<br/>Tangmen: (1203,-543)<br/>Scholar's Academy: (131,622)<br/>Royal Guards: (-32,-544)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (687,-69)<br/>Ming Cult (148 -574)<br/>Tianshan Sect (949 585)<br/>(It is recommended that players proceed in small Raid Groups.)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_3_0=Accept the task "A Storm Is Coming". (<font color="#ff1cae" >This task can be accepted even when your list of tasks is full. We recommend that you first complete "A Storm Is Coming", and avoid not being able to submit after completing "Gather Bandits in the Mountains"</font>). After successfully joining a faction, donate Jackdaw Herb or School Honor Certificates to the NPC (200 bunches of Jackdaw Herb or 10 School Honor Certificates must be submitted each time), and you have a chance of receiving <font color="#ff1cae" >interesting Items, Treasures, or Artifacts for each donation</font>. Open ranking - Age of Wushu Record-Tier 4 Internal Skill story to view the current donation ranking. After the required donation quantities have been completed, the first person on each faction's ranking will receive <font color="#ff1cae" >Premium Embroidered Box, which contains Scroll Fragments for Tai Chi Fist, Dog Beating Staff, Dragon Claw, Secret of the Holy Fire, Ghost Shadow Sword, Sea of Blood, or Joined Fingers. Open the Box to get 3 random Scroll Fragments</font>. All the members of the first faction to reach 2,000 donations will receive an extra reward, which includes the rare title <font color="#ff1cae" >Lightning Flint</font>. Recommended for solo players <br/>Donation NPC: <br/>Four Great Outlaws: Jinling (2126, 885), <br/>Iron Riders: Yanjing (1755, 1231), <br/>Da Rizong: Suzhou (1525, 969), <br/>Silent Temple: Chengdu (1042, 446); <br/>Reward Giving NPC: <br/>Four Great Outlaws: Sixteenth Yan Jinling (2128, 884), <br/>Iron Riders: Seventeenth Yan Yanjing (1757, 1230), <br/>Da Rizong: Eighteenth Yan Suzhou (1523, 967), <br/>Silent Temple: Nineteenth Yan Chengdu (1042, 448)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_3_1=Accept the task "A Storm Is Coming". (<font color="#ff1cae" >This task can be accepted even when your list of tasks is full. We recommend that you first complete "A Storm Is Coming", and avoid not being able to submit after completing "Gather Bandits in the Mountains"</font>). After successfully joining a faction, donate Jackdaw Herb or School Honor Certificates to the NPC (200 bunches of Jackdaw Herb or 10 School Honor Certificates must be submitted each time), and you have a chance of receiving <font color="#ff1cae" >interesting Items, Treasures, or Artifacts for each donation</font>. Open ranking - Age of Wushu Record-Tier 4 Internal Skill story to view the current donation ranking. After the required donation quantities have been completed, the first person on each faction's ranking will receive <font color="#ff1cae" >Premium Embroidered Box, which contains Scroll Fragments for Tai Chi Fist, Dog Beating Staff, Dragon Claw, Secret of the Holy Fire, Ghost Shadow Sword, Sea of Blood, or Joined Fingers. Open the Box to get 3 random Scroll Fragments</font>. All the members of the first faction to reach 2,000 donations will receive an extra reward, which includes the rare title <font color="#ff1cae" >Lightning Flint</font>. Recommended for solo players <br/>Donation NPC: <br/>Four Great Outlaws: Jinling (2126, 885), <br/>Iron Riders: Yanjing (1755, 1231), <br/>Da Rizong: Suzhou (1525, 969), <br/>Silent Temple: Chengdu (1042, 446); <br/>Reward Giving NPC: <br/>Four Great Outlaws: Sixteenth Yan Jinling (2128, 884), <br/>Iron Riders: Seventeenth Yan Yanjing (1757, 1230), <br/>Da Rizong: Eighteenth Yan Suzhou (1523, 967), <br/>Silent Temple: Nineteenth Yan Chengdu (1042, 448)
