desc_buf_ng_xmg_001_1_ngtips=When attacking, casts 1 wave of <font color="#FF3030">Wind Chimera Chi</font> for 5 seconds, dealing some soft damage per second.
desc_buf_ng_xmg_001_2_ngtips=When attacking, casts 1 wave of <font color="#FF3030">Wind Chimera Chi</font> for 5 seconds, dealing some soft damage per second.
desc_buf_ng_xmg_001_3_ngtips=When attacking, casts 1 wave of <font color="#FF3030">Wind Chimera Chi</font> for 5 seconds, dealing some soft damage per second.
desc_buf_ng_xmg_001_4_ngtips=When attacking, casts 1 wave of <font color="#FF3030">Wind Chimera Chi</font> for 5 seconds, dealing some soft damage per second.<br><font color="#FF3030">Chi</font>: Chi recovers some HP for yourself.
desc_buf_ng_xmg_001_5_ngtips=When attacking, casts 1 wave of <font color="#FF3030">Wind Chimera Chi</font> for 5 seconds, dealing some soft damage per second.<br><font color="#FF3030">Chi</font>: Chi recovers some HP for yourself.
desc_buf_ng_xmg_002_1_ngtips=Gets Reclusion once a while, increasing movement speed by 3%, which is removed when getting Flowing Light Break Slay<br><font color="#FF3030">Flowing Light Break Slay</font>: Removes Reclusion when attacking, increasing internal and external defense ignorance by 8% for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xmg_002_2_ngtips=Gets Reclusion once a while, increasing movement speed by 3%, which is removed when getting Flowing Light Break Slay<br><font color="#FF3030">Flowing Light Break Slay</font>: Removes Reclusion when attacking, increasing internal and external defense ignorance by 10% for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xmg_002_3_ngtips=Gets Reclusion once a while, increasing movement speed by 3%, which is removed when getting Flowing Light Break Slay<br><font color="#FF3030">Flowing Light Break Slay</font>: Removes Reclusion when attacking, increasing internal and external defense ignorance by 12% for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xmg_002_4_ngtips=Gets Reclusion once a while, increasing movement speed by 3%, which is removed when getting Flowing Light Break Slay<br><font color="#FF3030">Flowing Light Break Slay</font>: Removes Reclusion when attacking, increasing internal and external defense ignorance by 14% for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xmg_002_5_ngtips=Gets Reclusion once a while, increasing movement speed by 3%, which is removed when getting Flowing Light Break Slay<br><font color="#FF3030">Flowing Light Break Slay</font>: Removes Reclusion when attacking, increasing internal and external defense ignorance by 16% for 8 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Stand Aloof</font>: When being attacked, gets 1 stack of Stand Aloof. Each stack reduces damage received by 3%, can stack 5 times. Lasts 8 seconds. Can comprehend Shadow Flow Secret - Secret when ends naturally. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Shadow Flow Secret - Secret</font>: Enhances the next Flowing Light Break Slay and inflicts extra damage based on the stack of Stand Aloof. Lasts 40 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xmg_002_6_ngtips=Gets Reclusion once a while, increasing movement speed by 3%, which is removed when getting Flowing Light Break Slay<br><font color="#FF3030">Flowing Light Break Slay</font>: Removes Reclusion when attacking, increasing internal and external defense ignorance by 18% for 8 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Stand Aloof</font>: When being attacked, gets 1 stack of Stand Aloof. Each stack reduces damage received by 3%, can stack 6 times. Lasts 8 seconds. Can comprehend Shadow Flow Secret - Secret when ends naturally. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Shadow Flow Secret - Secret</font>: Enhances the next Flowing Light Break Slay and inflicts extra damage based on the stack of Stand Aloof. Lasts 40 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_xmg_002_7_ngtips=Gets Reclusion once a while, increasing movement speed by 3%, which is removed when getting Flowing Light Break Slay<br><font color="#FF3030">Flowing Light Break Slay</font>: Removes Reclusion when attacking, increasing internal and external defense ignorance by 20% for 8 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Stand Aloof</font>: When being attacked, gets 1 stack of Stand Aloof. Each stack reduces damage received by 3%, can stack 7 times. Lasts 8 seconds. Can comprehend Shadow Flow Secret - Secret when ends naturally. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Shadow Flow Secret - Secret</font>: Enhances the next Flowing Light Break Slay and inflicts extra damage based on the stack of Stand Aloof. Lasts 40 seconds.
