tips_revise_name_04=When checked it saves various information.<br>Including: <br>Challenge info<br>School post info<br>Mount Hua Competition info<br>School War info<br>Arena info<br>Team info<br>Disciple info
tips_nixiu_jm_zushaoyin_ni=You must learn Ancient Tomb Jade Maiden's Heart after unlocking Age of Wushu Records' Reclusive Factions story, and have been cultivating your Meridians for at least 180 days.
tips_nixiu_jm_zushaoyang_ni=You must learn Blood Blade Heart after unlocking Age of Wushu Records' Reclusive Factions story, and have been cultivating your Meridians for at least 180 days.
tips_nixiu_jm_zuyangming_ni=You must learn the Palm-Leaf Sutra after unlocking Age of Wushu Records' Reclusive Factions story, and have been cultivating your Meridians for at least 180 days.
tips_nixiu_jm_shoutaiyang_ni=You must learn Cloud-surpassing Mental Skill after unlocking Age of Wushu Records' Reclusive Factions story, and have been cultivating your Meridians for at least 180 days.
tips_nixiu_jm_zutaiyin_ni=You must learn Celestial Magic Secret after unlocking Age of Wushu Records' Reclusive Factions story, and have been cultivating your Meridians for at least 180 days.
tips_nixiu_jm_shoutaiyin_ni=You must learn Tidal Wave after unlocking Age of Wushu Records' Reclusive Factions story, and have been cultivating your Meridians for at least 180 days.
tips_nixiu_jm_zujueyin_ni=You must learn Purple Soul after unlocking Age of Wushu Records' Reclusive Factions story, and have been cultivating your Meridians for at least 180 days.
desc_buf_ng_ts_004_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>: After being attacked, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> per second: your rate of Crit Hit reduces by 1.5% and crit damage reduction increases by 3%. Lasts 12 seconds. Can stack 6 times. <font color="#FF3030">Snow Protection Chi</font> will transfer to the attacker when being attacked. Each stack will reduce their speed by 10%, increase rate of crit hit by 1.5% and crit damage taken by 3% (Cooldown: 30 seconds);<br><font color="#FF3030">Plum Shadow Guardian</font>: At the end of <font color="#FF3030">Cold Plum Protection</font>, each attack will deal 156 additional Yin damage in 8 seconds (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). The more the enemy's Coldness, the higher the additional damage.
tips_nixiu_jm_shoushaoyang_ni=You must learn Five Immortals in a Rain of Flowers after unlocking Age of Wushu Records' Reclusive Factions story, and have been cultivating your positive Meridians for at least 180 Cultivating Circles.
tip_button_yushe=You can place the moves of learned and unlearned martial skills (excluding Basic Moves and Shallow Kungfu) on the preset action bar randomly as you like. But you can't use them. If you enter Snowland, Martial Path Convention, Group Martial Arts Competition, etc. scenes, and have learned a skill set, then provided its keybind has been preset already, you can directly use the preset keybind of that skill set. It is convenient.
tips_nixiu_jm_shouyangming_ni=Studying Shenji Camp Ghost Valley Divine Scrolls and a 180-day meridian cultivation are required (Activating the plot of Reclusive Factions story of Age of Wushu Record is also needed).
