tips_pkmode_1=Peaceful Mode. You cannot attack other players.
tips_pkmode_2=Jianghu Attack Mode, would not automatically attack players in the Protected List<br>Learn Life Skills, Array, or Cultivate Internal Skills (Self Recollection Skills to Level 11 or other Internal Skills to Level 5) then can be activated<br> Can choose this freely when not in Killing Mode
tips_pkmode_4=Mega-Killer Player-Killing Mode. You cannot activate this mode normally.
desc_patrol_item_0=A token that gives you the authority to Patrol within your School, to kill Spies from other Schools, and seize the Intelligence that they have gathered. When you are Patrolling within your School with this Token, the speed which your Experience becomes Cultivation will increase by 10%.
tips_clone004_count5=Kill Liu Fangshuo, when Lahu Ertuo is healing himself. He will join the battle once he is cured.
tips_clone004_count6=Kill Liu Fangshuo, when Lahu Ertuo is healing himself. He will join the battle once he is cured.
tips_jyz_count_sl_3_6_0=It's time to attack Juxian Tower. After the heroes broke through to Huanxiu Mountain Villa, they discovered that the Korean Prince was, in fact, a woman. Destroy all the school traitors and the Korean Princess and take back the school tapestry fragments! <br/>Step 1: Defeat the 8 traitors from the eight major schools<br/>Step 2: Defeat 200 death guards<br/>Step 3: Defeat the Korean Princess. <br/>The player to kill the Korean Princess will be given the title <font color="#ff1cae" >Peerless Warrior</font>. <br/>Korean Princess location: <br/>Suzhou: Huanxiu Mountain Villa (-66,1116)<br/>(It is recommended that players participate in large raid Groups)
tips_jyz_count_sl_3_6_1=It's time to attack Juxian Tower. After the heroes broke through to Huanxiu Mountain Villa, they discovered that the Korean Prince was, in fact, a woman. Destroy all the school traitors and the Korean Princess and take back the school tapestry fragments! <br/>Step 1: Defeat the 8 traitors from the eight major schools<br/>Step 2: Defeat 200 death guards<br/>Step 3: Defeat the Korean Princess. <br/>The player to kill the Korean Princess will be given the title <font color="#ff1cae" >Peerless Warrior</font>. <br/>Korean Princess location: <br/>Suzhou: Huanxiu Mountain Villa (-66,1116)<br/>(It is recommended that players participate in large raid Groups)
tips_jyz_count_sl_3_7_0=Preparation is in progress. Go to Huanxiu Mountain Villa in Suzhou (-66, 1116) and kill the eight traitors from each school gathering at Juxian Tower. With the assistance of the masters, kill 200 death guards, then search for and capture the mastermind of Juxian Tower.
tips_jyz_count_sl_3_7_1=Preparation is in progress. Go to Huanxiu Mountain Villa in Suzhou (-66, 1116) and kill the eight traitors from each school gathering at Juxian Tower. With the assistance of the masters, kill 200 death guards, then search for and capture the mastermind of Juxian Tower.
tips_prop_pkvalue=Infamy: {@0:value}
tips_hquarter_0=Kill Huo Dushan, overtake the barracks, and occupy Longman Pass.
tips_clonetl_01_0=Time is of the essence. After the countdown, you have to defeat all the illusions as soon as possible.
tips_clonetl_01_1=Time is of the essence. After the countdown, you have to defeat all the illusions as soon as possible.
tips_clonetl_03_0=Time is of the essence. If you cannot complete 'Heart of the Devil' by the end of the countdown, you will fail the challenge and be teleported out of the scene.
tips_clonetl_03_1=Time is of the essence. If you cannot complete 'Heart of the Devil' by the end of the countdown, you will fail the challenge and be teleported out of the scene.
tips_karma_19="Only fools battle the sea."
tips_karma_34="Only fools battle the sea."
tips_karma_49="Only fools battle the sea."
tips_karma_64="Only fools battle the sea."
tips_karma_79="Only fools battle the sea."
tips_karma_94="Only fools battle the sea."
desc_buf_ng_jy_002_1_ngtips=Each target killed will increase Stamina by 5 and Melee Attack Power by 3%. Can be stacked 5 times. Lasts 2 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_jy_002_2_ngtips=Each target killed will increase Stamina by 5 and Melee Attack Power by 3%. Can be stacked 6 times. Lasts 2 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_jy_002_3_ngtips=Each target killed will increase Stamina by 5 and Melee Attack Power by 3%. Can be stacked 8 times. Lasts 2 minutes.
desc_buf_ng_jy_002_4_ngtips=Each target killed will increase Stamina by 5 and Melee Damage by 3%. Can be stacked 10 times. Lasts forever.
tips_kill_diff=The enemies killings difference between both sides. When the gap between both sides is two big, the weak side will refresh the Sword Chi.
tips_clone011_03_0=Wild dogs killed
tips_clone011_03_1=Wild dogs killed
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_4_0=We will prevail and rescue Ding Jiuzhong! The Swordsman who killed Jiang Ruosheng, General of the Imperial Army, shall receive the title: "<font color="#ff1cae" >Moving Against the Heavens</font>"! Recommended that players work as a team. <br/>Prison grounds coordinates: <br/>Jinling: (1303 1885)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_4_1=We will prevail and rescue Ding Jiuzhong! The Swordsman who killed Jiang Ruosheng, General of the Imperial Army, shall receive the title: "<font color="#ff1cae" >Moving Against the Heavens</font>"! Recommended that players work as a team. <br/>Prison grounds coordinates: <br/>Jinling: (1303 1885)
tips_cl_szwe01_savebx_0=The commoners of Suzhou have received many grave injuries. There aren't enough doctors, and they don't have time to treat all the commoners. You can use medicinal materials to prepare healing drugs at Zhang's Library (363,469) or Hua Tuo's place (436,358). After getting the medicine, hurry to treat the injured people. The commoners will flee after being treated. You must protect them to ensure their successful flight. If they are attacked by Cultists along the way, they will require treatment again! You must also pay attention to seriously wounded Cultists that cannot be treated. The Cultists indulge in slaughter; even if you can cure them, they will still kill you.
tips_cl_szwe01_killyn_0=The Cultists pursued by Zhao Ziji scatter and flee to everywhere in Suzhou. But because of a plot, Zhao Ziji is trapped in the Kuang Family Estate, and the Cultists rush to the Kuang Family Estate in hopes of killing Zhao Ziji. Each time a Cultist enters the Kuang Family Estate. The danger facing Zhao Ziji is even greater. The event will end if Zhao Ziji is killed by the Cultists. The fiends slaughter people casually wherever they go, and the common people of Suzhou are usually their first victims. Try hard to keep the Cultists from entering the Kuang Family Estate. Kill them to keep them from killing any more common people.
tips_cl_szwe01_saverz1_0=Because of the threat to the hostages, you cannot force your way into the Suzhou imperial office. However, VIP players can enter and help rescue the hostages. When the heroes enter the Cultists' range. The Cultists will begin to kill hostages, and players must stop them from killing hostages. A player who has successfully killed three Cultists can tell the hostages to flee. After starting to rescue the hostages, you must either rescue all the hostages, or allow all the hostages to die, within 30 minutes; otherwise Zhao Ziji will be killed by the Cultists.
tips_cl_szwe01_saverz2_0=Whenever a hostage dies, this will give Zhao Ziji another burst of Murderous Chi. Murderous Chi has a special relationship with thunderstorms, and the greater the Murderous Chi, the more lightning and thunder. While this will vastly increase Zhao Ziji's strength in the beginning, but when the lightning strikes exceed his ability to withstand them, they will kill him.
tips_cl_szwe01_killzzj_0=Zhao Ziji is besieged by Cultists in the Suzhou Kuang Family Estate (356,371). Their energy battles will disturb the energy within a small area, enough to knock back other players who wish to enter. Each time a player kills a Cultist guarding the hostages, this will cause the Cultists surrounding Zhao Ziji to back off from their attack and attack a player. When the number of Cultists surrounding Zhao Ziji is less than 4, Zhao Ziji can then forcibly break out of the siege. The player must kill him within 15 minutes.
tip_school_Ass_1=Within the allotted time, keep the school's important people alive, and kill all the Assassins Guild leaders to stop their assault.
tip_count_city03war01_3=In order to defeat the Prince of a Thousand Sentiments, we will have to surround the enemy! Help the Disciples and sisters of your school defeat the Martial Arts Master of the Western Territories! <br>Kill the <font color="#FF3030">new rebel forces</font> in Jinling City. In addition to general supplies, there will also be battle marks. By walking onto them, you can open up a battle with the Martial Arts Master of the Western Territories. After you win the battle, you will be given a significant reward. <br><font color="#FF3030">Players should participate individually</font>
tips_tgsr_shiweitj=Kill the bodyguards and eunuchs in the Imperial Mausoleum
tips_tgsr_bossczq=Kill Cao Zhengqing in the Imperial Mausoleum
tips_jyz_count_sl_5_2_0=Lord Qin has already figured out the hideouts of all assassins, you are expected to rush to kill them (It is recommended that players participate in large raid Groups). <br/>Coordinates of the assassins: <br/>Luoyang: (1213,759), (758,794), (936,1001), (512,518)
tips_jyz_count_sl_5_2_1=Lord Qin has already figured out the hideouts of all assassins, you are expected to rush to kill them (It is recommended that players participate in large raid Groups). <br/>Coordinates of the assassins: <br/>Luoyang: (1213,759), (758,794), (936,1001), (512,518)
tips_jyz_count_sl_5_3_0=You are expected to defeat Ximen Wudi, then eradicate his accomplices. (It is recommended that players participate in large raid Groups). <br/>Ximen Wudi's Location: <br/>Luoyang (883, 1207)
tips_jyz_count_sl_5_3_1=You are expected to defeat Ximen Wudi, then eradicate his accomplices. (It is recommended that players participate in large raid Groups). <br/>Ximen Wudi's Location: <br/>Luoyang (883, 1207)
tips_jyz_count_sl_5_4_0=Find Ximen Wudi at the Hamster Den and kill him (It is recommended that players participate in large raid Groups). <br/>Coordinates of Ximen Wudi: Luoyang(881 1212)
tips_jyz_count_sl_5_4_1=Find Ximen Wudi at the Hamster Den and kill him (It is recommended that players participate in large raid Groups). <br/>Coordinates of Ximen Wudi: Luoyang(881 1212)
tips_buff_khd_ck_018_0=Wear it in Delightful Island, and killing does not increase Infamy, violating school rules does not increase Discipline Value.
tips_jyz_count_sl_6_4_1=Kill the followers of Elder Huadi carrying poisonous insects at Luoyang (933,1256), (512,518), (640,1110), or (936,1001).
tips_btn_home_28=The higher level and Prosperity of the Courtyard, the more Supply points can be obtained each day. Supply points limit is 200,000.
desc_buf_ng_xd_002_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Relentless Butchering</font>: Your hit has a chance to cause the target to bleed for 5 seconds. Deals an additional 15% External Attack Damage to targets affected by this bleed effect.<br><font color="#9932CD">Executioner</font>: When you slay a player, your next hit will cause the target to bleed over time.
desc_buf_ng_xd_002_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Relentless Butchering</font>: Your hit has a chance to cause the target to bleed for 5 seconds. Deals an additional 18% External Attack Damage to targets affected by this bleed effect.<br><font color="#9932CD">Executioner</font>: When you slay a player, your next hit will cause the target to bleed over time.
desc_buf_ng_xd_002_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Relentless Butchering</font>: Your hit has a chance to cause the target to bleed for 5 seconds. Deals an additional 21% External Attack Damage to targets affected by this bleed effect.<br><font color="#9932CD">Executioner</font>: When you slay a player, your next hit will cause the target to bleed over time.
