tip_ssg_dongyin_state1=Go to Silver Snake Bay (644,889) and defeat the minions who are making trouble
tip_ssg_dongyin_state2=Go to Muyun Villa (878,860) and defeat Expert Pirate and lure out the Lieutenant Zhuang Yuxian (868,855)
tip_ssg_dongyin_state3=Go to Twelve-Linked Fortress (122,612) and defeat pirates thugs and lure out Lieutenant Wang Qing (122,612)
tips_pld_zyb001=Go to (-635, -52) or (-708, -273). Destroy the puppets to obtain wood, then deliver the wood to the puppet leader at (-1154, -106).
tips_sys_wywl_mm_02=Zhuo Bei pretends to retreat. His real purpose is to attack Central Plains. Foreign Experts have gone to Shaolin (761,523). Please help. <br><font color1="#eb6100">Help Shaolin to defeat the Foreign Experts</font><br><font color="#FF3030">(Phase 3 unlocked 10 minutes after all school crisis has been resolved) </font>
tips_sys_wywl_mm_03=Zhuo Bei pretends to retreat. His real purpose is to attack Central Plains. Foreign Experts have gone to Wudang (473,631). Please help. <br><font color1="#eb6100">Help Wudang to defeat the Foreign Experts</font><br><font color="#FF3030">(Phase 3 unlocked 10 minutes after all school crisis has been resolved) </font>
tips_sys_wywl_mm_04=Zhuo Bei pretends to retreat. His real purpose is to attack Central Plains. Foreign Experts have gone to Royal Guards (351,85). Please help. <br><font color1="#eb6100">Help Royal Guards to defeat the Foreign Experts</font><br><font color="#FF3030">(Phase 3 unlocked 10 minutes after all school crisis has been resolved) </font>
tips_sys_wywl_mm_06=Zhuo Bei pretends to retreat. His real purpose is to attack Central Plains. Foreign Experts have gone to Wanderer's Valley (374,102). Please help. <br><font color1="#eb6100">Help Wanderer's Valley to defeat the Foreign Experts</font><br><font color="#FF3030">(Phase 3 unlocked 10 minutes after all school crisis has been resolved) </font>
tips_sys_wywl_mm_07=You have successfully defeated the Foreign Killers. Expert of Zhuo Bei appears. Defeat him to retrieve the Foreign Treasure. <br><font color="#FF3030">(Quest NPC will only appear once you have defeated the Foreign Leader) </font>
tips_sys_wywl_mm_08=You have successfully defeated the Foreign Killers. Expert of Zhuo Bei appears. Defeat him to retrieve the Foreign Treasure. <br><font color="#FF3030">(Quest NPC will only appear once you have defeated the Foreign Leader) </font>
tips_sys_wywl_mm_09=You have successfully defeated the Foreign Killers. Expert of Zhuo Bei appears. Defeat him to retrieve the Foreign Treasure. <br><font color="#FF3030">(Quest NPC will only appear once you have defeated the Foreign Leader) </font>
tips_sys_wywl_mm_11=You have successfully defeated the Foreign Killers. Expert of Zhuo Bei appears. Defeat him to retrieve the Foreign Treasure. <br><font color="#FF3030">(Quest NPC will only appear once you have defeated the Foreign Leader) </font>
tips_wywl_time_02=Another wave of attack is about to start. Zhuo Bei has sent out his Elite Killers.
tips_mmzw_mpfg_time_001=Defeat Foreign Leader Zhuo Bei, Elder Shique, and Elder Huadi to win the battle. Rescue the hostages to get bonus.
tips_jy_fswf_01=Your beautiful home attracted some thieves here. Please hurry to accept the quest and defeat the thieves, and submit the quest after completing before the time limit.
tips_jy_fswf_02=You've accepted the quest and obtained some skills. Please use the corresponding skills to defeat the thieves. You can also invite your friends to help from Social-Friends/Intimate Friends.(If you asked your friends to help you, your friends also need to accept the quest. Please remember to form a team or you may be unable to complete the quest. The quest can be completed 3 times everyday.)
tips_jy_fswf_03=You've submitted the Defeat the Thieves quest.
tips_jy_fswf_04=You haven't defeated the thieves within the set time. Quest failed.
tips_jy_fswf_05=You've defeated the thieves and guarded your home. Please go to submit the quest and claim rewards.
tips_jy_fswf_16=You've accepted the quest. Go to find the suspicious people, see through their identity and defeat them.
tips_jy_fswf_18=You haven't defeated the thieves within the set time. Quest failed.
tips_jy_fswf_19=You've defeated the thieves and guarded your home. Please go to submit the quest and claim rewards.
tips_jsq_jy_fswf_001=<font color="#FF3030">The thieves have invaded. Please protect your home by defeating the thieves in your courtyard. (Please accept the quest actively after the event began, or you may failed to get the rewards. This quest can be completed three times everyday. If you invited your friends to help you, remember to form a team or you may failed to complete the quest. After completed the quest please submit the quest to Feng Shui Master. If you accept the quest again after completed once, you need to wait for the next event to complete.)</font>
tips_jsq_jy_fswf_002=<font color="#FF3030">The thieves have invaded. Please protect your home by defeating the thieves in your courtyard. (Please accept the quest actively after the event began, or you may failed to get the rewards. This quest can be completed three times everyday. If you invited your friends to help you, remember to form a team or you may failed to complete the quest. After completed the quest please submit the quest to Feng Shui Master. If you accept the quest again after completed once, you need to wait for the next event to complete.)</font>
tips_jsq_jqwfxjq_001=<font color="#FF3030">Help Lin Tiannan to kill Foreign Leader Helian Mie. (You can hide inside Central Plains Dharma Sect Expert's Protection Zone if you are injured, and wait for Lin Tiannan to defeat the Foreign Leader) </font>
tips_jsq_jqwfxjq_002=<font color="#FF3030">Help Hei Baizi and Yun Yangzi to kill Foreign Leader Gongsun You.</font>
tips_jsq_jqwfxjq_003=<font color="#FF3030">Help Shenji Elder to kill Foreign Leader Huyan Tai. </font>
tips_jshuq_jqwfxjq_001=<font color="#FF3030">Kill the bandits in black and get Foreign Wulin Token. </font>
tips_jsq_jqwfxjq_004=<font color="#FF3030">Help Central Plains Wulin to defeat Foreign Li Zhenqiu. </font>
tips_jsq_jqwfxjq_005=<font color="#FF3030">Help Central Plains Wulin to defeat Foreign Leader Elder Huadi. </font>
