desc_buf_ng_kl_001_1_ngtips=There is a certain chance of creating a spiritual shield around oneself when being attacked (which can absorb a certain amount of damage).
desc_buf_ng_kl_001_2_ngtips=There is a certain chance of creating a spiritual shield around oneself when being attacked (which can absorb a certain amount of damage).
desc_buf_ng_kl_001_3_ngtips=There is a certain chance of creating a spiritual shield around oneself when being attacked (which can absorb a certain amount of damage).
desc_buf_ng_kl_001_4_ngtips=There is a certain chance of creating a spiritual shield around oneself when being attacked (which can absorb a certain amount of damage). If attacked during the protection of the spiritual shield, the enemy attacking oneself will suffer a negative effect: "Aging". <br><font color="#FF3030">Aging</font>: Reduces all attack damage by 50%, decreases by 5% per second, lasting for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_1_ngtips=Each attack has a certain chance of injecting a burst of "Proud Sun True Qi" into the target. <br><font color="#FF3030">Proud Sun True Qi</font>: Continuously drains health. (If injected again during the True Qi outbreak, the timer will be reset.)
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_2_ngtips=Each attack has a certain chance of injecting a burst of "Proud Sun True Qi" into the target. <br><font color="#FF3030">Proud Sun True Qi</font>: Continuously drains health. (If injected again during the True Qi outbreak, the timer will be reset.)
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_3_ngtips=Each attack has a certain chance of injecting a burst of "Proud Sun True Qi" into the target. <br><font color="#FF3030">Proud Sun True Qi</font>: Continuously drains health. (If injected again during the True Qi outbreak, the timer will be reset.)
desc_buf_ng_kl_002_4_ngtips=Each attack has a certain chance of injecting a burst of "Proud Sun Qi" into the target. <br> <font color="#FF3030">Proud Sun Qi</font>: Continuously drains health. (If injected again during the Qi outbreak, the timer will be reset) <br> If there are hostile targets within a 4-meter radius of the target, the Qi will spread to the surrounding area and inject a burst of "Proud Sun Qi" into the affected targets. (Affected targets cannot be affected again until the effect ends)
desc_buf_ng_kl_003_1_ngtips=By using internal force to resist, there is a chance to shock and injure enemies, causing their lower body meridians to become disordered and suffer from the negative effect "limping". <br><font color="#FF3030">Limping</font>: The affected target will be shocked and cause a certain amount of Yin damage every time they attack; and every time they move, their actions will become slower, but stopping movement can gradually alleviate the symptoms. <br><font color="#FF3030">Graceful Posture</font>: There is a 30% chance to return 10 points of light power when using light skills.
desc_buf_ng_kl_003_2_ngtips=By using internal force to resist, there is a chance to shock and injure enemies attacking oneself, causing their lower body's meridians to become disordered and suffer from the negative effect "limping". <br><font color="#FF3030">Limping</font>: The affected target will be shocked and cause a certain amount of Yin damage every time they attack; and every time they move, their actions will become slower, but stopping movement can gradually alleviate the symptoms. <br><font color="#FF3030">Graceful Posture</font>: There is a 30% chance to return 12 points of light power when using light skills.
desc_buf_ng_kl_003_3_ngtips=By using internal force to resist, there is a chance to shock and injure enemies attacking oneself, causing their lower body's meridians to become disordered and suffer from the negative effect "limping". <br><font color="#FF3030">Limping</font>: The affected target will be shocked and cause a certain amount of Yin damage every time they attack; and every time they move, their actions will become slower, but stopping movement can gradually alleviate the symptoms. <br><font color="#FF3030">Graceful Posture</font>: There is a 30% chance to return 15 points of light power when using light skills.
desc_buf_ng_kl_003_4_ngtips=Using internal force to resist oneself, there is a chance to shock and injure the enemy, causing their lower body meridians to become disordered and suffer from the negative effect "limping". <br><font color="#FF3030">Limping</font>: The affected target will be shocked and cause a certain amount of Yin damage every time they attack; and every movement will make their actions slower, but stopping movement can gradually relieve the symptoms. <br><font color="#FF3030">Graceful posture</font>: When using light skills, there is a 30% chance to return 18 light skill points.
desc_buf_ng_kl_004_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dissonant melody</font>: Every time the target is attacked, there is a chance to cause Yin damage to the target and enemies within a 4-meter radius (after taking effect, there will be a brief rest). <br><font color="#FF3030">Melodious melody</font>: Every time being attacked, there is a chance to restore health to oneself and teammates within a 4-meter radius (after taking effect, there will be a brief rest).
desc_buf_ng_kl_004_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dissonant melody</font>: Every time the target is attacked, there is a chance to cause Yin damage to the target and enemies within a 4-meter radius (after taking effect, there will be a brief rest). <br><font color="#FF3030">Melodious melody</font>: Every time being attacked, there is a chance to restore health to oneself and teammates within a 4-meter radius (after taking effect, there will be a brief rest).
desc_buf_ng_kl_004_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dissonant melody</font>: Every time the target is attacked, there is a chance to cause Yin damage to the target and enemies within a 4-meter radius (after taking effect, there will be a brief rest). <br><font color="#FF3030">Melodious melody</font>: Every time being attacked, there is a chance to restore health to oneself and teammates within a 4-meter radius (after taking effect, there will be a brief rest).
desc_buf_ng_kl_004_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dissonant melody</font>: Every time the target is attacked, there is a chance to cause Yin damage to the target and enemies within a 4-meter radius (after taking effect, there will be a brief rest). <br><font color="#FF3030">Melodious melody</font>: Every time being attacked, there is a chance to restore health to oneself and teammates within a 4-meter radius (after taking effect, there will be a brief rest).
desc_buf_ng_kl_004_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Dissonant Melody</font>: Each attack has a chance to deal Yin damage to the target and enemies within a 4-meter radius (after it takes effect, there will be a brief rest period). <br><font color="#FF3030">Harmonious Melody</font>: Each time being attacked, there is a chance to restore health to oneself and teammates within a 4-meter radius (after it takes effect, there will be a brief rest period). <br><font color="#CFB53B">Harmony of the Strings</font>: Within 10 seconds after triggering one of the melodies, there is a slight increase in the chance of triggering the second melody and a significant reduction in its rest period. If the second melody is successfully triggered, its effect is enhanced by 100% (maximum of 10 times), and during the triggering period, there is an additional 10% increase in attack damage or 10% increase in defense based on the type of melody. The effect ends and enters a rest period.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Gentle Breeze</font>: When critiquing or being critiqued, gain 1 stack of "Gentle Breeze", reducing the damage taken from critical hits by 5% for 15 seconds. Each time you critique or are critiqued, gain 1 additional stack, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. (Stacks do not increase duration and the effect ends when entering a cooldown period.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Energetic</font>: When "Gentle Breeze" ends, gain an effect based on the number of stacks removed. Each stack increases your attack damage and critical hit damage by 5%. Critiquing an enemy removes 1 stack, or they disappear after 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Gentle Breeze</font>: When critiquing or being critiqued, gain 1 stack of "Gentle Breeze", reducing the damage taken from critical strikes by 6% for 15 seconds. Each time you critique or are critiqued, gain 1 additional stack, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. (Stacks do not increase duration and the effect ends when entering a cooldown period.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Energetic</font>: When "Gentle Breeze" ends, gain an effect based on the number of stacks removed. Each stack increases your own attack damage and critical strike damage by 6%. Critiquing an enemy removes 1 stack, or the stacks disappear after 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Gentle Breeze</font>: When critiquing or being critiqued, gain 1 stack of "Gentle Breeze", reducing the damage taken from critical strikes by 7% for 15 seconds. Each time you critique or are critiqued, gain 1 additional stack, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. (Stacks do not increase duration and the effect ends when entering a resting state.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Energetic</font>: When "Gentle Breeze" ends, gain an effect corresponding to the number of stacks removed. Each stack increases your own attack damage and critical strike damage by 7%. Critiquing an enemy removes 1 stack, or they disappear after 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Gentle Breeze</font>: When critiquing or being critiqued, gain 1 stack of "Gentle Breeze", reducing the damage taken from critical strikes by 8% for 15 seconds. Each time you critique or are critiqued, gain 1 additional stack, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. (Stacks do not increase duration and the effect ends when entering a resting state.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Energetic</font>: When "Gentle Breeze" ends, gain the corresponding number of stacks for the effects, increasing your own attack damage and critical strike damage by 8% for each stack. Critiquing an enemy removes 1 stack, or they disappear after 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_005_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Gentle Breeze</font>: When critiquing or being critiqued, gain 1 stack of "Gentle Breeze", reducing damage taken from critical hits by 10% for 15 seconds. Each time you critique or are critiqued, gain 1 additional stack, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. (Stacks do not increase duration and effect ends when entering rest mode.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Energetic</font>: When "Gentle Breeze" ends, gain an effect corresponding to the number of stacks removed. Each stack increases your attack damage and critical hit damage by 10%. Critiquing an enemy removes 1 stack, or they disappear after 10 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Ethereal Spirit</font>: If "Energetic" ends normally, each stack that was not consumed can reduce the rest time of "Gentle Breeze" by 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_1_ngtips=Each attack has a chance to infuse internal energy into the target, planting the "Kunlun Force" on them. This creates a Kunlun connection between the two parties, making it impossible for the target to escape one's control for 10 seconds. (The closer the attack is to the target, the higher the chance of triggering) <br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Force</font>: Inflicts Yin damage and reduces movement speed by 30% per second; there is also a chance to extend the duration of "Kunlun Force" by 1 second when inflicting damage. <br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Connection: Transforming Force into Qi</font>: While the connection is active, it continuously restores one's own health and energy.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_2_ngtips=Each attack has a chance to infuse internal energy into the target, planting the "Kunlun Force" on them. This creates a Kunlun connection between the two parties, making it impossible for the target to escape one's control for 10 seconds. (The closer the attack is to the target, the higher the chance of triggering) <br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Force</font>: Inflicts Yin damage and reduces movement speed by 35% per second; there is also a chance to extend the duration of "Kunlun Force" by 1 second while inflicting damage. <br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Connection: Transforming Force into Qi</font>: While the connection is active, it continuously restores one's own health and energy.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_3_ngtips=Each attack has a chance to infuse internal force into the target, planting the "Kunlun Force" on them. This creates a Kunlun connection between the two parties, making it impossible for the target to escape one's control for 10 seconds. (The closer the attack is to the target, the higher the chance of triggering) <br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Force</font>: Causes Yin damage and slows the target by 40% per second; there is also a chance to extend the duration of "Kunlun Force" by 1 second while causing damage. <br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Connection: Transforming Force into Qi</font>: While the connection is active, it continuously restores one's own health and energy. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Kunlun Connection: Caught Between Advance and Retreat</font>: When the distance between the two parties is greater than 12 meters, the Kunlun connection is broken and the target suffers a one-time damage.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_4_ngtips=Each attack has a chance to infuse internal energy into the target, planting the "Kunlun Force" on them. This creates a Kunlun connection between the two parties, making it impossible for the target to escape one's control for 10 seconds. (The closer the attack is to the target, the higher the chance of triggering.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Force</font>: Causes Yin damage and slows the target by 45% per second; there is also a chance to extend the duration of "Kunlun Force" by 2 seconds while dealing damage. <br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Connection: Transforming Force into Qi</font>: While the connection is active, it continuously restores one's own health and energy. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Kunlun Connection: Caught Between Advance and Retreat</font>: When the distance between the two parties is greater than 12 meters, the Kunlun connection is broken and the target receives a one-time damage; when the distance is less than 4 meters, the target is immobilized.
desc_buf_ng_kl_006_5_ngtips=Each attack has a chance to infuse internal energy into the target, planting the "Kunlun Force" on them. This creates a Kunlun trigger between the two parties, making it impossible for the target to escape one's control for 10 seconds. (The closer the attack is to the target, the higher the chance of triggering.) <br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Force</font>: Causes Yin damage and slows the target by 50% per second; there is also a chance to extend the duration of "Kunlun Force" by 2 seconds while causing damage. <br><font color="#FF3030">Kunlun Trigger · Transforming Force into Qi</font>: While the trigger is active, it continuously restores one's own health and energy. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Kunlun Trigger · Caught Between Advance and Retreat</font>: When the distance between the two parties is greater than 12 meters, the Kunlun trigger becomes ineffective and the target receives a one-time damage and is stunned for 3 seconds; when the distance is less than 4 meters, the target is immobilized.
tip_model_preview_1=Clicking Alt + Left Click allows for a quick preview of the appearance.
desc_buf_ng_gb_101_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Shattering Stone</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to increase self's defense reduction ignore by 30% and all attack damage by 10% for 15 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Burning Moon Returns</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to deal additional yang damage to the target and reduce the cooldown of Shattering Stone by 4 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Heavenly Breaker</font>: When being attacked, there is a certain chance to remove some attack effects on the opponent, such as additional damage and defense reduction ignore, which directly or indirectly enhance damage, and reduce their damage by 30% for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_mj_101_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Overturning the sea with one hand</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to add 299 points of (additional 30% damage when on the ground) yang damage within 9 seconds (cooldown time of 20 seconds, maximum of 8 additional damage); <br><font color="#9932CD">Flipping the sky with one hand</font>: When hit, there is a certain chance to absorb 15% of maximum health damage within 5 seconds (cooldown time of 25 seconds); <br><font color="#CFB53B">Moving the sky and burning the sea</font>: If "Overturning the sea with one hand" is triggered and "Flipping the sky with one hand" has been triggered within 25 seconds, then the damage of all moves will increase by 15% and all defense reductions will be ignored by 15% for 9 seconds. If "Flipping the sky with one hand" is triggered and "Overturning the sea with one hand" has been triggered within 20 seconds, then all defense will increase by 50% for 10 seconds (decreasing by 10% every 2 seconds, no decrease when on the ground).
desc_buf_ng_wd_101_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Transforming Chi</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to convert 30% of the damage into internal energy and restore a certain amount of health.<br><font color="#9932CD">Guiding Chi</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to redirect and reduce 30% of the damage, while also causing a certain amount of soft damage to the opponent.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Form of Taichi</font>: When "Transforming Chi" and "Guiding Chi" are triggered, all of the user's attacks will have a 10% increase in damage, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. The stacks will be removed after attacking and last for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_gb_101_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Shattering Stone</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to increase self's defense reduction ignore by 30% and all attack damage by 10% for 15 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Burning Moon Returns</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to deal additional yang damage to the target and reduce the cooldown of Shattering Stone by 4 seconds. <br><font color="#CFB53B">Heavenly Breaker</font>: When being attacked, there is a certain chance to remove some attack effects on the opponent, such as additional damage and defense reduction ignore, which directly or indirectly enhance damage, and reduce their damage by 30% for 10 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_mj_101_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Overturning the sea with one hand</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to add 299 points of (additional 30% damage when on the ground) yang damage within 9 seconds (cooldown time of 20 seconds, maximum of 8 additional damage); <br><font color="#9932CD">Flipping the sky with one hand</font>: When hit, there is a certain chance to absorb 15% of maximum health damage within 5 seconds (cooldown time of 25 seconds); <br><font color="#CFB53B">Moving the sky and burning the sea</font>: If "Overturning the sea with one hand" is triggered and "Flipping the sky with one hand" has been triggered within 25 seconds, then the damage of all moves will increase by 15% and all defense reductions will be ignored by 15% for 9 seconds. If "Flipping the sky with one hand" is triggered and "Overturning the sea with one hand" has been triggered within 20 seconds, then all defense will increase by 50% for 10 seconds (decreasing by 10% every 2 seconds, no decrease when on the ground).
desc_buf_ng_wd_101_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Transforming Chi</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to convert 30% of the damage into internal energy and restore a certain amount of health.<br><font color="#9932CD">Guiding Chi</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to redirect and reduce 30% of the damage, while also causing a certain amount of soft damage to the opponent.<br><font color="#CFB53B">Form of Taichi</font>: When "Transforming Chi" and "Guiding Chi" are triggered, all of the user's attacks will have a 10% increase in damage, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. The stacks will be removed after attacking and last for 10 seconds.
