tip_equipmodel_42=<font color1="#00BFFF">School Talisman - Endless Sea Pavilion</font>
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Floating Clouds</font>: Has a chance to gain the "Floating Clouds" status for 5 seconds when attacked: Increases own movement speed by 12%. If attacked again while under the "Floating Clouds" status, restores 48 (affected by internal and melee power) health points up to 5 times.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Walk</font>: Has a chance to gain the "Cloud Walk" status for 6 seconds when attacked: Increases movement speed by 15%, and if attacked again while under the "Cloud Walk" status, restores 65 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times).
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Walk</font>: Has a chance to gain the "Cloud Walk" status for 7 seconds when attacked: Increases movement speed by 20%, and if attacked again while under the "Cloud Walk" status, restores 82 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times).
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Drifting</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to gain the "Cloud Drifting" status for 8 seconds: increases own movement speed by 24%. If attacked again while under the "Cloud Drifting" status, restores 100 (affected by internal and melee power) health points up to 5 times.<br><font color="#9932CD">Dragon's Fury</font>: If the "Cloud Drifting" status is active or within 10 seconds after it ends, launching another attack will grant the "Dragon's Fury" status for 8 seconds: increases own attack damage by 17%. (Can only be triggered once after each "Cloud Drifting" status)
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_001_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Cloud Drifting</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to gain the "Cloud Drifting" status for 10 seconds: increases movement speed by 30%, and being attacked again during this status will restore 119 (affected by internal and melee power) health points (up to 5 times). <br><font color="#9932CD">Dragon's Fury</font>: If the "Cloud Drifting" status is active or within 10 seconds after it ends, attacking again will grant the "Dragon's Fury" status for 10 seconds: increases damage of attacks by 20%. (Can only be triggered once after each "Cloud Drifting" status)
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_1_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew Nourishment</font>: When attacked, there is a chance to gain the "Spring Dew Nourishment" status, which restores 1% of health per second for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost Intensity</font>: When attacking, there is a chance to gain the "Autumn Frost Intensity" status, which increases damage of attacks by 10% for 5 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_2_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew</font>: When attacked, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Spring Dew" state, which restores 1% of health per second for 6 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost</font>: When attacking, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Autumn Frost" state, which increases the damage of moves by 12% for 6 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_3_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew</font>: When attacked, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Spring Dew" state, which restores 1% of health per second for 7 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost</font>: When attacking, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Autumn Frost" state, which increases the damage of moves by 14% for 7 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_4_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew Boost</font>: When attacked, there is a certain chance to gain the "Spring Dew Boost" status, restoring 1% of health per second for 8 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost Fury</font>: When attacking, there is a certain chance to gain the "Autumn Frost Fury" status, increasing attack damage by 16% for 8 seconds.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_5_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew</font>: When attacked, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Spring Dew" state, which restores 1.5% of health per second for 10 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost</font>: When attacking, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Autumn Frost" state, which increases damage by 20% for 10 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Spring Dew and Autumn Frost</font>: When both "Spring Dew" and "Autumn Frost" are active, being attacked will add the "Spring Dew·Enemy" state to the enemy: reduces damage by 20% (up to 10 seconds, removed when "Spring Dew" or "Autumn Frost" on self disappears), and "Autumn Frost" also gains an additional 10% life steal when attacking.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_6_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew</font>: When attacked, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Spring Dew" state, which restores 1.5% of health per second for 12 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost</font>: When attacking, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Autumn Frost" state, which increases damage by 24% for 12 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Spring Dew and Autumn Frost</font>: When both "Spring Dew" and "Autumn Frost" are active, being attacked will add the "Spring Dew·Enemy" state to the enemy: reduces damage by 24% (up to 12 seconds, removed when "Spring Dew" or "Autumn Frost" on self disappears), and "Autumn Frost" also grants an additional 12% lifesteal when attacking.
desc_buf_ng_tyhg_002_7_ngtips=<font color="#FF3030">Spring Dew</font>: When attacked, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Spring Dew" state, which restores 1.5% of health per second for 15 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Autumn Frost</font>: When attacking, there is a certain probability of gaining the "Autumn Frost" state, which increases damage by 30% for 15 seconds. <br><font color="#9932CD">Spring Dew and Autumn Frost</font>: When both "Spring Dew" and "Autumn Frost" are active, being attacked will add the "Spring Dew - Enemy" state to the enemy, reducing damage by 30% (up to 15 seconds, removed when "Spring Dew" or "Autumn Frost" on self disappears), and "Autumn Frost" will also heal an additional 15% when attacking.
tips_card_equip_pos_9=You can use a different Lore for your <font color="#ffff00">Mount</font> here.
