tips_jyz_count_sl_3_1_0=When the player has reached Level Outstanding, a mission can be obtained from his own school. Only one mission per person. After the task is completed, you will receive a rare title.<br/>Messenger location: <br/>Shaolin: (820,360)<br/>Wudang: (479,332)<br/>Emei: (489,133)<br/>Beggar's Sect: (554,338)<br/>Tangmen: (1087,-161)<br/>Scholar's Academy: (527,457)<br/>Royal Guards: (352,-115)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (89,-23)<br/>Ming Cult: (-4 240)<br/>Tianshan: (1262 946)
tips_jyz_count_sl_3_1_1=When the player has reached Level Outstanding, a mission can be obtained from his own school. Only one mission per person. After the task is completed, you will receive a rare title.<br/>Messenger location: <br/>Shaolin: (820,360)<br/>Wudang: (479,332)<br/>Emei: (489,133)<br/>Beggar's Sect: (554,338)<br/>Tangmen: (1087,-161)<br/>Scholar's Academy: (527,457)<br/>Royal Guards: (352,-115)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (89,-23)<br/>Ming Cult: (-4 240)<br/>Tianshan: (1262 946)
