tip_smsy_time_01_0=School instruction preparation period: Before countdown ends, players can go to a school instructor to sign up for the activity. You can find school instructors at: <br/>Chengdu (836,673)<br/>Luoyang: (1310,404)<br/>Shaolin: (861,442)<br/>Wudang: (493,279)<br/>Emei: (631,305)<br/>Beggar's Sect: (529,414)<br/>Tangmen: (1064,-21)<br/>Scholars: (658,294)<br/>Royal Guards: (248,-74)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (142,-40)<br/>Ming Cult: (-234,-173)<br/>Tianshan Sect: (1281,352)
tip_smsy_time_01_1=School instruction preparation period: Before countdown ends, players can go to a school instructor to sign up for the activity. You can find school instructors at: <br/>Chengdu (836,673)<br/>Luoyang: (1310,404)<br/>Shaolin: (861,442)<br/>Wudang: (493,279)<br/>Emei: (631,305)<br/>Beggar's Sect: (529,414)<br/>Tangmen: (1064,-21)<br/>Scholars: (658,294)<br/>Royal Guards: (248,-74)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (142,-40)<br/>Ming Cult: (-234,-173)<br/>Tianshan Sect: (1281,352)
tip_smsy_time_02_0=School instruction practice period: Before countdown ends, successful key-pressing grants score and experience conversion. While practice is in session, school instruction is not available for sign-up. The coordinates of the corresponding instructors are as follows: <br/>Chengdu (836,673)<br/>Luoyang: (1310,404)<br/>Shaolin: (861,442)<br/>Wudang: (493,279)<br/>Emei: (631,305)<br/>Beggars: (614,259)<br/>Tangmen: (1064,-21)<br/>Scholars: (658,294)<br/>Royal Guards: (248,-74)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (142,-40)<br/>Ming Cult: (-234,-173)<br/>Tianshan Sect: (1281,352)
tip_smsy_time_02_1=School instruction practice period: Before countdown ends, successful key-pressing grants score and experience conversion. While practice is in session, school instruction is not available for sign-up. The coordinates of the corresponding instructors are as follows: <br/>Chengdu (836,673)<br/>Luoyang: (1310,404)<br/>Shaolin: (861,442)<br/>Wudang: (493,279)<br/>Emei: (631,305)<br/>Beggars: (614,259)<br/>Tangmen: (1064,-21)<br/>Scholars: (658,294)<br/>Royal Guards: (248,-74)<br/>Wanderer's Valley: (142,-40)<br/>Ming Cult: (-234,-173)<br/>Tianshan Sect: (1281,352)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_1_0=When your power is Flows with Chi, you can go to your School and obtain an invitation card. You can then give the invitation card to Second Yan in Jinling, and join a Jianghu faction seeking to rescue Ding Jiuzhong. Each person can only accept one task. You participate in Gather Bandits in the Mountains and make donations only after you have accepted a task and joined a faction. You can still continue to accept tasks after you have a full score. The task will be automatically concluded after the "Gather Bandits in the Mountains" affair is completed. (Recommended that players play individually. <font color="#ff1cae" >Because this task cannot be completed after the conclusion of "Gather Bandits in the Mountains", we recommend that you complete this task first</font>.) <br/>Coordinates of invitation card NPCs: <br/>Shaolin: (820 360), <br/>Wudang: (479 332), <br/>Emei: (489 133), <br/>Beggar's Sect: (554 338), <br/>Tangmen: (1087 -161), <br/>Scholars: (527 457), <br/>Royal Guards: (352 -115), <br/>Wanderer's Valley: (89 -23)<br/>Ming Cult: (-4 241)<br/>Tianshan Sect: (1262 951)
tips_jyz_count_sl_4_1_1=When your power is Flows with Chi, you can go to your School and obtain an invitation card. You can then give the invitation card to Second Yan in Jinling, and join a Jianghu faction seeking to rescue Ding Jiuzhong. Each person can only accept one task. You participate in Gather Bandits in the Mountains and make donations only after you have accepted a task and joined a faction. You can still continue to accept tasks after you have a full score. The task will be automatically concluded after the "Gather Bandits in the Mountains" affair is completed. (Recommended that players play individually. <font color="#ff1cae" >Because this task cannot be completed after the conclusion of "Gather Bandits in the Mountains", we recommend that you complete this task first</font>.) <br/>Coordinates of invitation card NPCs: <br/>Shaolin: (820 360), <br/>Wudang: (479 332), <br/>Emei: (489 133), <br/>Beggar's Sect: (554 338), <br/>Tangmen: (1087 -161), <br/>Scholars: (527 457), <br/>Royal Guards: (352 -115), <br/>Wanderer's Valley: (89 -23)<br/>Ming Cult: (-4 241)<br/>Tianshan Sect: (1262 951)
tips_wywl_time_01=Foreign Experts are going to the ten schools. Please help. <br><font color="#FF3030">To unlock phase 3, you must defend Shaolin, Wudang, Royal Guards, and Wanderer's Valley successfully. </font>
tips_eqp_shoes_02_1=When being attacked, there's a chance to be immune to the restrained effects of some traps for 8 seconds. This can be triggered once for a while.
